(255656, 17477, 6202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Did you happen to use a filter or was it just one of those wonderful pink and blue sunsets?  It''s a perfect 10.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Did you happen to use a filter or was it just one of those wonderful pink and blue sunsets?  It''s a perfect 10.', '2003-04-07 01:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
