(255667, 17364, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Colors are vivid with nice composition.  Very good idea.  The only thing I don''t like is that I think the border is a bit too wide and distracts.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Colors are vivid with nice composition.  Very good idea.  The only thing I don''t like is that I think the border is a bit too wide and distracts.', '2003-04-07 01:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
