(255681, 17053, 1360, '<td valign="top">Absolutely original.  I really like this, even though I think it won;t do too well in the challenge.  My only real beef is the dark spot on the lower right that should have been cropped.  8.</td>', 'Absolutely original.  I really like this, even though I think it won;t do too well in the challenge.  My only real beef is the dark spot on the lower right that should have been cropped.  8.', '2003-04-07 01:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
