(255688, 17258, 3607, '<td valign="top">really very cute, but even if this was a pet photo challenge i think the photo would be just okay.  you have a great subject, but with the background at an odd angle, the comforter the puppy is sitting on distracts from the dog, and (most importantly) the lack of importance of color in the photo, it falls just too short of the objectives of the challenge.</td>', 'really very cute, but even if this was a pet photo challenge i think the photo would be just okay.  you have a great subject, but with the background at an odd angle, the comforter the puppy is sitting on distracts from the dog, and (most importantly) the lack of importance of color in the photo, it falls just too short of the objectives of the challenge.', '2003-04-07 02:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
