(256013, 17177, 6663, '<td valign="top">Rather more imaginitive than most of the (many) crayon shots I''ve seen so far this week; and well set up to boot. A cut above the norm. 7.</td>', 'Rather more imaginitive than most of the (many) crayon shots I''ve seen so far this week; and well set up to boot. A cut above the norm. 7.', '2003-04-07 07:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(256014, 17337, 6663, '<td valign="top">Only the second shot I''ve seen this week with colours this bright and clear. Excellent contrast of colours - something i''ve been looking for in my markings this week. 8, mostly on the strength of the colours alone.</td>', 'Only the second shot I''ve seen this week with colours this bright and clear. Excellent contrast of colours - something i''ve been looking for in my markings this week. 8, mostly on the strength of the colours alone.', '2003-04-07 07:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(256016, 17329, 6663, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - I''d be interested to know where this was taken! You''ve done very well in eradicating nearly all other colours from the shot - could have perhaps brought the blues out a little. The border is well-chosen; normally I''m not a fan of them but this is an exception. A very solid effort. 8.</td>', 'Lovely shot - I''d be interested to know where this was taken! You''ve done very well in eradicating nearly all other colours from the shot - could have perhaps brought the blues out a little. The border is well-chosen; normally I''m not a fan of them but this is an exception. A very solid effort. 8.', '2003-04-07 07:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(256018, 17258, 6663, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any real reference to the theme here.</td>', 'I don''t see any real reference to the theme here.', '2003-04-07 07:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(256019, 17461, 6663, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the theme - not many people this week (myself included) will have thought of using white as the colour - but it''s perfectly valid!</td>', 'An interesting take on the theme - not many people this week (myself included) will have thought of using white as the colour - but it''s perfectly valid!', '2003-04-07 07:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
