(256464, 16969, 3669, '<td valign="top">To me...it would have been better to have even lighting on the face to accentuate the colors.  In this case, there is harsh light causing shine on the right side of the face whereas it''s dark on the left.   ...Now that I look at it even closer and paid more attention to the title of your shot, I see the difference in eye color.  My question is...is this natural or caused from the lighting.  In any event, I still don''t like the uneven lighting.</td>', 'To me...it would have been better to have even lighting on the face to accentuate the colors.  In this case, there is harsh light causing shine on the right side of the face whereas it''s dark on the left.   ...Now that I look at it even closer and paid more attention to the title of your shot, I see the difference in eye color.  My question is...is this natural or caused from the lighting.  In any event, I still don''t like the uneven lighting.', '2003-04-07 12:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
