(257301, 17338, 4494, '<td valign="top">I can imagine how difficult it is to line them all up and hope they don''t roll during shooting. :)  Did you try to zoom on the middle instead?  Might be a little stronger.</td>', 'I can imagine how difficult it is to line them all up and hope they don''t roll during shooting. :)  Did you try to zoom on the middle instead?  Might be a little stronger.', '2003-04-07 18:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(257305, 17167, 4494, '<td valign="top">Good idea... I can barely tell the candles are colored... but you should have lit them from the front so it''s clear.  As it is, the pic isn''t very colorful.</td>', 'Good idea... I can barely tell the candles are colored... but you should have lit them from the front so it''s clear.  As it is, the pic isn''t very colorful.', '2003-04-07 18:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
