(257370, 17400, 4494, '<td valign="top">The face seems a little over exposed, although it does make for a nice contrast with the red background.  Did you do it on purpose, to give "red, white, and blue" as the theme?  If so, maybe a darker blue shirt would have worked better.  7.</td>', 'The face seems a little over exposed, although it does make for a nice contrast with the red background.  Did you do it on purpose, to give "red, white, and blue" as the theme?  If so, maybe a darker blue shirt would have worked better.  7.', '2003-04-07 18:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(257373, 16943, 4494, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors, I love them!!  You should have rotated the pic 180 degrees however, maybe.</td>', 'Excellent colors, I love them!!  You should have rotated the pic 180 degrees however, maybe.', '2003-04-07 18:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(257375, 17520, 3087, '<td valign="top"><b>Kavey Critique</b> <br/> <br/> <br/><b>Initial thoughts</b> <br/>I really like this  I find it very intrigueing.<br/> <br/><b>Composition/ Content</b> <br/>I think the composition here is superb  a very strong abstract  the curves of the glasses, the stems and that triangular area of blue below. Theyve been positioned very accurately in that sense.<br/>I also like the use of DPF to ensure that the nearest glass is most sharply focused.<br/>I love the way that the furthest glass is the same colour as the background  that adds very cleverly to the feeling of depth.<br/> <br/><b>Background</b> <br/>I like that it isnt all one colour in this image  the variation in tones of white and blue are very appealing.<br/> <br/><b>Camera Work - Technical</b> <br/>Looks great to me.<br/> <br/><b>Fits The Challenge</b> <br/>Very well.<br/> <br/><b>My Opinion On The Photo</b> <br/>I like this image very much and would certainly buy it on a postcard or greetings card.<br/></td>', 'Kavey Critique   Initial thoughts I really like this  I find it very intrigueing. Composition/ Content I think the composition here is superb  a very strong abstract  the curves of the glasses, the stems and that triangular area of blue below. Theyve been positioned very accurately in that sense.I also like the use of DPF to ensure that the nearest glass is most sharply focused.I love the way that the furthest glass is the same colour as the background  that adds very cleverly to the feeling of depth. Background I like that it isnt all one colour in this image  the variation in tones of white and blue are very appealing. Camera Work - Technical Looks great to me. Fits The Challenge Very well. My Opinion On The Photo I like this image very much and would certainly buy it on a postcard or greetings card.', '2003-04-07 18:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
