(257385, 16969, 4494, '<td valign="top">Gotta give a few points just for going through painting yourself/subject up like that!  Pretty good shot.</td>', 'Gotta give a few points just for going through painting yourself/subject up like that!  Pretty good shot.', '2003-04-07 18:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(257386, 17417, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract effect you have achieved here!  Not personally my favorite, but definitely draws the attention away from whatever the scene was and directs it simply to the color that is there... it meets the challenge quite well.  I think the shot may have been improved a bit if the bottom were cropped off slightly, removing the faint red ''smear'' and keeping the overall shot consistent.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract effect you have achieved here!  Not personally my favorite, but definitely draws the attention away from whatever the scene was and directs it simply to the color that is there... it meets the challenge quite well.  I think the shot may have been improved a bit if the bottom were cropped off slightly, removing the faint red ''smear'' and keeping the overall shot consistent.', '2003-04-07 18:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(257389, 17564, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect... pretty tough shot due to the potential over/under exposure of the lamp.  Might benefit from some additional external lighting to allow a shorter exposure time.</td>', 'Very interesting effect... pretty tough shot due to the potential over/under exposure of the lamp.  Might benefit from some additional external lighting to allow a shorter exposure time.', '2003-04-07 18:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(257391, 17559, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrasts between the dark green and the snow.  I found myself trying to turn my head to orient myself within the shot-- maybe a more shallow angle (it seems almost vertical) might be a better approach.</td>', 'Very nice contrasts between the dark green and the snow.  I found myself trying to turn my head to orient myself within the shot-- maybe a more shallow angle (it seems almost vertical) might be a better approach.', '2003-04-07 18:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(257395, 16784, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice, vibrant colors!  Definitely meets the challenge well.  Broader DOF might have served this shot better (in my opinion).</td>', 'Very nice, vibrant colors!  Definitely meets the challenge well.  Broader DOF might have served this shot better (in my opinion).', '2003-04-07 18:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(257396, 17353, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the subject.  A couple of things that might improve the shot (in my opinion) are to try to but the tree at such an angle that you can lighten the shot overall while cropping out (or avoiding entirely) the blown-out sky.  Perhaps a shot even from a slightly different angle that would show a better reflection...</td>', 'Nice approach to the subject.  A couple of things that might improve the shot (in my opinion) are to try to but the tree at such an angle that you can lighten the shot overall while cropping out (or avoiding entirely) the blown-out sky.  Perhaps a shot even from a slightly different angle that would show a better reflection...', '2003-04-07 18:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(257399, 17340, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect.  What did you use as a filter?  Decent approach to the challenge, but the colors of the border really detract from your overall shot, in my opinion.</td>', 'Very interesting effect.  What did you use as a filter?  Decent approach to the challenge, but the colors of the border really detract from your overall shot, in my opinion.', '2003-04-07 18:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(257400, 16864, 5865, '<td valign="top">I like the photograph and the colours are super, but the fence spoils the shot. It might have helped if you had closed in on a section of the overall scene.</td>', 'I like the photograph and the colours are super, but the fence spoils the shot. It might have helped if you had closed in on a section of the overall scene.', '2003-04-07 18:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(257402, 17329, 5865, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful composition.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful composition.', '2003-04-07 18:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(257404, 17265, 7033, '<td valign="top">Composition is quite interesting, visually, and the color contrast works well.  It appears as though there is perhaps some distortion in your lens (the top of the window is square with the rest of the frame, but the left edge and bottom are not) that detracts from the overall impact, in my opinion.  Overall, though, quite nicely done!</td>', 'Composition is quite interesting, visually, and the color contrast works well.  It appears as though there is perhaps some distortion in your lens (the top of the window is square with the rest of the frame, but the left edge and bottom are not) that detracts from the overall impact, in my opinion.  Overall, though, quite nicely done!', '2003-04-07 18:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(257405, 17581, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great idea!!  Maybe try cropping out the bottom 2 inches?  8.</td>', 'Great idea!!  Maybe try cropping out the bottom 2 inches?  8.', '2003-04-07 18:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
