(257410, 17448, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice lineup; line draws my eye across the frame very well.  I would recommend cropping out the spot at the lower left corner of the frame (lens flare?)-- spectators also draw away from the overall impact, as well.  Overall, though, quite nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice lineup; line draws my eye across the frame very well.  I would recommend cropping out the spot at the lower left corner of the frame (lens flare?)-- spectators also draw away from the overall impact, as well.  Overall, though, quite nicely done!', '2003-04-07 18:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
