(257681, 17167, 5120, '<td valign="top">I like your use of color here but I wish the darker colored candles showed up a little better.  I can barely see the color in the green, red and blue(?) candles.  I like the way the flames have those halos(?) around them.  That is a cool effect.  I think that a little lighting from somewhere behind the camera to one side might help this picture.  I think it would bring out the color of the darker candles and allow the table to show up a little so they dont appear to be floating in mid-air.  Overall I like the composition but I might have given a little more space on the top.  I think this is a strong picture and I am giving it a 6.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I like your use of color here but I wish the darker colored candles showed up a little better.  I can barely see the color in the green, red and blue(?) candles.  I like the way the flames have those halos(?) around them.  That is a cool effect.  I think that a little lighting from somewhere behind the camera to one side might help this picture.  I think it would bring out the color of the darker candles and allow the table to show up a little so they dont appear to be floating in mid-air.  Overall I like the composition but I might have given a little more space on the top.  I think this is a strong picture and I am giving it a 6. Greg', '2003-04-07 20:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
