(257767, 17403, 342, '<td valign="top">interesting the way the overehead light reflects off the billiard balls.</td>', 'interesting the way the overehead light reflects off the billiard balls.', '2003-04-07 21:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(257769, 17395, 342, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, to me natural colors such as this are the preetiest.</td>', 'Nice sunset, to me natural colors such as this are the preetiest.', '2003-04-07 21:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(257770, 16839, 5120, '<td valign="top">Are these straws?  This is a really cool idea I think but the focus seems to be a little off.  There also looks like there is a small white balance issue at work here.  I could be wrong about this but the white lids on the bottom of the picture are yellowish and I think the picture would look more natural if they were white.  The other things that I find distracting are the words and bar code behind the straws.  I would have also cropped out the blown out areas in the top of the photograph.  With a little work this picture could really be wonderful.  Keep up the good work -4<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Are these straws?  This is a really cool idea I think but the focus seems to be a little off.  There also looks like there is a small white balance issue at work here.  I could be wrong about this but the white lids on the bottom of the picture are yellowish and I think the picture would look more natural if they were white.  The other things that I find distracting are the words and bar code behind the straws.  I would have also cropped out the blown out areas in the top of the photograph.  With a little work this picture could really be wonderful.  Keep up the good work -4 Greg', '2003-04-07 21:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(257771, 17307, 342, '<td valign="top">I think the granuales of sugar are reflecting too much light and take away from the picture.</td>', 'I think the granuales of sugar are reflecting too much light and take away from the picture.', '2003-04-07 21:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(257773, 17481, 342, '<td valign="top">The candy seems to be a bit out of focus.  Also, you probably should have cropped this differently and filled the entire frame with the m''s</td>', 'The candy seems to be a bit out of focus.  Also, you probably should have cropped this differently and filled the entire frame with the m''s', '2003-04-07 21:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(257774, 17467, 6667, '<td valign="top">Did you ever consider cropping it to just the spray?  The distant branches are a distraction.  Love the contrast of the bark.</td>', 'Did you ever consider cropping it to just the spray?  The distant branches are a distraction.  Love the contrast of the bark.', '2003-04-07 21:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
