(257790, 17189, 7438, '<td valign="top">That''s exactly the sky I ordered last week - looks like it showed up at your house! No fair :)<br/>In short: I love the colors, but I would''ve cropped out the light blue color in the top left corner, giving the sky more weight. A closer crop from both top and bottom would''ve created a stronger doomsday ambience</td>', 'That''s exactly the sky I ordered last week - looks like it showed up at your house! No fair :)In short: I love the colors, but I would''ve cropped out the light blue color in the top left corner, giving the sky more weight. A closer crop from both top and bottom would''ve created a stronger doomsday ambience', '2003-04-07 21:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(257791, 17407, 2146, '<td valign="top">very pretty macro...nice color, love the water drops..</td>', 'very pretty macro...nice color, love the water drops..', '2003-04-07 21:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
