(257799, 17514, 2195, '<td valign="top">This would be a very nice photo if the green was not so over powering and what appears to be scratches in the center were not there. Nevertheless, the purple bubbles(?) are awesome and would make a great shot if they receded into the center. However, I''m sorry but I just can''t give you more than a 5</td>', 'This would be a very nice photo if the green was not so over powering and what appears to be scratches in the center were not there. Nevertheless, the purple bubbles(?) are awesome and would make a great shot if they receded into the center. However, I''m sorry but I just can''t give you more than a 5', '2003-04-07 21:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(257801, 17570, 7711, '<td valign="top">other than the fact that I might wish for a little more focus on the yellow guitar (though the softfocus has a nice appeal) I really adore this picture. Its like ying and yang, or the curves of two bodies fitting together perfectly. :)</td>', 'other than the fact that I might wish for a little more focus on the yellow guitar (though the softfocus has a nice appeal) I really adore this picture. Its like ying and yang, or the curves of two bodies fitting together perfectly. :)', '2003-04-07 21:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
