(257846, 17470, 5120, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice picture of a beautiful woman.  I like the composition and I like the use of negative space.  The lighting is great.  I dont, however believe that color is the dominant element in this photograph.  I think this photo does meet the challenge.  If the colors were a little more dramatic I think I would score it higher but as it is I am going to give it a 7.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This is a very nice picture of a beautiful woman.  I like the composition and I like the use of negative space.  The lighting is great.  I dont, however believe that color is the dominant element in this photograph.  I think this photo does meet the challenge.  If the colors were a little more dramatic I think I would score it higher but as it is I am going to give it a 7. Greg', '2003-04-07 22:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
