(257897, 17350, 5120, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture.  It holds my attention well and the color looks nice.  The orange shirt could stand to be a little more saturated but it isnt bad the way It is.  Focus looks nice and sharp and the contrast looks to be spot on.  I might offset the window to one side of the photo to strengthen the photo if it were mine.  Overall I think this picture is well done.  I gave it a 6<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This is an interesting picture.  It holds my attention well and the color looks nice.  The orange shirt could stand to be a little more saturated but it isnt bad the way It is.  Focus looks nice and sharp and the contrast looks to be spot on.  I might offset the window to one side of the photo to strengthen the photo if it were mine.  Overall I think this picture is well done.  I gave it a 6 Greg', '2003-04-07 22:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(257899, 17527, 7409, '<td valign="top">The shadow takes away from this shot</td>', 'The shadow takes away from this shot', '2003-04-07 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(257901, 17265, 3260, '<td valign="top">great colors!! LOVE IT.</td>', 'great colors!! LOVE IT.', '2003-04-07 22:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(257903, 17383, 6505, '<td valign="top">I guy from India told me that they have a word for the color (the breast) of a peacock.  Its not blue.  Actually, it looks alot like cobolt, but not exactly.  Anyway, i just thought i''d let you know.  The shot needs better focus.  Also the grass needs to be green and looks unatural.  I like the cropping.</td>', 'I guy from India told me that they have a word for the color (the breast) of a peacock.  Its not blue.  Actually, it looks alot like cobolt, but not exactly.  Anyway, i just thought i''d let you know.  The shot needs better focus.  Also the grass needs to be green and looks unatural.  I like the cropping.', '2003-04-07 22:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(257904, 17027, 5120, '<td valign="top">Wow those eyes!  I wonder if you could intensify the yellow channel to bring out the color a little more (but only because this is the color challenge).  The focus seems to be sharpest on the nose and not so much on the eyes.  I have found that the animal pictures that I like the best have the eyes in very sharp focus.  This picture might benefit from using a smaller aperture to increase the depth of field.  I think the composition is very good here, I really like the position and shape of the eyes.  I gave it a 6.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Wow those eyes!  I wonder if you could intensify the yellow channel to bring out the color a little more (but only because this is the color challenge).  The focus seems to be sharpest on the nose and not so much on the eyes.  I have found that the animal pictures that I like the best have the eyes in very sharp focus.  This picture might benefit from using a smaller aperture to increase the depth of field.  I think the composition is very good here, I really like the position and shape of the eyes.  I gave it a 6. Greg', '2003-04-07 22:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(257905, 17072, 7438, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The background is a bit mislit though. I''m not sure, but maybe a black background would suit it better?</td>', 'Interesting idea. The background is a bit mislit though. I''m not sure, but maybe a black background would suit it better?', '2003-04-07 23:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(257906, 17395, 5120, '<td valign="top">I was surprised that there werent more sunset pictures this week.  It looks like you made a good capture of a pretty sunset.  I think the composition is good and I like the exposure on the sky.  The problem with sunset pictures is that a lot of people do them and a lot of people do them very well.  This means that when you enter one it has to pretty much be spectacular in order to do very well.  I gave this one a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I was surprised that there werent more sunset pictures this week.  It looks like you made a good capture of a pretty sunset.  I think the composition is good and I like the exposure on the sky.  The problem with sunset pictures is that a lot of people do them and a lot of people do them very well.  This means that when you enter one it has to pretty much be spectacular in order to do very well.  I gave this one a 5. Greg', '2003-04-07 23:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
