(257941, 17319, 7385, '<td valign="top">If you would have fixed some of the brightness issues, it would have been a ribbon picture.</td>', 'If you would have fixed some of the brightness issues, it would have been a ribbon picture.', '2003-04-07 23:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(257943, 17313, 7639, '<td valign="top">Ah, the infinite variety in nature.</td>', 'Ah, the infinite variety in nature.', '2003-04-07 23:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(257945, 16932, 7639, '<td valign="top">Great feeling.</td>', 'Great feeling.', '2003-04-07 23:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(257946, 17123, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like the idea but the flowers are dying and the enitire image could use some saturation</td>', 'i like the idea but the flowers are dying and the enitire image could use some saturation', '2003-04-07 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(257947, 17189, 7385, '<td valign="top">cropping the dark undefined part at the bottom would have helped alot</td>', 'cropping the dark undefined part at the bottom would have helped alot', '2003-04-07 23:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(257949, 17215, 5120, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea, but I think I have seen something very similar in an earlier challenge.  It is definitely a clever idea.  You might try some sort of diffuser over your light source(s) in order to reduce the hot-spots on the cans.  The most critical one being on the Coke can.  I know this probably couldnt be prevented but I find the red area below the Pepsi can to be a little displeasing.  I am not sure if this is the case but it looks like there is some clipping in the highlights on the drop-cloth in the background.  For me these highlights detract from the photo.  You might have had better luck using a wider aperture to throw the background more out of focus.  I gave this one a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This is a cool idea, but I think I have seen something very similar in an earlier challenge.  It is definitely a clever idea.  You might try some sort of diffuser over your light source(s) in order to reduce the hot-spots on the cans.  The most critical one being on the Coke can.  I know this probably couldnt be prevented but I find the red area below the Pepsi can to be a little displeasing.  I am not sure if this is the case but it looks like there is some clipping in the highlights on the drop-cloth in the background.  For me these highlights detract from the photo.  You might have had better luck using a wider aperture to throw the background more out of focus.  I gave this one a 5. Greg', '2003-04-07 23:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(257952, 17319, 4388, '<td valign="top">the colors are not attractive although it is a nice exposure</td>', 'the colors are not attractive although it is a nice exposure', '2003-04-07 23:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(257953, 17430, 7385, '<td valign="top">The bottom could have been cropped to bring out the colours of the buildings</td>', 'The bottom could have been cropped to bring out the colours of the buildings', '2003-04-07 23:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(257955, 17133, 7639, '<td valign="top">Composition, color and detail outstanding.</td>', 'Composition, color and detail outstanding.', '2003-04-07 23:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(257957, 16956, 4388, '<td valign="top">a little soft for my taste but nice shot</td>', 'a little soft for my taste but nice shot', '2003-04-07 23:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(257959, 17306, 4388, '<td valign="top">the teeth marks in the yellow-gold crayon is distracting but nice composition and exposure<br/></td>', 'the teeth marks in the yellow-gold crayon is distracting but nice composition and exposure', '2003-04-07 23:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(257960, 17582, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like this shot, i wonder what it would look like on a black background.</td>', 'i like this shot, i wonder what it would look like on a black background.', '2003-04-07 23:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(257962, 17209, 5120, '<td valign="top">I like the color and DOF in this photo.  This looks like the kind of result I get when I use my 50mm f/1.8 lens wide open.  The out of focus areas are nice and smooth which is very pleasing to the eye.  I am not thrilled, however, by the dark area on the bottom right side of the photo.  It might work if you just cropped it out along with the OOF area on the top of the photo.  I think the subject is a little too centered for my taste.  You might run a light USM over this one to sharpen it up a little more.  I think this is a good effort and I gave it a 6.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I like the color and DOF in this photo.  This looks like the kind of result I get when I use my 50mm f/1.8 lens wide open.  The out of focus areas are nice and smooth which is very pleasing to the eye.  I am not thrilled, however, by the dark area on the bottom right side of the photo.  It might work if you just cropped it out along with the OOF area on the top of the photo.  I think the subject is a little too centered for my taste.  You might run a light USM over this one to sharpen it up a little more.  I think this is a good effort and I gave it a 6. Greg', '2003-04-07 23:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(257963, 17482, 7639, '<td valign="top">I like the lines leading to the horse.  Good cold feel.</td>', 'I like the lines leading to the horse.  Good cold feel.', '2003-04-07 23:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(257964, 17567, 4388, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a llittle low putting shadow on the subject, i would also probably have cropped more</td>', 'the lighting is a llittle low putting shadow on the subject, i would also probably have cropped more', '2003-04-07 23:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(257967, 17514, 4388, '<td valign="top">a little blown out in the center</td>', 'a little blown out in the center', '2003-04-07 23:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(257968, 17305, 7639, '<td valign="top">Powerful statement and georgeous.</td>', 'Powerful statement and georgeous.', '2003-04-07 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(257969, 17232, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice texture and colors</td>', 'nice texture and colors', '2003-04-07 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(257971, 17122, 4388, '<td valign="top">a litle too bright, need some post processing</td>', 'a litle too bright, need some post processing', '2003-04-07 23:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(257974, 17527, 4388, '<td valign="top">i would like to have seen more of the bottle they are in, it would help explain the yellowish green.</td>', 'i would like to have seen more of the bottle they are in, it would help explain the yellowish green.', '2003-04-07 23:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(257976, 17316, 5120, '<td valign="top">Great subject and the color plays a strong role in the picture so it meets the challenge well.  The cropping is a bit tight for me, I would love to see more of the airplane.  I would also suggest opening the lens up a stop or two to throw the celing out of focus.  The way it is now is somewhat distracting.  Good shot!  I gave it a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Great subject and the color plays a strong role in the picture so it meets the challenge well.  The cropping is a bit tight for me, I would love to see more of the airplane.  I would also suggest opening the lens up a stop or two to throw the celing out of focus.  The way it is now is somewhat distracting.  Good shot!  I gave it a 5. Greg', '2003-04-07 23:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(257979, 17350, 7639, '<td valign="top">I wish he weren''t looking into the lens.</td>', 'I wish he weren''t looking into the lens.', '2003-04-07 23:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
