(258066, 17300, 7033, '<td valign="top">This shot definitely has potential, but suffers from a lack of focus near each side, in my opinion.  It also seems to show some ''pincushion'' distortion, probably from the camera lens.  Great color overall, though!</td>', 'This shot definitely has potential, but suffers from a lack of focus near each side, in my opinion.  It also seems to show some ''pincushion'' distortion, probably from the camera lens.  Great color overall, though!', '2003-04-08 00:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(258073, 17588, 4388, '<td valign="top">the hills without the sign would have been a 9, the sign with the glare kills it.</td>', 'the hills without the sign would have been a 9, the sign with the glare kills it.', '2003-04-08 00:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(258074, 17137, 7033, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, and very well photographed!  I think the very faint pale blue in the background give a certain depth that might not otherwise be there if it were starkly white.  Blue vase is a nice touch.</td>', 'Beautiful color, and very well photographed!  I think the very faint pale blue in the background give a certain depth that might not otherwise be there if it were starkly white.  Blue vase is a nice touch.', '2003-04-08 00:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(258077, 17206, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice color overall; I like the use of the cloudless blue sky as a backdrop.  (Not sure your colour is the same as my color, though... :)  JK!<br/> <br/>I would have preferred either a very definite use of a shallow DOF (with a very clearly recognizable subject), or a broad DOF with all blossoms in focus.  Just my opinions, though!</td>', 'Very nice color overall; I like the use of the cloudless blue sky as a backdrop.  (Not sure your colour is the same as my color, though... :)  JK! I would have preferred either a very definite use of a shallow DOF (with a very clearly recognizable subject), or a broad DOF with all blossoms in focus.  Just my opinions, though!', '2003-04-08 00:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(258078, 17193, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like the idea but it''s just a little too much high key for a color challenge.</td>', 'i like the idea but it''s just a little too much high key for a color challenge.', '2003-04-08 00:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(258080, 17293, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, almost totally abstract approach... Color is definitely the focus of this shot!  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very interesting, almost totally abstract approach... Color is definitely the focus of this shot!  Nicely done!', '2003-04-08 00:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(258081, 17337, 3320, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but .. colors are way too saturated .. whites are blown out and the res are totally saturated .. too much for me.</td>', 'Nice concept but .. colors are way too saturated .. whites are blown out and the res are totally saturated .. too much for me.', '2003-04-08 00:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(258084, 17367, 7033, '<td valign="top">Are you certain that shouldn''t be color?  Without the "u" :-)  Seriously, now... I''m not certain whether it is simply the lighting, or what, but this shot seems a bit too two-dimensional to me.  The fruit just doesnt''t seem to ''pop'' out of the photo.  Perhaps a softer (maybe fluorescent, no flash) lighting might help you capture some additional depth and dimension, while also eliminating the individual shadows.</td>', 'Are you certain that shouldn''t be color?  Without the "u" :-)  Seriously, now... I''m not certain whether it is simply the lighting, or what, but this shot seems a bit too two-dimensional to me.  The fruit just doesnt''t seem to ''pop'' out of the photo.  Perhaps a softer (maybe fluorescent, no flash) lighting might help you capture some additional depth and dimension, while also eliminating the individual shadows.', '2003-04-08 00:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(258085, 17209, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot!  The shallow DOF works very well to draw my attention to the central subject; I also like the almost pink hue imparted to the entire shot (intentionally or not).  Well done!</td>', 'Very beautiful shot!  The shallow DOF works very well to draw my attention to the central subject; I also like the almost pink hue imparted to the entire shot (intentionally or not).  Well done!', '2003-04-08 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(258086, 16914, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nice job with the desaturation of this shot!  (I have tried to do similar shots, but have not had very good results...)</td>', 'Very nice job with the desaturation of this shot!  (I have tried to do similar shots, but have not had very good results...)', '2003-04-08 00:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(258087, 17408, 7751, '<td valign="top">I thought this picture was really clever with your title. I wish I could see more of the rainbow in this picture. I like the lighting of the rainbow, it almost glows against the background of the sky.</td>', 'I thought this picture was really clever with your title. I wish I could see more of the rainbow in this picture. I like the lighting of the rainbow, it almost glows against the background of the sky.', '2003-04-08 00:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(258088, 17277, 7033, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to the subject; I like the very dark background in contrast to the brighter colors.  In my opinion, I think the green candy heart should also have been in sharper focus.  Quite nicely done!</td>', 'Interesting approach to the subject; I like the very dark background in contrast to the brighter colors.  In my opinion, I think the green candy heart should also have been in sharper focus.  Quite nicely done!', '2003-04-08 00:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(258091, 17401, 7751, '<td valign="top">I am a big purple fan, so I really like this picture. The green and purple together, really makes this photo stand out.</td>', 'I am a big purple fan, so I really like this picture. The green and purple together, really makes this photo stand out.', '2003-04-08 00:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(258092, 16876, 7033, '<td valign="top">Not sure what effects you used here, but it imparts an almost surreal feeling to the shot.  Tight DOF works well, too.</td>', 'Not sure what effects you used here, but it imparts an almost surreal feeling to the shot.  Tight DOF works well, too.', '2003-04-08 00:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(258093, 17556, 7033, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love the deep color and the rich detail in this shot.  You have captured it very well!  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Wow!  I love the deep color and the rich detail in this shot.  You have captured it very well!  Very nicely done!', '2003-04-08 00:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
