(258103, 17425, 7751, '<td valign="top">The color in that tomato is incredible. Very beautiful. I would have like to have seen the center circle pattern fully. It is cropped at the bottom, and it kind of throws it off. Great pic.</td>', 'The color in that tomato is incredible. Very beautiful. I would have like to have seen the center circle pattern fully. It is cropped at the bottom, and it kind of throws it off. Great pic.', '2003-04-08 00:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(258104, 17591, 7033, '<td valign="top">I love the rich, saturated colors in this shot!  That said, the DOF is a bit shallow for my tastes... I like the idea of having just the center in focus, but think that the severely unfocused portion of the picture detracts from the overall shot.  Just my opinions, though.... take them for what they''re worth.</td>', 'I love the rich, saturated colors in this shot!  That said, the DOF is a bit shallow for my tastes... I like the idea of having just the center in focus, but think that the severely unfocused portion of the picture detracts from the overall shot.  Just my opinions, though.... take them for what they''re worth.', '2003-04-08 00:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(258105, 17474, 7751, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. I think it looks like a painting somehow. Great lighting, and I like the background...it is kinda fuzzy, giving it a much softer and delicate look. The bottom left is a little bright. Like I said, this is awesome.</td>', 'This is awesome. I think it looks like a painting somehow. Great lighting, and I like the background...it is kinda fuzzy, giving it a much softer and delicate look. The bottom left is a little bright. Like I said, this is awesome.', '2003-04-08 00:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(258106, 17040, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I LOVE the refraction of the background through the glasses.</td>', 'Great shot!  I LOVE the refraction of the background through the glasses.', '2003-04-08 00:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(258111, 17408, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Overall tonal range of this shot works very well with the muted colors in the rainbow.  Only distraction is the power line (not that there''s much you could have done about it anyway... )</td>', 'Great capture!  Overall tonal range of this shot works very well with the muted colors in the rainbow.  Only distraction is the power line (not that there''s much you could have done about it anyway... )', '2003-04-08 01:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
