(258263, 17521, 7067, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo subject but it would do better if it was larger.  I''d also like to see more sky and less of the top of the building cropped.  Lighting on the tulips seems a little harsh.  Shooting when the sun is lower in the sky or if the sun is covered by a cloud would soften the light.</td>', 'This is a good photo subject but it would do better if it was larger.  I''d also like to see more sky and less of the top of the building cropped.  Lighting on the tulips seems a little harsh.  Shooting when the sun is lower in the sky or if the sun is covered by a cloud would soften the light.', '2003-04-08 03:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
