(258275, 17430, 7067, '<td valign="top">Very colourful houses.  To give this photograph more oomph, I would competely crop out the bottom half of this picutre, as it adds nothing to the photograph, and brighten and increase the contrast (either in camera or with use of an imaging program like Photoshop) so that the colours of the houses stand out more vividly.</td>', 'Very colourful houses.  To give this photograph more oomph, I would competely crop out the bottom half of this picutre, as it adds nothing to the photograph, and brighten and increase the contrast (either in camera or with use of an imaging program like Photoshop) so that the colours of the houses stand out more vividly.', '2003-04-08 03:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(258276, 17301, 7510, '<td valign="top">Something just doesn''t sit right with this photo compared to the other similar subjects.  I think it has to do with how the pencils lead into the photo.  Or maybe too much symmetry.</td>', 'Something just doesn''t sit right with this photo compared to the other similar subjects.  I think it has to do with how the pencils lead into the photo.  Or maybe too much symmetry.', '2003-04-08 03:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(258277, 17189, 7067, '<td valign="top">This is a hard photograph to take because of the great variance in light and dark.  The bottom half of the photo is either too dark to make out the houses or too light to serve as a silhouette.  The visible sky is too washed out towards the left side of the picture.  And the colours of the clouds seem almost too intense.</td>', 'This is a hard photograph to take because of the great variance in light and dark.  The bottom half of the photo is either too dark to make out the houses or too light to serve as a silhouette.  The visible sky is too washed out towards the left side of the picture.  And the colours of the clouds seem almost too intense.', '2003-04-08 03:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(258278, 16945, 7067, '<td valign="top">They look so squeaky shiny clean!  Interesting idea.</td>', 'They look so squeaky shiny clean!  Interesting idea.', '2003-04-08 03:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(258279, 17466, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the framing.  The boarder is nice but looks alittle uneven.  It is a beautiful flower, but would look better if the whole flower was in focus.</td>', 'I like the colors and the framing.  The boarder is nice but looks alittle uneven.  It is a beautiful flower, but would look better if the whole flower was in focus.', '2003-04-08 03:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(258280, 17268, 7067, '<td valign="top">Why an orange background?  I think a white or black background would bring out the colours of the pencilcrayons better.</td>', 'Why an orange background?  I think a white or black background would bring out the colours of the pencilcrayons better.', '2003-04-08 03:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(258281, 17404, 7067, '<td valign="top">Too much reflection.  What instrument is this?  Tuba?  Trombone?  You got me puzzled.</td>', 'Too much reflection.  What instrument is this?  Tuba?  Trombone?  You got me puzzled.', '2003-04-08 03:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(258282, 17331, 7510, '<td valign="top">Make it brighter, I think.  There seems to be a little noise in the C.</td>', 'Make it brighter, I think.  There seems to be a little noise in the C.', '2003-04-08 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(258283, 17353, 7510, '<td valign="top">The tree is too small.</td>', 'The tree is too small.', '2003-04-08 03:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(258284, 17259, 7510, '<td valign="top">The low res, or high compression (or what ever you used) makes an interesting effect.  What is the yellow spot?</td>', 'The low res, or high compression (or what ever you used) makes an interesting effect.  What is the yellow spot?', '2003-04-08 03:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(258285, 17206, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like the focus.  Cool background.</td>', 'I like the focus.  Cool background.', '2003-04-08 03:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(258287, 17471, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice texture.  I like the colors.</td>', 'Nice texture.  I like the colors.', '2003-04-08 03:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(258288, 17407, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  I like to look of the water.  Too bad the tip of the flower (whatever you call the thing) is out of focus.   Also that brown thing top right of the folwer takes away some.</td>', 'Nice subject.  I like to look of the water.  Too bad the tip of the flower (whatever you call the thing) is out of focus.   Also that brown thing top right of the folwer takes away some.', '2003-04-08 03:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(258289, 17363, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice collage.</td>', 'Nice collage.', '2003-04-08 03:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(258290, 17408, 7510, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing to look at.  I like the rainbow in the overcast sky.</td>', 'Very pleasing to look at.  I like the rainbow in the overcast sky.', '2003-04-08 03:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(258291, 17342, 7510, '<td valign="top">Could be straighter, but nice.</td>', 'Could be straighter, but nice.', '2003-04-08 03:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(258292, 17228, 7510, '<td valign="top">The building draws away from the image.  More color depth if posible would look nicer.  Maybe a boarder on this one.</td>', 'The building draws away from the image.  More color depth if posible would look nicer.  Maybe a boarder on this one.', '2003-04-08 03:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(258293, 17316, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the subject.  I think it would be nice to see a little more of the ''face'' (mouth) towards the right.</td>', 'I like the color and the subject.  I think it would be nice to see a little more of the ''face'' (mouth) towards the right.', '2003-04-08 03:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(258294, 17430, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the buildings and the sky.  The green forground is nice but the muddy brown takes away, so I would have cropped this one nearly in half.</td>', 'I like the color of the buildings and the sky.  The green forground is nice but the muddy brown takes away, so I would have cropped this one nearly in half.', '2003-04-08 03:56:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(258295, 17361, 7510, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft.  The dirt/hair on the lighters distract.  I like the flare on teh top.  Good framing and boarder.</td>', 'Seems a little soft.  The dirt/hair on the lighters distract.  I like the flare on teh top.  Good framing and boarder.', '2003-04-08 03:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(258297, 17487, 7067, '<td valign="top">There are several problems with this image: it is too bright; the date on the bottom is a big no-no; it should be cropped to show only the house and not the distracting irrelevant background; and the photo should have been taken in front of the stairs so that all horizontal lines of the house are parallel, unless you are trying to achieve a photo with more of a perspective view on the house.  Good choice for colour though.</td>', 'There are several problems with this image: it is too bright; the date on the bottom is a big no-no; it should be cropped to show only the house and not the distracting irrelevant background; and the photo should have been taken in front of the stairs so that all horizontal lines of the house are parallel, unless you are trying to achieve a photo with more of a perspective view on the house.  Good choice for colour though.', '2003-04-08 04:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(258298, 17209, 7510, '<td valign="top">All that pick takes away from the contrast.</td>', 'All that pick takes away from the contrast.', '2003-04-08 04:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(258299, 16992, 7067, '<td valign="top">Yummy!  Please send them my way ;-)  Colours are a tad muted though.</td>', 'Yummy!  Please send them my way ;-)  Colours are a tad muted though.', '2003-04-08 04:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(258300, 17016, 7510, '<td valign="top">This looks over sharpened and grainy.  Almost dusty.</td>', 'This looks over sharpened and grainy.  Almost dusty.', '2003-04-08 04:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(258301, 17095, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like the lines, but the colors don''t seem as vivid as the similar subjects.  The broken pencil takes away...</td>', 'I like the lines, but the colors don''t seem as vivid as the similar subjects.  The broken pencil takes away...', '2003-04-08 04:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(258303, 17393, 7510, '<td valign="top">Wow.  nice color.  The over shapening gives a nice effect.</td>', 'Wow.  nice color.  The over shapening gives a nice effect.', '2003-04-08 04:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(258304, 17042, 7510, '<td valign="top">I think the color is too scattered among the green.</td>', 'I think the color is too scattered among the green.', '2003-04-08 04:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(258305, 17303, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and shapes.  Great color.</td>', 'I like the lines and shapes.  Great color.', '2003-04-08 04:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(258306, 17586, 7510, '<td valign="top">Good focus, nice background.  The color seems a little ''soft''.</td>', 'Good focus, nice background.  The color seems a little ''soft''.', '2003-04-08 04:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(258309, 17379, 7510, '<td valign="top">I lke the B/W used.  Nice concept, using your hand.  Very rich blue.</td>', 'I lke the B/W used.  Nice concept, using your hand.  Very rich blue.', '2003-04-08 04:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(258310, 17589, 7510, '<td valign="top">What''s in the center?  Maybe if there were some more highlights to hint at what is there, enven if it doesn''t reveal the whole thing.</td>', 'What''s in the center?  Maybe if there were some more highlights to hint at what is there, enven if it doesn''t reveal the whole thing.', '2003-04-08 04:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(258311, 17506, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice rich color and good contrast.  I don''t like the way the flower is pointing away from the viewer.  It doesn''t have a peasant shape from this angle.  The pointed (unopened) buds are very interesting but the half opened one hiding behind takes away from the photo.</td>', 'Nice rich color and good contrast.  I don''t like the way the flower is pointing away from the viewer.  It doesn''t have a peasant shape from this angle.  The pointed (unopened) buds are very interesting but the half opened one hiding behind takes away from the photo.', '2003-04-08 04:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(258312, 17567, 7510, '<td valign="top">A little blurry.  Maybe use a trypod.  Crop some of the top and bottom as they look like empty space.</td>', 'A little blurry.  Maybe use a trypod.  Crop some of the top and bottom as they look like empty space.', '2003-04-08 04:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(258314, 17072, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea for the one color  Nice DoF and lines.  Too bad the white looks a little out of place.</td>', 'Interesting idea for the one color  Nice DoF and lines.  Too bad the white looks a little out of place.', '2003-04-08 04:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(258315, 17460, 7510, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the burryness.  It is hard to look at.</td>', 'I don''t like the burryness.  It is hard to look at.', '2003-04-08 04:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(258316, 16852, 7510, '<td valign="top">Very Vivid.  So lifelike, it starts to get scary if I consentrate on it too much. :-)</td>', 'Very Vivid.  So lifelike, it starts to get scary if I consentrate on it too much. :-)', '2003-04-08 04:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(258317, 17122, 7510, '<td valign="top">Over saturated. Too much orange.  It night look better with more of the green showing through.</td>', 'Over saturated. Too much orange.  It night look better with more of the green showing through.', '2003-04-08 04:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(258318, 17546, 7510, '<td valign="top">Did I see this feather before?  I like the background.  Even though the feather has lots of color, it still seems lacking...</td>', 'Did I see this feather before?  I like the background.  Even though the feather has lots of color, it still seems lacking...', '2003-04-08 04:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(258319, 17474, 7510, '<td valign="top">The color looks too soft.  over saturated in the bottom left corner.</td>', 'The color looks too soft.  over saturated in the bottom left corner.', '2003-04-08 04:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(258320, 17305, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice photo</td>', 'Nice photo', '2003-04-08 04:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(258321, 17459, 7510, '<td valign="top">I knew someone would take a picture of this.  Well let see.  The flag seems a little too ''folded''.  If it was opened up more, but still rippling, it would look better.  Nice contrast and focus.</td>', 'I knew someone would take a picture of this.  Well let see.  The flag seems a little too ''folded''.  If it was opened up more, but still rippling, it would look better.  Nice contrast and focus.', '2003-04-08 04:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(258322, 17412, 7510, '<td valign="top">I find the shadows a little distracting.   Maybe if they where crisper or wider, I would have to try different things to see what I like.  I do like the color going into the B/W.  Maybe making the picture smaller might look better too, but that could be from my huge monitor :-)</td>', 'I find the shadows a little distracting.   Maybe if they where crisper or wider, I would have to try different things to see what I like.  I do like the color going into the B/W.  Maybe making the picture smaller might look better too, but that could be from my huge monitor :-)', '2003-04-08 04:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(258323, 17457, 7510, '<td valign="top">Maybe croping part of the second flower of would look better, and put mroe emphisis on the first one.  I''d have to try it.</td>', 'Maybe croping part of the second flower of would look better, and put mroe emphisis on the first one.  I''d have to try it.', '2003-04-08 04:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(258324, 17272, 7510, '<td valign="top">I think the ducks could use more light/highlights.  Great Idea though.</td>', 'I think the ducks could use more light/highlights.  Great Idea though.', '2003-04-08 04:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(258325, 17127, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Great idea.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Great idea.', '2003-04-08 04:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(258327, 17401, 7510, '<td valign="top">The berrys seem out of focus to me.</td>', 'The berrys seem out of focus to me.', '2003-04-08 04:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(258328, 17084, 7510, '<td valign="top">The apple color doesn''t look narutal.  maybe over saturated.</td>', 'The apple color doesn''t look narutal.  maybe over saturated.', '2003-04-08 04:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(258329, 17554, 7510, '<td valign="top">I like to colors and framing, but there is too much shadow.  I love the background.</td>', 'I like to colors and framing, but there is too much shadow.  I love the background.', '2003-04-08 04:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(258330, 16839, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice curves.  The background takes away a lot, esp. the red.  Maybe crop more off the right.  what is that triangle on the right?</td>', 'Nice curves.  The background takes away a lot, esp. the red.  Maybe crop more off the right.  what is that triangle on the right?', '2003-04-08 04:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(258332, 17261, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice tunnel effect.  Very inventive.  The lower left colors don''t seem as defined as the rest.</td>', 'Nice tunnel effect.  Very inventive.  The lower left colors don''t seem as defined as the rest.', '2003-04-08 04:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(258333, 17438, 4784, '<td valign="top">Nice colourful picture. I like it. But what is it?</td>', 'Nice colourful picture. I like it. But what is it?', '2003-04-08 04:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(258339, 17408, 7396, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THE TRUCKS- PERFECT ADVERTISEMENT....U SHOULD TRY TO SELL IT TO PEPSI!</td>', 'I LOVE THE TRUCKS- PERFECT ADVERTISEMENT....U SHOULD TRY TO SELL IT TO PEPSI!', '2003-04-08 05:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(258340, 17547, 7396, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THE BLUES! VERY RELAXING PHOTO...SURREAL<br/></td>', 'I LOVE THE BLUES! VERY RELAXING PHOTO...SURREAL', '2003-04-08 05:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(258341, 17083, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a color challenge! I''m not sure you''ll score so high with a B&amp;W photo. Or was this supposed to have been put in the pi challenge and you submitted it here by mistake. If so, ask if you can get it DQ''ed.</td>', 'This is a color challenge! I''m not sure you''ll score so high with a B&W photo. Or was this supposed to have been put in the pi challenge and you submitted it here by mistake. If so, ask if you can get it DQ''ed.', '2003-04-08 05:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(258342, 17120, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo depicting the color theme very well. The reflections of the window in the glass are disturbing though.</td>', 'This is a good photo depicting the color theme very well. The reflections of the window in the glass are disturbing though.', '2003-04-08 05:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(258343, 16898, 6328, '<td valign="top">Good grief, where''s the frying pan? compsition is perfect, visual impact is great, focus is fine, your framing is an excellent choice, very different indeed.</td>', 'Good grief, where''s the frying pan? compsition is perfect, visual impact is great, focus is fine, your framing is an excellent choice, very different indeed.', '2003-04-08 06:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(258344, 17521, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour and great idea using these flowers leading up to the capitol building itself. DOF is just fine; visual impact is appealing; focus is fine; photograph shows good thought and imagination.</td>', 'Lovely colour and great idea using these flowers leading up to the capitol building itself. DOF is just fine; visual impact is appealing; focus is fine; photograph shows good thought and imagination.', '2003-04-08 06:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(258345, 17400, 5728, '<td valign="top">He he! Nice one Kollin, your model is veeeery photogenic, I hope you pay her well :-) Love the matching lipstick - 8.</td>', 'He he! Nice one Kollin, your model is veeeery photogenic, I hope you pay her well :-) Love the matching lipstick - 8.', '2003-04-08 06:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(258346, 17305, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph with that lonely looking creature all by himself atop that rock. Great color from the rock to the cloud and sky; lighting is perfect; focus is just fine. Your visual impact of this photograph has a strong appeal of emotion and shows good quality work.</td>', 'Lovely photograph with that lonely looking creature all by himself atop that rock. Great color from the rock to the cloud and sky; lighting is perfect; focus is just fine. Your visual impact of this photograph has a strong appeal of emotion and shows good quality work.', '2003-04-08 06:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(258347, 17514, 6381, '<td valign="top">beautiful object :)</td>', 'beautiful object :)', '2003-04-08 06:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(258348, 17294, 6328, '<td valign="top">composition is all right, good lines leading to the barns below.  Great colors of the fields and trees, etc.  nothing really extraordinary here, more of a snapshot that a passing tourist would take from his automobile.</td>', 'composition is all right, good lines leading to the barns below.  Great colors of the fields and trees, etc.  nothing really extraordinary here, more of a snapshot that a passing tourist would take from his automobile.', '2003-04-08 06:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(258349, 17345, 6893, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2003-04-08 06:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(258350, 16951, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lot of work went into painting this door.  Great appeal and emotion in the face and eyes, fine work indeed.  The focus is great, nice and sharp.  Overall quality is excellent, thank you for sharing your work with us.</td>', 'Lot of work went into painting this door.  Great appeal and emotion in the face and eyes, fine work indeed.  The focus is great, nice and sharp.  Overall quality is excellent, thank you for sharing your work with us.', '2003-04-08 06:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(258351, 17581, 6893, '<td valign="top">The pause that refreshes.</td>', 'The pause that refreshes.', '2003-04-08 06:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(258354, 17318, 6328, '<td valign="top">lots of colourful things here.  good lighting, good focus, no ryhme or reason, you just threw everything together and shot for the best.  Good job, too.</td>', 'lots of colourful things here.  good lighting, good focus, no ryhme or reason, you just threw everything together and shot for the best.  Good job, too.', '2003-04-08 06:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(258356, 17241, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lot of work here by Mom.  lot''s of color, good lighting in photographing it, good focus too.  Not a really great shot, just a shot of Mom''s work to say.  Visual impact is okay, when you cropped it, nothing was cropped too evenly, see what I mean? making it, just a picture, not to really stand out.</td>', 'Lot of work here by Mom.  lot''s of color, good lighting in photographing it, good focus too.  Not a really great shot, just a shot of Mom''s work to say.  Visual impact is okay, when you cropped it, nothing was cropped too evenly, see what I mean? making it, just a picture, not to really stand out.', '2003-04-08 06:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(258357, 17286, 6893, '<td valign="top">This is a fine shot. Beautiful. 10.</td>', 'This is a fine shot. Beautiful. 10.', '2003-04-08 06:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(258358, 17127, 6893, '<td valign="top">Nice use of your lighting.</td>', 'Nice use of your lighting.', '2003-04-08 06:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(258359, 17474, 6328, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of a beautiful Rose.  Lovely color.  Good focus.  Good lighting.  Visual impact is appealing and has good quality, and in MHO you were heading for a really splendid comment and high score,  so why in the heck did you go and crop off the bottom petal??</td>', 'Beautiful shot of a beautiful Rose.  Lovely color.  Good focus.  Good lighting.  Visual impact is appealing and has good quality, and in MHO you were heading for a really splendid comment and high score,  so why in the heck did you go and crop off the bottom petal??', '2003-04-08 06:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(258360, 17379, 6381, '<td valign="top">I like the idea :)</td>', 'I like the idea :)', '2003-04-08 06:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(258361, 17591, 6381, '<td valign="top">some of the pencils are out of focus</td>', 'some of the pencils are out of focus', '2003-04-08 06:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(258362, 17261, 6893, '<td valign="top">Impressive. Nice shot.</td>', 'Impressive. Nice shot.', '2003-04-08 06:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(258363, 17462, 6328, '<td valign="top">Really vibrant Yellow against the background of your choice.  Great lighting which allows you to focus to your delight.  The visual appeal is excellent and you are to be congratulated.  Your use of 3rds is a good choice and shows imagination.</td>', 'Really vibrant Yellow against the background of your choice.  Great lighting which allows you to focus to your delight.  The visual appeal is excellent and you are to be congratulated.  Your use of 3rds is a good choice and shows imagination.', '2003-04-08 06:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(258364, 17481, 6893, '<td valign="top">If only we had those phsyic powers?  Your color could use a tad of tweeking.</td>', 'If only we had those phsyic powers?  Your color could use a tad of tweeking.', '2003-04-08 06:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(258365, 17345, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a little too central with the framing for my taste. 6 - floyd</td>', 'Nice shot but a little too central with the framing for my taste. 6 - floyd', '2003-04-08 06:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(258366, 17268, 6328, '<td valign="top">lots and lots of different colors to choose from.  and all lines up so prettily.  certainly meets the challenge, doesn''t it?  focus is good. lighting is fine. of course, the color has to be good with so many colored pencils.  your photo shows some good thought process and imagination and the choice of these colored pencils are rich and vibrant in color.</td>', 'lots and lots of different colors to choose from.  and all lines up so prettily.  certainly meets the challenge, doesn''t it?  focus is good. lighting is fine. of course, the color has to be good with so many colored pencils.  your photo shows some good thought process and imagination and the choice of these colored pencils are rich and vibrant in color.', '2003-04-08 06:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(258367, 17259, 2798, '<td valign="top">Im assuming the grain on this shot is intentional. It''s actually very effective when combined with the light which I like a lot. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Im assuming the grain on this shot is intentional. It''s actually very effective when combined with the light which I like a lot. 8 - floyd', '2003-04-08 06:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(258368, 17547, 6893, '<td valign="top">I can hear the wonderful silence and feel the sweet bite of my breath escaping into this marvolus meadow. Have a 9 day.</td>', 'I can hear the wonderful silence and feel the sweet bite of my breath escaping into this marvolus meadow. Have a 9 day.', '2003-04-08 06:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(258369, 17584, 6893, '<td valign="top">AH a bean counters dream.  Good idea.</td>', 'AH a bean counters dream.  Good idea.', '2003-04-08 06:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(258370, 17581, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful play of light. The effect is awesome, you''ve brought out some vivid colors here without creating any unwanted reflections in the glasses. Must have taken you a long time to set up. 10!</td>', 'Wonderful play of light. The effect is awesome, you''ve brought out some vivid colors here without creating any unwanted reflections in the glasses. Must have taken you a long time to set up. 10!', '2003-04-08 06:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(258371, 17303, 5728, '<td valign="top">A simple but effective photo, the colors melt into each other very harmoniously - 10.</td>', 'A simple but effective photo, the colors melt into each other very harmoniously - 10.', '2003-04-08 06:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(258373, 17417, 6893, '<td valign="top">Pleasing.</td>', 'Pleasing.', '2003-04-08 06:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(258374, 17590, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro! I love the way the pink just melts into the white, the shallow DOF does a lot for this photo - 10.</td>', 'Beautiful macro! I love the way the pink just melts into the white, the shallow DOF does a lot for this photo - 10.', '2003-04-08 06:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
