(258509, 17488, 3290, '<td valign="top">Ideally, it would fill the frame</td>', 'Ideally, it would fill the frame', '2003-04-08 10:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(258510, 17486, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool effect. I thought of this but figured it would be too hard. Well done.</td>', 'Cool effect. I thought of this but figured it would be too hard. Well done.', '2003-04-08 10:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(258512, 17120, 3290, '<td valign="top">Reflection is a distraction.</td>', 'Reflection is a distraction.', '2003-04-08 10:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(258516, 17000, 3290, '<td valign="top">Clever</td>', 'Clever', '2003-04-08 10:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(258519, 17294, 3290, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Nice saturation. Good clarity. Well done.</td>', 'Great composition. Nice saturation. Good clarity. Well done.', '2003-04-08 10:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(258525, 17301, 7466, '<td valign="top">Great focus and lighting!</td>', 'Great focus and lighting!', '2003-04-08 10:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(258527, 16995, 7466, '<td valign="top">I like the neon sign portion, but the red in the windows is distracting.</td>', 'I like the neon sign portion, but the red in the windows is distracting.', '2003-04-08 10:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(258528, 17550, 7466, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and great shot!</td>', 'Wonderful colors and great shot!', '2003-04-08 10:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(258532, 17525, 7466, '<td valign="top">Cute but overly bright...maybe less of the white background?</td>', 'Cute but overly bright...maybe less of the white background?', '2003-04-08 10:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(258533, 17430, 7466, '<td valign="top">Too much foreground detracts from the visual impact of the colors.</td>', 'Too much foreground detracts from the visual impact of the colors.', '2003-04-08 10:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(258535, 17455, 656, '<td valign="top">very blue but seems out of focus towards the bottom of the picture.  <br/> <br/>Other than that, nice - have you tried turning it 180 degrees ?</td>', 'very blue but seems out of focus towards the bottom of the picture.   Other than that, nice - have you tried turning it 180 degrees ?', '2003-04-08 10:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(258536, 17286, 656, '<td valign="top">this seems more like the colour white to me.  The stamen (?) are good but I''m not too sure what the white/ globby bit is - doesn''t really enhance the picture a whole lot.</td>', 'this seems more like the colour white to me.  The stamen (?) are good but I''m not too sure what the white/ globby bit is - doesn''t really enhance the picture a whole lot.', '2003-04-08 10:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(258537, 17466, 656, '<td valign="top">very dramatic - well lit and well taken</td>', 'very dramatic - well lit and well taken', '2003-04-08 10:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(258538, 17350, 656, '<td valign="top">simple, great.  Love the frame with in the frame and the contrast between the white outside and dark interior.</td>', 'simple, great.  Love the frame with in the frame and the contrast between the white outside and dark interior.', '2003-04-08 10:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(258539, 17522, 656, '<td valign="top">A good idea but the lighting lets this down - it is very flat and the white(?) background has been underexposed so much to come out grey.   This would be a good use of the exposure compensation features of your camera if it has any.</td>', 'A good idea but the lighting lets this down - it is very flat and the white(?) background has been underexposed so much to come out grey.   This would be a good use of the exposure compensation features of your camera if it has any.', '2003-04-08 10:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(258540, 17570, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2003-04-08 11:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(258541, 17436, 7466, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the cropping detracts from the image.</td>', 'Good idea, but the cropping detracts from the image.', '2003-04-08 11:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(258542, 17127, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2003-04-08 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(258545, 17357, 3607, '<td valign="top">nicely done, good dof.  i generally like more saturation, but i know that''s a personal thing.</td>', 'nicely done, good dof.  i generally like more saturation, but i know that''s a personal thing.', '2003-04-08 11:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(258548, 17113, 3607, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  i hope nobody misses the heart.  not much to suggest for improvements except the lower left corner isn''t as blacked out as the rest of the background and i wonder how it would have looked with the saturation pumped up a bit.</td>', 'nicely done.  i hope nobody misses the heart.  not much to suggest for improvements except the lower left corner isn''t as blacked out as the rest of the background and i wonder how it would have looked with the saturation pumped up a bit.', '2003-04-08 11:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(258549, 17335, 6521, '<td valign="top">cool lineup, cool photo</td>', 'cool lineup, cool photo', '2003-04-08 11:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(258551, 17457, 3607, '<td valign="top">very nice.  only improvement i might suggest is that the picture is a little tight, especially for the background image.</td>', 'very nice.  only improvement i might suggest is that the picture is a little tight, especially for the background image.', '2003-04-08 11:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(258552, 17168, 5120, '<td valign="top">First, I think that this photo meets the color challenge very well.  You have made good use of depth of field here and the exposure looks dead on.  I like the angle at which you photographed the flower and that you picked a good specimen.  The only real qualm I have with this photograph is the cropping.  I think it might be more effective if the bottom of the flower was much closer to the lower right hand corner of the frame.  The tight cropping at the top and the left-hand side of the picture are uncomfortable for me and I dont think the OOF areas to the right and bottom add much to the photograph.  Because the DOF is so narrow here (and I think it should be for this picture) the stalk for the flower is barely discernable and the flower almost appears to be floating in mid air.  You could stop down the lens some to bring it closer to being in focus but I am afraid this might bring out distractions in the background also.  Different cropping can hide the stalk and make the composition more comfortable while keeping the DOF the way it is.  I gave this one a 6.  Good job.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'First, I think that this photo meets the color challenge very well.  You have made good use of depth of field here and the exposure looks dead on.  I like the angle at which you photographed the flower and that you picked a good specimen.  The only real qualm I have with this photograph is the cropping.  I think it might be more effective if the bottom of the flower was much closer to the lower right hand corner of the frame.  The tight cropping at the top and the left-hand side of the picture are uncomfortable for me and I dont think the OOF areas to the right and bottom add much to the photograph.  Because the DOF is so narrow here (and I think it should be for this picture) the stalk for the flower is barely discernable and the flower almost appears to be floating in mid air.  You could stop down the lens some to bring it closer to being in focus but I am afraid this might bring out distractions in the background also.  Different cropping can hide the stalk and make the composition more comfortable while keeping the DOF the way it is.  I gave this one a 6.  Good job. Greg', '2003-04-08 11:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(258553, 17122, 3607, '<td valign="top">a little too bright.  i think neither the orange and green are really allowed to add as much color punch to the photo as they could have - and more green could have been added by pulling back a bit or coming in and showing the green through the net in greater detail.</td>', 'a little too bright.  i think neither the orange and green are really allowed to add as much color punch to the photo as they could have - and more green could have been added by pulling back a bit or coming in and showing the green through the net in greater detail.', '2003-04-08 11:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(258556, 17114, 6521, '<td valign="top">lilte to hard to see what is on this photo but the sky is very cool.</td>', 'lilte to hard to see what is on this photo but the sky is very cool.', '2003-04-08 11:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(258558, 17177, 6521, '<td valign="top">cool idea and cool lineup</td>', 'cool idea and cool lineup', '2003-04-08 11:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(258559, 17524, 3607, '<td valign="top">props you can eat. well done, i like the blue, but overall its a little over exposed - like the soft edge on the lower left end of the banana.  a yellow background might have been a neat twist.</td>', 'props you can eat. well done, i like the blue, but overall its a little over exposed - like the soft edge on the lower left end of the banana.  a yellow background might have been a neat twist.', '2003-04-08 11:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(258560, 16911, 5728, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shade of yellow that water is. This photo is very good, the play of light on the water''s surface creates such a vivid lighter yellow pattern. Good job!</td>', 'What a wonderful shade of yellow that water is. This photo is very good, the play of light on the water''s surface creates such a vivid lighter yellow pattern. Good job!', '2003-04-08 11:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(258561, 17223, 3607, '<td valign="top">good focus and dof.  i like stronger colors (saturation), which could have been done in post processing, or simply by reversing the order and bringing the brighter colors up to the front.</td>', 'good focus and dof.  i like stronger colors (saturation), which could have been done in post processing, or simply by reversing the order and bringing the brighter colors up to the front.', '2003-04-08 11:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(258562, 17198, 6521, '<td valign="top">holy shit, great shoot!</td>', 'holy shit, great shoot!', '2003-04-08 11:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(258563, 17314, 5120, '<td valign="top">This is not one of my favorite subjects but I think you have done a good job with it.  I think it meets the color challenge very well and overall I think the picture is well done.  The shadows add a lot to the photo.  I dont know if you planned it this way or not but they really help the composition and make the picture more interesting for me.  There certainly is a lot to look at here that would be missed by the frantic reviewer trying to get through the whopping 300 submissions from this week, but I am glad I took the time to look at it.  The more I look at this picture the more I like it.  I really cant think of anything I would change about it. I gave this one a 7.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This is not one of my favorite subjects but I think you have done a good job with it.  I think it meets the color challenge very well and overall I think the picture is well done.  The shadows add a lot to the photo.  I dont know if you planned it this way or not but they really help the composition and make the picture more interesting for me.  There certainly is a lot to look at here that would be missed by the frantic reviewer trying to get through the whopping 300 submissions from this week, but I am glad I took the time to look at it.  The more I look at this picture the more I like it.  I really cant think of anything I would change about it. I gave this one a 7. Greg', '2003-04-08 11:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(258564, 17241, 3607, '<td valign="top">i think these are actually quite challenging pictures to take because its hard to give the photo a professional look versus just a snapshot.  i think the symmetry actually hurts the photo, and maybe choosing a lower angle would have given some more depth of field and made the photo more interesting (and i always love increased saturation to bring the colors out).</td>', 'i think these are actually quite challenging pictures to take because its hard to give the photo a professional look versus just a snapshot.  i think the symmetry actually hurts the photo, and maybe choosing a lower angle would have given some more depth of field and made the photo more interesting (and i always love increased saturation to bring the colors out).', '2003-04-08 11:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(258566, 17582, 6521, '<td valign="top">cool lineup</td>', 'cool lineup', '2003-04-08 11:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(258567, 17360, 5728, '<td valign="top">Aha blue, red and white, your colors? American of French? Nice shot, I like how you have the pearls in different sizes. The blue pearls seem to have taken all the focus leaving the red ones a little blurred, maybe you could have used a higher f/stop number to get everything in focus.</td>', 'Aha blue, red and white, your colors? American of French? Nice shot, I like how you have the pearls in different sizes. The blue pearls seem to have taken all the focus leaving the red ones a little blurred, maybe you could have used a higher f/stop number to get everything in focus.', '2003-04-08 11:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(258568, 17386, 3607, '<td valign="top">where are the sails?  clearly you have red against blue, but neither leap out at me.  maybe if you and tightened a bit on those two elements. . . (and increased the saturation to bring them both out a little more)</td>', 'where are the sails?  clearly you have red against blue, but neither leap out at me.  maybe if you and tightened a bit on those two elements. . . (and increased the saturation to bring them both out a little more)', '2003-04-08 11:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(258569, 17215, 6521, '<td valign="top">brilliant idea</td>', 'brilliant idea', '2003-04-08 11:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(258570, 17364, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice.  you might consider lowering the gamma (light) a little and boosting the color (saturation) a bit to increase the intensity and contrast of the colors.</td>', 'nice.  you might consider lowering the gamma (light) a little and boosting the color (saturation) a bit to increase the intensity and contrast of the colors.', '2003-04-08 11:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(258571, 17117, 5728, '<td valign="top">That water looks so still! I bet there was no wind there at all right? There is a general lack of color in this photo, but the colors which are depicted complement each other well, the pinky-orange with the blue.</td>', 'That water looks so still! I bet there was no wind there at all right? There is a general lack of color in this photo, but the colors which are depicted complement each other well, the pinky-orange with the blue.', '2003-04-08 11:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(258572, 17298, 5728, '<td valign="top">This sure meets the challenge, colorful! Good one.</td>', 'This sure meets the challenge, colorful! Good one.', '2003-04-08 11:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(258573, 17498, 2667, '<td valign="top">Wonderful movement and texture and very colorful...perhaps needs a little more light, but overall very nicely done.</td>', 'Wonderful movement and texture and very colorful...perhaps needs a little more light, but overall very nicely done.', '2003-04-08 11:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(258574, 17384, 3607, '<td valign="top">neat.  i wish i knew what you were melting.  the flame almost looks like a spotlight, and this looks hazardous for your camera ;-)  you might have boosted the saturation to bring the blue and red out a little more.</td>', 'neat.  i wish i knew what you were melting.  the flame almost looks like a spotlight, and this looks hazardous for your camera ;-)  you might have boosted the saturation to bring the blue and red out a little more.', '2003-04-08 11:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(258575, 17436, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and meeting the challenge head on. Maybe a little more sharpening would have highlighted the crayons more.</td>', 'Very colorful and meeting the challenge head on. Maybe a little more sharpening would have highlighted the crayons more.', '2003-04-08 11:20:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(258576, 16897, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow, psychedelic, but colorful. I would have cropped out the white stripe on the right hand side though.</td>', 'Wow, psychedelic, but colorful. I would have cropped out the white stripe on the right hand side though.', '2003-04-08 11:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(258578, 17591, 3607, '<td valign="top">its cool how narrow the focus area is.  nice shot, and well saturated (esp. versus many other submissions where people seemed to have omitted that step).  only suggestion might be to use a white or black piece of paper in the top left to more effectively create empty space there.</td>', 'its cool how narrow the focus area is.  nice shot, and well saturated (esp. versus many other submissions where people seemed to have omitted that step).  only suggestion might be to use a white or black piece of paper in the top left to more effectively create empty space there.', '2003-04-08 11:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(258579, 17467, 5120, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photograph.  The use of color and depth of field are very well done.  The background is far enough out of focus as to not be distracting, and the blossoms in the foreground appear to be well in focus.  The exposure is very good here, I cant find any blown-out areas and the lighting is not too harsh.  The only suggestion I would make on this photograph would be to try it at different times of the day.  From looking at the shadows underneath the flowers it appears that you shot this one around noon.  I would try it in the early morning around sunrise or in the late evening as the sun is going down depending on which direction the tree is facing.  I think that lighting might eliminate the dark shadows underneath the flowers and could bring out the color more.  Good job here, I gave this picture a 7.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I like the composition of this photograph.  The use of color and depth of field are very well done.  The background is far enough out of focus as to not be distracting, and the blossoms in the foreground appear to be well in focus.  The exposure is very good here, I cant find any blown-out areas and the lighting is not too harsh.  The only suggestion I would make on this photograph would be to try it at different times of the day.  From looking at the shadows underneath the flowers it appears that you shot this one around noon.  I would try it in the early morning around sunrise or in the late evening as the sun is going down depending on which direction the tree is facing.  I think that lighting might eliminate the dark shadows underneath the flowers and could bring out the color more.  Good job here, I gave this picture a 7. Greg', '2003-04-08 11:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(258580, 16951, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great door!...but it is the garbage can and wall reflecting the blue in the stone that really cinches the composition. Do you need all that concrete walk? Great color shot!</td>', 'Great door!...but it is the garbage can and wall reflecting the blue in the stone that really cinches the composition. Do you need all that concrete walk? Great color shot!', '2003-04-08 11:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(258582, 17377, 3607, '<td valign="top">tune up for what?  doesn''t really work for me as a color submission.  however, that outfit against a black background (ie: body invisible) and so objects ''floating'' indicating a presence could be very cool.</td>', 'tune up for what?  doesn''t really work for me as a color submission.  however, that outfit against a black background (ie: body invisible) and so objects ''floating'' indicating a presence could be very cool.', '2003-04-08 11:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(258584, 17002, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow what a salad of color! It is a little loud and my eye is on the move all the time trying to find a central focal point. There are too many lines leading my eyes off the image. Also I would have tried a bit more "unsharp mask" to sharpen the whole image a little more. The idea is good and the challenge has been met - Gary.</td>', 'Wow what a salad of color! It is a little loud and my eye is on the move all the time trying to find a central focal point. There are too many lines leading my eyes off the image. Also I would have tried a bit more "unsharp mask" to sharpen the whole image a little more. The idea is good and the challenge has been met - Gary.', '2003-04-08 11:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(258585, 17198, 2667, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro and vibrant yellow. Fantastic capture!</td>', 'Beautiful macro and vibrant yellow. Fantastic capture!', '2003-04-08 11:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(258586, 17217, 5120, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of color here.  I like the composition and the lines in this shot.  The photo doesnt looks as sharp as it might be on my screen but it isnt too far off either.  I think this meets the challenge well as color is definitely the dominant element here.  I know this is an abstract but it might work better if you show more of the bird.  There just isnt enough here to hold my attention for very long.  Overall I think the photo is well done and I gave it a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Very nice use of color here.  I like the composition and the lines in this shot.  The photo doesnt looks as sharp as it might be on my screen but it isnt too far off either.  I think this meets the challenge well as color is definitely the dominant element here.  I know this is an abstract but it might work better if you show more of the bird.  There just isnt enough here to hold my attention for very long.  Overall I think the photo is well done and I gave it a 5. Greg', '2003-04-08 11:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(258589, 17133, 2667, '<td valign="top">Like that spring green center and gradient purple on the flower...but my focus veers to that ugly bug. Good shot.</td>', 'Like that spring green center and gradient purple on the flower...but my focus veers to that ugly bug. Good shot.', '2003-04-08 11:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(258590, 17496, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Reflections on the water are distracting.</td>', 'Nice. Reflections on the water are distracting.', '2003-04-08 11:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(258591, 16801, 3607, '<td valign="top">um . . . i''m not sure if the background adds anything to the photo, and the colors are a little dull, and the focus seems a little soft on the whatever it is stuck to the bottom of the egg.  that said, eggs are tricky with the voters (see my hungarian eggs submission).</td>', 'um . . . i''m not sure if the background adds anything to the photo, and the colors are a little dull, and the focus seems a little soft on the whatever it is stuck to the bottom of the egg.  that said, eggs are tricky with the voters (see my hungarian eggs submission).', '2003-04-08 11:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(258592, 17384, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting. What''s melting?</td>', 'Interesting. What''s melting?', '2003-04-08 11:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(258593, 17217, 3607, '<td valign="top">cool.  focus seems a little soft (was it a moving target?) but it works well for this challenge.</td>', 'cool.  focus seems a little soft (was it a moving target?) but it works well for this challenge.', '2003-04-08 11:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(258594, 17364, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Would be better without the black area, I think.</td>', 'Nice. Would be better without the black area, I think.', '2003-04-08 11:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(258595, 17319, 3290, '<td valign="top">Aaahhhh, help meeeeee.....</td>', 'Aaahhhh, help meeeeee.....', '2003-04-08 11:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(258596, 17477, 5120, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool idea and I like the color and composition very much.  The way you framed the memorial is very well done.  I am wondering if the color was really like that or if it was done in post-processing?  Either way the color is very appealing.  I am not sure if it is just my monitor but the focus appears to be a little soft out at infinity.  Perhaps a narrower aperture might have produced a better result, then again if the aperture is too small you will get a soft image due to diffraction effects which also could have been the case here.  To me this is a powerful photograph and I would be proud of it if it were mine.  I gave it a 7.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This is a very cool idea and I like the color and composition very much.  The way you framed the memorial is very well done.  I am wondering if the color was really like that or if it was done in post-processing?  Either way the color is very appealing.  I am not sure if it is just my monitor but the focus appears to be a little soft out at infinity.  Perhaps a narrower aperture might have produced a better result, then again if the aperture is too small you will get a soft image due to diffraction effects which also could have been the case here.  To me this is a powerful photograph and I would be proud of it if it were mine.  I gave it a 7. Greg', '2003-04-08 11:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(258598, 17443, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement. Light in the background is distracting - need to close those curtains : -)</td>', 'Nice arrangement. Light in the background is distracting - need to close those curtains : -)', '2003-04-08 11:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(258599, 17402, 2667, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and the gradient minty green background adds to the effect. Very nice.</td>', 'Lovely composition and the gradient minty green background adds to the effect. Very nice.', '2003-04-08 11:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(258601, 17582, 3290, '<td valign="top">Wow. Must have taken a while to set up. Good idea - would like to see more from different viewpoints.</td>', 'Wow. Must have taken a while to set up. Good idea - would like to see more from different viewpoints.', '2003-04-08 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(258602, 17436, 3607, '<td valign="top">why urban? (had to ask since i can''t find much to suggest to improve the photo - nicely done).  the symmetry could be just a little better.</td>', 'why urban? (had to ask since i can''t find much to suggest to improve the photo - nicely done).  the symmetry could be just a little better.', '2003-04-08 11:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(258603, 17204, 3290, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Could use the brightness tunring down a notch or two.</td>', 'Pretty. Could use the brightness tunring down a notch or two.', '2003-04-08 11:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(258605, 17353, 5728, '<td valign="top">Aha the first signs of spring are upon us! I bet this looked very colorful when you took the photo, I know I tried the same kind of bush but when I saw the photo the color just wasn''t as impressive anymore. Okay yours looks a lot better than mine did but you should have gotten in a lot closer (and more to the left) and not tried to get the whole tree into the image. The space to the left I would have cropped out altogether. I like it anyhow, good job.</td>', 'Aha the first signs of spring are upon us! I bet this looked very colorful when you took the photo, I know I tried the same kind of bush but when I saw the photo the color just wasn''t as impressive anymore. Okay yours looks a lot better than mine did but you should have gotten in a lot closer (and more to the left) and not tried to get the whole tree into the image. The space to the left I would have cropped out altogether. I like it anyhow, good job.', '2003-04-08 11:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(258606, 16816, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool wire, but the background is a distraction which spoils it.</td>', 'Cool wire, but the background is a distraction which spoils it.', '2003-04-08 11:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(258607, 17062, 3290, '<td valign="top">Need to lose the empty area to the right.</td>', 'Need to lose the empty area to the right.', '2003-04-08 11:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(258608, 17448, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good. But the spectators are a distraction. A different angle or a tighter zoom might help</td>', 'Good. But the spectators are a distraction. A different angle or a tighter zoom might help', '2003-04-08 11:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(258609, 17215, 3290, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. Good one.</td>', 'Made me smile. Good one.', '2003-04-08 11:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(258610, 17581, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.</td>', 'Nice effect.', '2003-04-08 11:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
