(258693, 17037, 1792, '<td valign="top">The color is there, but I guess I''m one of those folks who likes to see something in focus unless selective focus is used for effect and emphasis.</td>', 'The color is there, but I guess I''m one of those folks who likes to see something in focus unless selective focus is used for effect and emphasis.', '2003-04-08 12:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
