(259168, 17543, 3607, '<td valign="top">the DOF is excellent with that amazing blue/green blur in the background.  too bad the light on the main subject is uneven.</td>', 'the DOF is excellent with that amazing blue/green blur in the background.  too bad the light on the main subject is uneven.', '2003-04-08 16:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(259171, 17127, 7548, '<td valign="top">I can''t get the jest of this pic. in the position it is in.  I think it could have used more light to expose the peppers more or rename the pic.  There is really too much shade on your subject BUT very nice try.  Keep up the good work and you''ll get it I''m sure.</td>', 'I can''t get the jest of this pic. in the position it is in.  I think it could have used more light to expose the peppers more or rename the pic.  There is really too much shade on your subject BUT very nice try.  Keep up the good work and you''ll get it I''m sure.', '2003-04-08 16:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(259173, 17117, 3607, '<td valign="top">sorry - not looking very golden from here.</td>', 'sorry - not looking very golden from here.', '2003-04-08 16:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(259174, 17520, 6893, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. good luck.</td>', 'Nicely done. good luck.', '2003-04-08 16:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(259175, 17395, 7548, '<td valign="top">Beautiful aray of sky.  the colors look almost like a fire in a forge, it looks very hot.  from this shot I see you like mother nature and her expressions, very nice and very clean. As you said it, Sunset in the park.</td>', 'Beautiful aray of sky.  the colors look almost like a fire in a forge, it looks very hot.  from this shot I see you like mother nature and her expressions, very nice and very clean. As you said it, Sunset in the park.', '2003-04-08 16:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(259179, 17366, 7548, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.  I do think though you could have made it just a little more centered.  All in all your imagenation is great I like your style.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Very nice work.  I do think though you could have made it just a little more centered.  All in all your imagenation is great I like your style.  Keep up the good work.', '2003-04-08 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(259183, 17550, 1439, '<td valign="top">I think i have seen this here before. beatuful color''s. It surely mett the challenge 8</td>', 'I think i have seen this here before. beatuful color''s. It surely mett the challenge 8', '2003-04-08 16:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(259184, 17318, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea--too much orange and not enough green/yellow, perhaps.</td>', 'This is a great idea--too much orange and not enough green/yellow, perhaps.', '2003-04-08 16:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
