(259186, 17391, 7350, '<td valign="top">I gave my wife one of these when we were just dating--I think it''s why she decided to marry me.  Great shot--I love the angle of the flower.</td>', 'I gave my wife one of these when we were just dating--I think it''s why she decided to marry me.  Great shot--I love the angle of the flower.', '2003-04-08 16:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(259187, 17487, 7350, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  An ugly house, but good colors.</td>', 'Good colors.  An ugly house, but good colors.', '2003-04-08 16:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(259188, 17554, 7548, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but for your ability I think you could have given us more.  Your expertise shows,  why not use it.  The pic. needs more design to help it out some but very well centered and shading is great too.  Good work but I know you have more to offer,  just from this pic.  Go for it.</td>', 'Nice shot but for your ability I think you could have given us more.  Your expertise shows,  why not use it.  The pic. needs more design to help it out some but very well centered and shading is great too.  Good work but I know you have more to offer,  just from this pic.  Go for it.', '2003-04-08 16:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(259189, 17554, 1439, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I would like to see the rose with water drop''s</td>', 'Very nice. I would like to see the rose with water drop''s', '2003-04-08 16:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(259190, 17436, 7350, '<td valign="top">I think you have chosen just the right level of saturation here to make the colors bright.  The yellow crayon looks used.  Is it? 7.</td>', 'I think you have chosen just the right level of saturation here to make the colors bright.  The yellow crayon looks used.  Is it? 7.', '2003-04-08 16:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(259193, 17549, 7350, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know how this was done.  Surely you only got one chance at this.  To get the butterfly profile so perfect, and the wonderful child-like facial expression is an amazing coincidence.</td>', 'I''d like to know how this was done.  Surely you only got one chance at this.  To get the butterfly profile so perfect, and the wonderful child-like facial expression is an amazing coincidence.', '2003-04-08 16:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(259194, 17524, 7350, '<td valign="top">Was this done in "negative" mode?</td>', 'Was this done in "negative" mode?', '2003-04-08 16:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(259196, 17438, 7350, '<td valign="top">The sky seems a little pixelated, or distorted, or something.  Could be a camera issue, though, so I won''t mark you down for it.  I love the composition and subject of the shot. 8.</td>', 'The sky seems a little pixelated, or distorted, or something.  Could be a camera issue, though, so I won''t mark you down for it.  I love the composition and subject of the shot. 8.', '2003-04-08 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(259197, 16852, 7548, '<td valign="top">colorful girl that she is.  She also is very beautiful and I think from your shot you might have taken just a little too much of her hair away.  Try to get more of her by adding the color around her head.  A head shot is nice but you need the whole ball of wax to make something of it. very beautiful little girl.</td>', 'colorful girl that she is.  She also is very beautiful and I think from your shot you might have taken just a little too much of her hair away.  Try to get more of her by adding the color around her head.  A head shot is nice but you need the whole ball of wax to make something of it. very beautiful little girl.', '2003-04-08 16:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(259198, 17579, 7350, '<td valign="top">Are they fighting?  And what is that black thing above the right wing?  Still, great colors. 7.</td>', 'Are they fighting?  And what is that black thing above the right wing?  Still, great colors. 7.', '2003-04-08 16:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(259200, 17520, 7350, '<td valign="top">I think the DOF you have chosen, providing for the decreasing focus, really pulls my eye to where it should, and makes me see the "progression" of colors.  I love it.  8.</td>', 'I think the DOF you have chosen, providing for the decreasing focus, really pulls my eye to where it should, and makes me see the "progression" of colors.  I love it.  8.', '2003-04-08 16:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(259201, 17329, 1439, '<td valign="top">Nice. but the border should be in darker color</td>', 'Nice. but the border should be in darker color', '2003-04-08 16:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(259202, 17196, 7350, '<td valign="top">FORE!!!</td>', 'FORE!!!', '2003-04-08 16:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(259203, 17120, 7350, '<td valign="top">Is this a real drink, or just food coloring?</td>', 'Is this a real drink, or just food coloring?', '2003-04-08 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(259204, 17430, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I really like the variety of colors and texture you used. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I really like the variety of colors and texture you used. Good job.', '2003-04-08 16:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(259206, 17206, 7548, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color BUT !  the blurr should be in the back ground and not up front, try to reverse you shooting and let the back flowers blurr, but the front should always be clear.  Keep up the good work cause you got it, it just needs fine tuning and your on your way.</td>', 'Beautiful color BUT !  the blurr should be in the back ground and not up front, try to reverse you shooting and let the back flowers blurr, but the front should always be clear.  Keep up the good work cause you got it, it just needs fine tuning and your on your way.', '2003-04-08 16:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(259207, 17303, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice effects and uses of patterns and colors.  How did you take this with all of the reflections in it?? Good job.</td>', 'Nice effects and uses of patterns and colors.  How did you take this with all of the reflections in it?? Good job.', '2003-04-08 16:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(259208, 17465, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but it seems a little bit boring.  It needs something else to be considered an image that grabs your attention.  Nice colors though and idea.</td>', 'Nice image, but it seems a little bit boring.  It needs something else to be considered an image that grabs your attention.  Nice colors though and idea.', '2003-04-08 16:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
