(259212, 17342, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but not much range of color.  It just sort of looks like a regular photo to me.  Good quality too.</td>', 'Nice image, but not much range of color.  It just sort of looks like a regular photo to me.  Good quality too.', '2003-04-08 16:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
