(259600, 17201, 5120, '<td valign="top">You have made good use of color in this image and it meets the challenge well.  Everything looks nice and sharp and the exposure looks good.  I definitely cant find anything seriously wrong with this photo.  Looking at it there was something that wasnt quite right for me and I couldnt figure it out.  After thinking about it for a while I think that it might be the camera angle.  I wonder how this one would look if the camera was closer to the ground.  I think this is a good effort but it just doesnt move me.  I gave it a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'You have made good use of color in this image and it meets the challenge well.  Everything looks nice and sharp and the exposure looks good.  I definitely cant find anything seriously wrong with this photo.  Looking at it there was something that wasnt quite right for me and I couldnt figure it out.  After thinking about it for a while I think that it might be the camera angle.  I wonder how this one would look if the camera was closer to the ground.  I think this is a good effort but it just doesnt move me.  I gave it a 5. Greg', '2003-04-08 21:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
