(259651, 17353, 5120, '<td valign="top">This picture meets the challenge and appears to have good exposure.  I wish you would have used the maximum allowable resolution for this one as there is a lot of detail in the scene that gets lost which is a shame.  The sky looks a little blown out but that is almost impossible to avoid in a picture like this.  That rock thing to the left of the pink tree and the sign and cart path also distract me, again, not much you can do about these things.  You could get closer to the tree and try a different angle maybe.  I gave this picture a 4 mainly because of the low resolution, it really takes a lot away from the picture.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This picture meets the challenge and appears to have good exposure.  I wish you would have used the maximum allowable resolution for this one as there is a lot of detail in the scene that gets lost which is a shame.  The sky looks a little blown out but that is almost impossible to avoid in a picture like this.  That rock thing to the left of the pink tree and the sign and cart path also distract me, again, not much you can do about these things.  You could get closer to the tree and try a different angle maybe.  I gave this picture a 4 mainly because of the low resolution, it really takes a lot away from the picture. Greg', '2003-04-08 22:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(259652, 17438, 7711, '<td valign="top">great perspective!</td>', 'great perspective!', '2003-04-08 22:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(259653, 17581, 7711, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know what you used for a light source on this one. :)</td>', 'I''d love to know what you used for a light source on this one. :)', '2003-04-08 22:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(259654, 17425, 7711, '<td valign="top">I think the picture would have benefitted from the entire inside circle being in the shot, but I do love the colours. :)</td>', 'I think the picture would have benefitted from the entire inside circle being in the shot, but I do love the colours. :)', '2003-04-08 22:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(259655, 17471, 7711, '<td valign="top">crop is a bit tight, but these flowers look like a drawing. :)</td>', 'crop is a bit tight, but these flowers look like a drawing. :)', '2003-04-08 22:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(259657, 17583, 7711, '<td valign="top">did you try this one with the brush in focus? Might have added a good dimension to the shot. :)</td>', 'did you try this one with the brush in focus? Might have added a good dimension to the shot. :)', '2003-04-08 22:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(259659, 16898, 7711, '<td valign="top">all I could think of was Dr. Seuss "one fish, two fish, red fish, blue fish" ;) <br/> <br/>I like how you did your border too!</td>', 'all I could think of was Dr. Seuss "one fish, two fish, red fish, blue fish" ;)  I like how you did your border too!', '2003-04-08 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(259662, 17549, 5120, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea and works well for the color challenge.  I am not going to accuse you of doing spot editing but I must say this photo has the appearance of being spot edited.  I am not sure how you got that blue background and got the butterfly in that position but I have to give you credit.  I dont think I could do anything like this without spot editing.  I dont really care for the feathering around the chin and around the edge of the face though and I wish the background was a little more natural looking.  I also wish the eye was in a little better focus and that the white balance was a little closer to natural.  The left half of the picture appears to have a bit of a red cast to it where the rest of the picture does not.  Overall I gave this picture a 4.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This is a cool idea and works well for the color challenge.  I am not going to accuse you of doing spot editing but I must say this photo has the appearance of being spot edited.  I am not sure how you got that blue background and got the butterfly in that position but I have to give you credit.  I dont think I could do anything like this without spot editing.  I dont really care for the feathering around the chin and around the edge of the face though and I wish the background was a little more natural looking.  I also wish the eye was in a little better focus and that the white balance was a little closer to natural.  The left half of the picture appears to have a bit of a red cast to it where the rest of the picture does not.  Overall I gave this picture a 4. Greg', '2003-04-08 22:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(259663, 17345, 7711, '<td valign="top">the blue of the water is breathtaking, especially with the lighthouse roof against it. <br/>If you cropped out more of the rock, and left the lighthouse looking like it was almost adrift in the water (crop to the base of the lighthouse essentially) I think it comes out to be an even more dramatic shot.</td>', 'the blue of the water is breathtaking, especially with the lighthouse roof against it. If you cropped out more of the rock, and left the lighthouse looking like it was almost adrift in the water (crop to the base of the lighthouse essentially) I think it comes out to be an even more dramatic shot.', '2003-04-08 22:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(259664, 17410, 7711, '<td valign="top">leeettttllee higher and lleeeettle to the left. :)</td>', 'leeettttllee higher and lleeeettle to the left. :)', '2003-04-08 22:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(259665, 17348, 7711, '<td valign="top">those are sumptuous. nice shot!</td>', 'those are sumptuous. nice shot!', '2003-04-08 22:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(259668, 16923, 7628, '<td valign="top">needs a tail, nice subject</td>', 'needs a tail, nice subject', '2003-04-08 22:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(259671, 17479, 5120, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject for the color challenge.  The colors in this picture are really great but I think there isnt enough resolution here to really do them justice.  What I am seeing on my screen is basically a bunch of small blobs of color.  It almost looks like you might have used some sort of soft-focus filter on this picture.  I think you would do much better by getting a lot closer to the flowers so I can really see the lines and shapes of the individual blossoms.  This would be a wonderful picture for a very high resolution photo.  I gave it a 4.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Great choice of subject for the color challenge.  The colors in this picture are really great but I think there isnt enough resolution here to really do them justice.  What I am seeing on my screen is basically a bunch of small blobs of color.  It almost looks like you might have used some sort of soft-focus filter on this picture.  I think you would do much better by getting a lot closer to the flowers so I can really see the lines and shapes of the individual blossoms.  This would be a wonderful picture for a very high resolution photo.  I gave it a 4. Greg', '2003-04-08 22:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(259672, 17440, 7628, '<td valign="top">better framing would make this common sight more interesting</td>', 'better framing would make this common sight more interesting', '2003-04-08 22:29:37.000000', NULL, 1);
