(259676, 17215, 7711, '<td valign="top">neat effect!! How''d you do the two different things at once? I''m sure the answer is simple, once you tell me. :)</td>', 'neat effect!! How''d you do the two different things at once? I''m sure the answer is simple, once you tell me. :)', '2003-04-08 22:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
