(259687, 17313, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice shot, i would like to have seen the levels adjusted on this shot, it would brighten up the image which is a little dark.</td>', 'nice shot, i would like to have seen the levels adjusted on this shot, it would brighten up the image which is a little dark.', '2003-04-08 22:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
