(259691, 17189, 7711, '<td valign="top">this looks like a dragon!</td>', 'this looks like a dragon!', '2003-04-08 22:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(259694, 16942, 5120, '<td valign="top">This photo is a good entry for the color challenge but I wish it was in sharper focus and had less depth of field.  It would be good to shoot with the lens wide open and focus on the orange flowers.  You probably want to use a tripod for this but I think it would drastically strengthen the photo.  The wire and post in the background really take away from the picture for me.  The way it is now I give it a 4.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This photo is a good entry for the color challenge but I wish it was in sharper focus and had less depth of field.  It would be good to shoot with the lens wide open and focus on the orange flowers.  You probably want to use a tripod for this but I think it would drastically strengthen the photo.  The wire and post in the background really take away from the picture for me.  The way it is now I give it a 4. Greg', '2003-04-08 22:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(259695, 17241, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice quilt</td>', 'nice quilt', '2003-04-08 22:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(259697, 17370, 7607, '<td valign="top">Love all the colors and the shineiness. Feel like jumping into the middle of it.</td>', 'Love all the colors and the shineiness. Feel like jumping into the middle of it.', '2003-04-08 22:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(259698, 17581, 5120, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very cool picture and is quite well done.  I am guessing you had the shutter opened for a relatively long period of time and painted the streak of light using a flashlight or something.  If this is the case I am very impressed with the lack of noise in the picture.  The lighting is very appealing for me.  I cant think of a single suggestion to improve this photograph.  I gave it a 7.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I think this is a very cool picture and is quite well done.  I am guessing you had the shutter opened for a relatively long period of time and painted the streak of light using a flashlight or something.  If this is the case I am very impressed with the lack of noise in the picture.  The lighting is very appealing for me.  I cant think of a single suggestion to improve this photograph.  I gave it a 7. Greg', '2003-04-08 22:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(259701, 17508, 7751, '<td valign="top">Is this a building, the thumbnail looked like the grill of a car to me. This is very pretty.</td>', 'Is this a building, the thumbnail looked like the grill of a car to me. This is very pretty.', '2003-04-08 22:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
