(259839, 17469, 5120, '<td valign="top">Did you take this picture at night using the on-camera flash?  This picture doesnt do much for me.  The lines and pattern are nice but not enough to hold my attention for very long.  Color is nice but there isnt much here for me to comment on.  The focus and exposure do look good.  I cant find any major technical problems.  I gave it a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'Did you take this picture at night using the on-camera flash?  This picture doesnt do much for me.  The lines and pattern are nice but not enough to hold my attention for very long.  Color is nice but there isnt much here for me to comment on.  The focus and exposure do look good.  I cant find any major technical problems.  I gave it a 5. Greg', '2003-04-09 00:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
