(259856, 17304, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  Water droplets on the leaves are nice, but I would have preferred to have the frame more fully filled by the flower itself.  Edges of the flower seem a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice subject.  Water droplets on the leaves are nice, but I would have preferred to have the frame more fully filled by the flower itself.  Edges of the flower seem a bit oversharpened.', '2003-04-09 00:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
