(259861, 17495, 5120, '<td valign="top">I like the play on color in this image.  The composition and exposure look good as well.  The main thing that I think could help this picture is a little more sharpening.  As it is now it looks a little soft to me.  I also am a little bothered by the very dark area in the top left corner of the photograph.  I gave it a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I like the play on color in this image.  The composition and exposure look good as well.  The main thing that I think could help this picture is a little more sharpening.  As it is now it looks a little soft to me.  I also am a little bothered by the very dark area in the top left corner of the photograph.  I gave it a 5. Greg', '2003-04-09 00:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(259862, 17465, 6328, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what other colors you could have gone with but these ones.  Nice and bright too.  Good focus on all of them.  good lighting.</td>', 'Don''t know what other colors you could have gone with but these ones.  Nice and bright too.  Good focus on all of them.  good lighting.', '2003-04-09 00:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(259863, 17379, 7033, '<td valign="top">VERY striking photo!  The desaturation of everything but the rich blue creates a beautiful effect, and draws all the attention back to the color.  Newspaper is a nice touch, because it makes the desaturation seem all the more natural.  --9</td>', 'VERY striking photo!  The desaturation of everything but the rich blue creates a beautiful effect, and draws all the attention back to the color.  Newspaper is a nice touch, because it makes the desaturation seem all the more natural.  --9', '2003-04-09 00:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(259865, 17508, 6328, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a lot of windows in color.  Very nice shot.  Good colors, good lighting, good focus, nice reflections off the glass, actually nice rich vibrant colors that you have showing. . .</td>', 'Now that''s a lot of windows in color.  Very nice shot.  Good colors, good lighting, good focus, nice reflections off the glass, actually nice rich vibrant colors that you have showing. . .', '2003-04-09 00:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(259867, 17095, 2182, '<td valign="top">Great idea, Excelent job</td>', 'Great idea, Excelent job', '2003-04-09 00:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(259869, 17404, 6328, '<td valign="top">You''ve been able to capture many colours off your Brass.  I can count at least Five.  Really nice job, good focusing, nice lighting techniqiue, excellent visual interest.</td>', 'You''ve been able to capture many colours off your Brass.  I can count at least Five.  Really nice job, good focusing, nice lighting techniqiue, excellent visual interest.', '2003-04-09 00:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(259870, 17198, 7033, '<td valign="top">You have done an absolutely fantastic job capturing this, in my opinion.  The crisp focus of the wasp? against the out of focus background draws my attention back to the center of the frame.  Very nice!  --10</td>', 'You have done an absolutely fantastic job capturing this, in my opinion.  The crisp focus of the wasp? against the out of focus background draws my attention back to the center of the frame.  Very nice!  --10', '2003-04-09 00:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(259871, 17547, 7067, '<td valign="top">It''s sunny and springlike where I am :)  Sorry, just had to rub that in.  ;-)  But maybe you like winter...  Nice picture.  It''s very emotive.  But I don''t think I would have used such a thick heavy border and I probably would have cropped the bottom quarter and shown more sky.</td>', 'It''s sunny and springlike where I am :)  Sorry, just had to rub that in.  ;-)  But maybe you like winter...  Nice picture.  It''s very emotive.  But I don''t think I would have used such a thick heavy border and I probably would have cropped the bottom quarter and shown more sky.', '2003-04-09 00:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(259872, 16927, 5120, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this photo but I think it could be improved quite a bit overall.  The focus seems off to me but I do like the way the trees in the background are out of focus.  It might be more pronounced if you could open up the lens more (use the largest aperture available).  The problem with doing this is that the focus on the subject becomes very critical.  I would try to take this picture from a slightly different angle to exclude the roof of the building.  Another suggestion would be to use the maximum resolution allowable for your challenge submissions.  I gave this one a 3 but I think with some work it could do much better.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I like the colors in this photo but I think it could be improved quite a bit overall.  The focus seems off to me but I do like the way the trees in the background are out of focus.  It might be more pronounced if you could open up the lens more (use the largest aperture available).  The problem with doing this is that the focus on the subject becomes very critical.  I would try to take this picture from a slightly different angle to exclude the roof of the building.  Another suggestion would be to use the maximum resolution allowable for your challenge submissions.  I gave this one a 3 but I think with some work it could do much better. Greg', '2003-04-09 00:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(259874, 17202, 6328, '<td valign="top">Great use of 3rds.  Lovely colors, reds and yellows, mixed with the dark greens. The focus is just fine and the lighting is fine, maybe a bit too bright on one or two of the petals.  Lovely photograph, great choice for this Challenge.</td>', 'Great use of 3rds.  Lovely colors, reds and yellows, mixed with the dark greens. The focus is just fine and the lighting is fine, maybe a bit too bright on one or two of the petals.  Lovely photograph, great choice for this Challenge.', '2003-04-09 00:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(259876, 17363, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great texture, accentuated by the color</td>', 'Great texture, accentuated by the color', '2003-04-09 00:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(259877, 17292, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice color, good focus, lighting is just fine, don''t understand why you cropped the top off like you did.</td>', 'Nice color, good focus, lighting is just fine, don''t understand why you cropped the top off like you did.', '2003-04-09 00:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(259879, 17259, 7033, '<td valign="top">Strong pixelation (esp. in the face) definitely detracts from this shot, in my opinion.</td>', 'Strong pixelation (esp. in the face) definitely detracts from this shot, in my opinion.', '2003-04-09 00:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(259880, 17228, 5120, '<td valign="top">I like the color in this picture.  This one is a pretty tough one to pull off because there isnt a lot going on to keep the viewers attention but the lighting makes the picture.  The thing that weakens the picture for me the most is the small amount of the lower windows that are showing at the bottom right side of the frame.  The thing that really makes me like this picture is the play of color between the yellow light in the upper windows with the gray of the roof and the deep blue of the sky.  I would definitely crop some off the bottom and maybe rotate the picture some to get the top of the roof parallel to the bottom of the frame.  I like this picture because of the color and lighting so I gave it a 5.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'I like the color in this picture.  This one is a pretty tough one to pull off because there isnt a lot going on to keep the viewers attention but the lighting makes the picture.  The thing that weakens the picture for me the most is the small amount of the lower windows that are showing at the bottom right side of the frame.  The thing that really makes me like this picture is the play of color between the yellow light in the upper windows with the gray of the roof and the deep blue of the sky.  I would definitely crop some off the bottom and maybe rotate the picture some to get the top of the roof parallel to the bottom of the frame.  I like this picture because of the color and lighting so I gave it a 5. Greg', '2003-04-09 00:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(259881, 17391, 3569, '<td valign="top">Knock-out colors.  Nice.</td>', 'Knock-out colors.  Nice.', '2003-04-09 00:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(259882, 17368, 7067, '<td valign="top">I typically enjoy wintery images and I quite like this one.  I only wish there was a little more contrast in brightness between the subject and the background to better offset the subject from the background.</td>', 'I typically enjoy wintery images and I quite like this one.  I only wish there was a little more contrast in brightness between the subject and the background to better offset the subject from the background.', '2003-04-09 00:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(259885, 17124, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice shot (I almost tried one similar myself).  Not sure the heavy grain adds much to the overall picture.</td>', 'Nice shot (I almost tried one similar myself).  Not sure the heavy grain adds much to the overall picture.', '2003-04-09 00:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(259886, 17346, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph of Victoria waterfront.  Really lovely colours at nighttime of course.  boats seem a bit greenish.</td>', 'Nice photograph of Victoria waterfront.  Really lovely colours at nighttime of course.  boats seem a bit greenish.', '2003-04-09 00:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(259887, 17550, 7033, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at here, but the abstractness doesn''t take away from the shot.  Color is fantastic!</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at here, but the abstractness doesn''t take away from the shot.  Color is fantastic!', '2003-04-09 00:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(259888, 16852, 3569, '<td valign="top">She is very beautiful.  I like the red hair, green eyes.  Kind of Irish looking.</td>', 'She is very beautiful.  I like the red hair, green eyes.  Kind of Irish looking.', '2003-04-09 00:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(259889, 17192, 2667, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea. But the scene looks a little staged and I don''t feel you have gotten close enough to your subject. I think a more extreme closeup, perhaps one showing some hands working on this piece, would have made this much stronger.</td>', 'This is a great idea. But the scene looks a little staged and I don''t feel you have gotten close enough to your subject. I think a more extreme closeup, perhaps one showing some hands working on this piece, would have made this much stronger.', '2003-04-09 00:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(259890, 17422, 7067, '<td valign="top">I wonder why these pencilcrayons have dots on them...  For better grip?  Or are they used by the visually impaired?</td>', 'I wonder why these pencilcrayons have dots on them...  For better grip?  Or are they used by the visually impaired?', '2003-04-09 00:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(259891, 17525, 3569, '<td valign="top">Beautiful iris.  All lines draw my eye to flower, good job.</td>', 'Beautiful iris.  All lines draw my eye to flower, good job.', '2003-04-09 00:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(259892, 17365, 6328, '<td valign="top">Crystal is sooo hard to photograph.  especially up close and in color.  Is this some kind if bug?  It looks like it.  I hope so.  Nice color, and it moves so nicely from one piece of stone to the other.</td>', 'Crystal is sooo hard to photograph.  especially up close and in color.  Is this some kind if bug?  It looks like it.  I hope so.  Nice color, and it moves so nicely from one piece of stone to the other.', '2003-04-09 00:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(259893, 17272, 5120, '<td valign="top">This picture would work as well for the symmetry challenge as it does for the color challenge.  I like the soft lighting but I wish the lead duck was a bit sharper.  I would also have cropped it to leave some space in front of the lead duck for him to swim into.  It might have also helped to have a very diminished light source on the left side of the camera to illuminate the visible side of the ducks faces but not so strong to compete with the main light.  I gave this one a 6.<br/> <br/>Greg<br/></td>', 'This picture would work as well for the symmetry challenge as it does for the color challenge.  I like the soft lighting but I wish the lead duck was a bit sharper.  I would also have cropped it to leave some space in front of the lead duck for him to swim into.  It might have also helped to have a very diminished light source on the left side of the camera to illuminate the visible side of the ducks faces but not so strong to compete with the main light.  I gave this one a 6. Greg', '2003-04-09 00:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(259894, 17341, 3569, '<td valign="top">I like red, but this didn''t work for me.  Blue or Green maybe.</td>', 'I like red, but this didn''t work for me.  Blue or Green maybe.', '2003-04-09 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(259895, 17190, 6328, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good color, lighting seems okay, focus is okay, good idea for the challenge too.</td>', 'Nice idea, good color, lighting seems okay, focus is okay, good idea for the challenge too.', '2003-04-09 00:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(259896, 16898, 3569, '<td valign="top">Lose the frame and you have a great shot.</td>', 'Lose the frame and you have a great shot.', '2003-04-09 00:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(259897, 17126, 7033, '<td valign="top">Potentially nice shot... a couple of things I would correct:  The shot needs to be rotated clockwise about 2° to bring the wall and telephone pole to vertical.  The shot seems to be a bit oversharpened, or perhaps tightly cropped from a bigger shot.  The blossoms on the tree would be more engaging if they were in better focus.  Overall, it also seems a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Potentially nice shot... a couple of things I would correct:  The shot needs to be rotated clockwise about 2° to bring the wall and telephone pole to vertical.  The shot seems to be a bit oversharpened, or perhaps tightly cropped from a bigger shot.  The blossoms on the tree would be more engaging if they were in better focus.  Overall, it also seems a bit overexposed.', '2003-04-09 00:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(259898, 17292, 2667, '<td valign="top">Very fun shot! Nice idea. Very colorful and well executed.</td>', 'Very fun shot! Nice idea. Very colorful and well executed.', '2003-04-09 00:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(259899, 17526, 6328, '<td valign="top">Great idea all that color outdoors on a snowy day.  sure brightens it up, eh!  looks like a bunch of kids playing outdoors.  nice color and good focus too.</td>', 'Great idea all that color outdoors on a snowy day.  sure brightens it up, eh!  looks like a bunch of kids playing outdoors.  nice color and good focus too.', '2003-04-09 00:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(259900, 17584, 3569, '<td valign="top">Better than M&amp;M,  Great shot..</td>', 'Better than M&M,  Great shot..', '2003-04-09 00:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(259901, 17016, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit morer contrast would have help.</td>', 'A bit morer contrast would have help.', '2003-04-09 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(259902, 17459, 3569, '<td valign="top">True colors.....</td>', 'True colors.....', '2003-04-09 00:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(259903, 16914, 6328, '<td valign="top">This is cute the way you''ve manage this photograph.  nice color, good focus.</td>', 'This is cute the way you''ve manage this photograph.  nice color, good focus.', '2003-04-09 00:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(259904, 17479, 3569, '<td valign="top">Very colorfully done.</td>', 'Very colorfully done.', '2003-04-09 00:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(259905, 17139, 6328, '<td valign="top">nice color, good focus, good idea for the challenge</td>', 'nice color, good focus, good idea for the challenge', '2003-04-09 00:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(259906, 17570, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the challenge... could benefit, in my opinion, from a sharper focus.  Also seems to be some chromatic abberation throughout the shot, particularly visible on the strings and the sharper edges in the shot.</td>', 'Nice approach to the challenge... could benefit, in my opinion, from a sharper focus.  Also seems to be some chromatic abberation throughout the shot, particularly visible on the strings and the sharper edges in the shot.', '2003-04-09 00:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(259908, 17552, 6328, '<td valign="top">well, for black and white and a bit of colored floor, I guess you just made it in for a colored Challenged.  good focus, good lighting.</td>', 'well, for black and white and a bit of colored floor, I guess you just made it in for a colored Challenged.  good focus, good lighting.', '2003-04-09 00:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(259910, 17307, 3569, '<td valign="top">The egg mades it work.</td>', 'The egg mades it work.', '2003-04-09 00:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(259913, 17309, 7033, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I think the shadows (particularly on the green ball) distract from the photo overall.  Still a good score from me, though.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I think the shadows (particularly on the green ball) distract from the photo overall.  Still a good score from me, though.', '2003-04-09 00:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(259914, 16956, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit soft in focus, but nicely done.</td>', 'A bit soft in focus, but nicely done.', '2003-04-09 00:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(259915, 17358, 7033, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower; lighting is different, yet quite interesting.  Focus is a bit soft for my personal taste, though.</td>', 'Beautiful flower; lighting is different, yet quite interesting.  Focus is a bit soft for my personal taste, though.', '2003-04-09 00:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(259916, 17209, 6328, '<td valign="top">really nice pink coloured flowers for this time of year, they give off such a rich vibrant smell to them (I wish) :]  Good focus, very interesting photograph.</td>', 'really nice pink coloured flowers for this time of year, they give off such a rich vibrant smell to them (I wish) :]  Good focus, very interesting photograph.', '2003-04-09 00:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(259917, 17552, 3569, '<td valign="top">Black &amp; white are nutrals,  brown is the color.</td>', 'Black & white are nutrals,  brown is the color.', '2003-04-09 00:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(259918, 16864, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice ''wild'' shot.  Fence adds a lot of visual interest to an otherwise boring scene.  Focus on the flowers themselves seems a bit soft, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice ''wild'' shot.  Fence adds a lot of visual interest to an otherwise boring scene.  Focus on the flowers themselves seems a bit soft, in my opinion.', '2003-04-09 00:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(259920, 17401, 6328, '<td valign="top">very nice colors of the berries and the leaves.  focus is just fine, lighting is okay, bit of a flashback off the berries, color is interesting and impressive.</td>', 'very nice colors of the berries and the leaves.  focus is just fine, lighting is okay, bit of a flashback off the berries, color is interesting and impressive.', '2003-04-09 00:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(259922, 17226, 3569, '<td valign="top">I think I woud have macro''ed or cropped more on the catepiller.  I like it though.</td>', 'I think I woud have macro''ed or cropped more on the catepiller.  I like it though.', '2003-04-09 00:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(259923, 17133, 3569, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful, even the fly.</td>', 'Simply beautiful, even the fly.', '2003-04-09 00:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(259924, 17582, 3569, '<td valign="top">Cracker Barrel special. Nice colors</td>', 'Cracker Barrel special. Nice colors', '2003-04-09 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(259926, 16897, 3569, '<td valign="top">abstractly good.</td>', 'abstractly good.', '2003-04-09 00:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(259927, 16794, 5070, '<td valign="top">very attractive</td>', 'very attractive', '2003-04-09 00:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(259931, 17227, 5070, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!</td>', 'I love this photo!', '2003-04-09 00:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(259933, 17226, 5070, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo.</td>', 'Terrific photo.', '2003-04-09 00:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(259935, 17056, 2560, '<td valign="top">It seems to need leveled up some and there is something on the right upper corner that is distracting.  good focus and color</td>', 'It seems to need leveled up some and there is something on the right upper corner that is distracting.  good focus and color', '2003-04-09 00:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(259938, 16898, 5070, '<td valign="top">Would have looked better with a bit of cropping &amp; without the border. Lovely colorful fish.</td>', 'Would have looked better with a bit of cropping & without the border. Lovely colorful fish.', '2003-04-09 00:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(259941, 17381, 2560, '<td valign="top">good color and detail, the vase is a little distracting and not needed, maybe use shallow dof and blurr it some.</td>', 'good color and detail, the vase is a little distracting and not needed, maybe use shallow dof and blurr it some.', '2003-04-09 00:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(259944, 17042, 6325, '<td valign="top">I am still trying to find the bluebonnets in Dallas area. The focus or the resolution seems off here and distracts from the image. Also might consider getting down lower.</td>', 'I am still trying to find the bluebonnets in Dallas area. The focus or the resolution seems off here and distracts from the image. Also might consider getting down lower.', '2003-04-09 00:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(259945, 17196, 2560, '<td valign="top">Nice use of angles and leading lines.</td>', 'Nice use of angles and leading lines.', '2003-04-09 00:57:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(259950, 17272, 6325, '<td valign="top">Why doesn''t the front duck have a bow? And why do have so many identical ducks? I likw the composiiton and it meets the challenge. Downsides are lighting could be brighter and the front duck could be in sharp focus.</td>', 'Why doesn''t the front duck have a bow? And why do have so many identical ducks? I likw the composiiton and it meets the challenge. Downsides are lighting could be brighter and the front duck could be in sharp focus.', '2003-04-09 00:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(259954, 17543, 6870, '<td valign="top">It''s almost like a motion blur from the center. It certainly adds drama.</td>', 'It''s almost like a motion blur from the center. It certainly adds drama.', '2003-04-09 01:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(259956, 17582, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice color subjects. The background does not add to the potential. If it could have been a solid white rather than white and gray, it would have been better. I often take a larger sheet of paper and bend a curve rather than a sharp angle. Could back off on the exposure to pump up the saturation.</td>', 'Nice color subjects. The background does not add to the potential. If it could have been a solid white rather than white and gray, it would have been better. I often take a larger sheet of paper and bend a curve rather than a sharp angle. Could back off on the exposure to pump up the saturation.', '2003-04-09 01:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(259958, 16812, 6325, '<td valign="top">LIke the green on green.</td>', 'LIke the green on green.', '2003-04-09 01:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(259960, 17408, 2560, '<td valign="top">Its got to be the Mountain Dew.</td>', 'Its got to be the Mountain Dew.', '2003-04-09 01:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(259961, 17588, 5070, '<td valign="top">almost unreal - the perfect grass and hills .. don''t like the reflection on the top sign though</td>', 'almost unreal - the perfect grass and hills .. don''t like the reflection on the top sign though', '2003-04-09 01:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(259963, 17126, 5070, '<td valign="top">looks very overexposed</td>', 'looks very overexposed', '2003-04-09 01:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(259967, 17429, 5070, '<td valign="top">this would have been nice for weather challnge</td>', 'this would have been nice for weather challnge', '2003-04-09 01:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(259969, 17265, 6325, '<td valign="top">LIke the blue and orange set off with the black and white. I think it would have added to the image if oyu had squared yourself up with the wall and window. I like the tight crop, but it points out the out of square.</td>', 'LIke the blue and orange set off with the black and white. I think it would have added to the image if oyu had squared yourself up with the wall and window. I like the tight crop, but it points out the out of square.', '2003-04-09 01:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(259971, 16956, 5070, '<td valign="top">not sharply focussed enough</td>', 'not sharply focussed enough', '2003-04-09 01:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(259972, 17486, 5070, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2003-04-09 01:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(259974, 17479, 6325, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painter''s pallette of colors.</td>', 'Looks like a painter''s pallette of colors.', '2003-04-09 01:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(259978, 17563, 6325, '<td valign="top">The yellow is a nice shade. It is lost in the other stuff going on in the picture. A tighter, more focused shot would have been better in my opinion.</td>', 'The yellow is a nice shade. It is lost in the other stuff going on in the picture. A tighter, more focused shot would have been better in my opinion.', '2003-04-09 01:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(259983, 17485, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really nice macro. The upward thrust of the stands create an almost temple-like mood, transporting this simple flower into a communication of mythic nature worship. Amen. 10</td>', 'Really nice macro. The upward thrust of the stands create an almost temple-like mood, transporting this simple flower into a communication of mythic nature worship. Amen. 10', '2003-04-09 01:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(259984, 17437, 6325, '<td valign="top">Lot of color. More punch would improve it.</td>', 'Lot of color. More punch would improve it.', '2003-04-09 01:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(259988, 16816, 6870, '<td valign="top">The colors here, and the composition, suggest to me that the partying going on in the background are barred from me. I''m stuck here in the dreary world of brown and corrosion and rust. Bummer. 10</td>', 'The colors here, and the composition, suggest to me that the partying going on in the background are barred from me. I''m stuck here in the dreary world of brown and corrosion and rust. Bummer. 10', '2003-04-09 01:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(259990, 17250, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The shape created by the furniture and the "sky" are good.  More punch in the cloth would be better.</td>', 'I like the composition. The shape created by the furniture and the "sky" are good.  More punch in the cloth would be better.', '2003-04-09 01:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(259992, 17486, 6870, '<td valign="top">Now I want to see #2. This image suggests an entire planet to me, with lots of inviting colors. I may be taking a leap, but I''m giving this a 9 for mood and great communication of theme. Nice composition.</td>', 'Now I want to see #2. This image suggests an entire planet to me, with lots of inviting colors. I may be taking a leap, but I''m giving this a 9 for mood and great communication of theme. Nice composition.', '2003-04-09 01:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(259994, 17124, 6870, '<td valign="top">If anyone criticizes your graininess here, they''ll have to answer to me! It belongs and adds a nostalgia that would otherwise not be as present. Well composed, too.</td>', 'If anyone criticizes your graininess here, they''ll have to answer to me! It belongs and adds a nostalgia that would otherwise not be as present. Well composed, too.', '2003-04-09 01:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(259995, 17552, 6870, '<td valign="top">I, for one, believe that black and white are colors! And I also think that is is a good image with cool shadows and contrasts.</td>', 'I, for one, believe that black and white are colors! And I also think that is is a good image with cool shadows and contrasts.', '2003-04-09 01:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(259996, 17495, 6325, '<td valign="top">Like the little punches of purple.</td>', 'Like the little punches of purple.', '2003-04-09 01:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
