(260138, 17218, 7751, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. I would have set the glasses side by side so they were even. This is really a good photo. I love the swirls in the glass.</td>', 'This is awesome. I would have set the glasses side by side so they were even. This is really a good photo. I love the swirls in the glass.', '2003-04-09 04:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(260139, 16811, 7751, '<td valign="top">Oooohhh....Very impressive. This is one of my faves so far. THe colors are so pure....</td>', 'Oooohhh....Very impressive. This is one of my faves so far. THe colors are so pure....', '2003-04-09 04:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(260140, 17588, 7067, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.  Just not sure I like the centering of that tree.  And the glare off the top sign is really distracting.</td>', 'Nice colours.  Just not sure I like the centering of that tree.  And the glare off the top sign is really distracting.', '2003-04-09 04:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(260141, 17509, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice texture.</td>', 'Nice texture.', '2003-04-09 04:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(260142, 17124, 7510, '<td valign="top">Grainy.  The image seems broken up by the edge of the metal tin.</td>', 'Grainy.  The image seems broken up by the edge of the metal tin.', '2003-04-09 04:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(260143, 17202, 7067, '<td valign="top">I like the muted dark shades of the leaves juxtaposed against the warm tones of the flower.  Composition is also quite pleasing.  However, I find my eye wandering to the leaves at the top, so it would be nicer if the focus on the leaves was less sharp than the flowers.</td>', 'I like the muted dark shades of the leaves juxtaposed against the warm tones of the flower.  Composition is also quite pleasing.  However, I find my eye wandering to the leaves at the top, so it would be nicer if the focus on the leaves was less sharp than the flowers.', '2003-04-09 04:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(260144, 17496, 7067, '<td valign="top">There is a nice levity in this picture.  I''ve tried taking pictures inside a arboratorium before but found the dim lighting conditions difficult to work with and I didn''t have a tripod with me at time.  I think your exposure is spot on here.</td>', 'There is a nice levity in this picture.  I''ve tried taking pictures inside a arboratorium before but found the dim lighting conditions difficult to work with and I didn''t have a tripod with me at time.  I think your exposure is spot on here.', '2003-04-09 04:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(260147, 17136, 7067, '<td valign="top">I find myself wishing that the largest branch or tree (or whatever that is) be in sharper focus.</td>', 'I find myself wishing that the largest branch or tree (or whatever that is) be in sharper focus.', '2003-04-09 05:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(260149, 17304, 7510, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the angle of the flower, and it is partially covered by the leaf.</td>', 'I don''t like the angle of the flower, and it is partially covered by the leaf.', '2003-04-09 05:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(260150, 17369, 7510, '<td valign="top">nice bold colour.  The flower is a little droopy....</td>', 'nice bold colour.  The flower is a little droopy....', '2003-04-09 05:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(260151, 17016, 7067, '<td valign="top">This image is a too light overall for my taste.  I would prefer to see a greater tonal range, esp. the brances being darker.</td>', 'This image is a too light overall for my taste.  I would prefer to see a greater tonal range, esp. the brances being darker.', '2003-04-09 05:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(260152, 17286, 7067, '<td valign="top">I took several similar shots of white lilies a few months ago :)</td>', 'I took several similar shots of white lilies a few months ago :)', '2003-04-09 05:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(260154, 17412, 7067, '<td valign="top">Intriguing.  Are those ripples of the fabric or are they caused by window blinds?</td>', 'Intriguing.  Are those ripples of the fabric or are they caused by window blinds?', '2003-04-09 05:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(260155, 17259, 7067, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting.  I like the expression on her face.  But what is that distracting rectangular thing on the bottom left?</td>', 'Looks like a painting.  I like the expression on her face.  But what is that distracting rectangular thing on the bottom left?', '2003-04-09 05:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(260156, 17590, 7067, '<td valign="top">I quite like the diffuse lighting here.  Hmm... I might like it a tad more if the light was a little warmer looking.</td>', 'I quite like the diffuse lighting here.  Hmm... I might like it a tad more if the light was a little warmer looking.', '2003-04-09 05:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(260157, 17578, 7067, '<td valign="top">Very neat effect, almost like solarization.  But I don''t see the relevance to colour.</td>', 'Very neat effect, almost like solarization.  But I don''t see the relevance to colour.', '2003-04-09 05:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(260158, 16932, 7067, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset capture.  I''m not sure I agree with your cropping, but then again I don''t know how I would crop it myself.</td>', 'Nice sunset capture.  I''m not sure I agree with your cropping, but then again I don''t know how I would crop it myself.', '2003-04-09 05:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
