(260205, 17345, 7510, '<td valign="top">What cute little lighthouse.  I love the blue water peppered by the white waves.  great framing. (9)</td>', 'What cute little lighthouse.  I love the blue water peppered by the white waves.  great framing. (9)', '2003-04-09 07:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
