(260208, 16898, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  I find the boarder to be a little distracting, as it cuts through a couple of fish.  Maybe if you cropped it differently on the right the boarder would look better.  It looks a little uneven too (more space on the right). (8)</td>', 'Nice colors.  I find the boarder to be a little distracting, as it cuts through a couple of fish.  Maybe if you cropped it differently on the right the boarder would look better.  It looks a little uneven too (more space on the right). (8)', '2003-04-09 07:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
