(260224, 17521, 6536, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Great composition &amp; colors. 10.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Great composition & colors. 10.', '2003-04-09 08:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(260225, 17127, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot... the lighting is excellent and i particularly like the light on the stem of the red pepper... great work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'beautiful shot... the lighting is excellent and i particularly like the light on the stem of the red pepper... great work :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-09 08:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(260226, 17462, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice work... the color contrast here is excellent.  The calla is a beautiful flower and I''m hoping to make some photos of a white calla myself over the weekend.  - setzler</td>', 'very nice work... the color contrast here is excellent.  The calla is a beautiful flower and I''m hoping to make some photos of a white calla myself over the weekend.  - setzler', '2003-04-09 08:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(260227, 17479, 6536, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. It has wonderful colors &amp; composition. 10.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. It has wonderful colors & composition. 10.', '2003-04-09 08:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(260233, 17437, 4517, '<td valign="top">Did you laugh when you saw this weeks challenge. Nice colours. I could just eat one of those.Good luck.</td>', 'Did you laugh when you saw this weeks challenge. Nice colours. I could just eat one of those.Good luck.', '2003-04-09 08:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(260235, 17364, 772, '<td valign="top">The color and composition here is absolutely perfect... the contrast of color definitely makes ''color'' the primary theme in this photo as the challenge requested... great shot :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'The color and composition here is absolutely perfect... the contrast of color definitely makes ''color'' the primary theme in this photo as the challenge requested... great shot :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-09 08:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(260243, 17509, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic pastel colors! So simple but with so much impact, good job!</td>', 'Fantastic pastel colors! So simple but with so much impact, good job!', '2003-04-09 09:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(260244, 17405, 5728, '<td valign="top">Love the red/brown tones here. The clearness of the water does so much to this image.</td>', 'Love the red/brown tones here. The clearness of the water does so much to this image.', '2003-04-09 09:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(260245, 17040, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. This is a photo I would expect to find somewhere as a poster, congratulations its very good.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. This is a photo I would expect to find somewhere as a poster, congratulations its very good.', '2003-04-09 09:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(260246, 17391, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro, very clear and sharp - 8.</td>', 'Beautiful macro, very clear and sharp - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(260247, 17508, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture, the colors are amazing. Good job - 8.</td>', 'Fantastic capture, the colors are amazing. Good job - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(260248, 17582, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an original idea and it turned out fantastically, good job - 8.</td>', 'This is an original idea and it turned out fantastically, good job - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(260250, 16945, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I love this one, the colors are cool, and there are absolutely no hot spots or reflections. I myself would have have cropped it a little tighter at the sides though - 8.</td>', 'Awesome! I love this one, the colors are cool, and there are absolutely no hot spots or reflections. I myself would have have cropped it a little tighter at the sides though - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(260251, 17462, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The negative space fits in well here - 8.</td>', 'Beautiful. The negative space fits in well here - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(260252, 17368, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful DOF, the color of the berries comes through the ice vividly - 8.</td>', 'Wonderful DOF, the color of the berries comes through the ice vividly - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(260253, 17309, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and very successful, good job - 8.</td>', 'Very abstract and very successful, good job - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(260254, 17513, 5728, '<td valign="top">Amazing tone of red here! This also would have done well in the symmetry challenge - 8.</td>', 'Amazing tone of red here! This also would have done well in the symmetry challenge - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(260255, 17575, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow you got a lot of shades of blue in here. They come across very solidly, awesome - 8.</td>', 'Wow you got a lot of shades of blue in here. They come across very solidly, awesome - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(260256, 17294, 5728, '<td valign="top">Most of all I love the flow and composition of this photo before I look at the color aspect. The green comes through very richly and the yellow of the corn stalks complements it well. Overall, a very good image - 8.</td>', 'Most of all I love the flow and composition of this photo before I look at the color aspect. The green comes through very richly and the yellow of the corn stalks complements it well. Overall, a very good image - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(260258, 17556, 5728, '<td valign="top">Flowers will always do well in color contests, be they fresh or dried. Your flower is also very good especially as it gives me the impression of crispness. I can almost feel the crisp dry petals. The DOF is shallow and effective, good job - 8.</td>', 'Flowers will always do well in color contests, be they fresh or dried. Your flower is also very good especially as it gives me the impression of crispness. I can almost feel the crisp dry petals. The DOF is shallow and effective, good job - 8.', '2003-04-09 09:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(260261, 17434, 5728, '<td valign="top">Some nice colors in your cat, is this a tortoise shell cat? Parts of the photo seem a little fuzzy to me, maybe it happened during saving for the web process maybe?</td>', 'Some nice colors in your cat, is this a tortoise shell cat? Parts of the photo seem a little fuzzy to me, maybe it happened during saving for the web process maybe?', '2003-04-09 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(260262, 17306, 5515, '<td valign="top">A really good image. If I may be so bold as to make a couple  of suggestions. This image is really relying on symmetry. Next time make the center circle perfect and the crayons line up perfectly. REALLLY hard to do. I know I did a similar shot with sharpie markers and it almost killed me. LOL. I like the white background and the shadows, you really exposed this well. I would have pumped the Saturation a little more but that is a personal thing. Overall I like the image.... Dave</td>', 'A really good image. If I may be so bold as to make a couple  of suggestions. This image is really relying on symmetry. Next time make the center circle perfect and the crayons line up perfectly. REALLLY hard to do. I know I did a similar shot with sharpie markers and it almost killed me. LOL. I like the white background and the shadows, you really exposed this well. I would have pumped the Saturation a little more but that is a personal thing. Overall I like the image.... Dave', '2003-04-09 09:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(260264, 17558, 5728, '<td valign="top">Porsche? It is a little disturbing to the eye that the front of the car is is facing downwards a little, the whole car is not square in the photo. Also the light is slightly blowing the windshield out in the middle. The border fits excellently to this image.</td>', 'Porsche? It is a little disturbing to the eye that the front of the car is is facing downwards a little, the whole car is not square in the photo. Also the light is slightly blowing the windshield out in the middle. The border fits excellently to this image.', '2003-04-09 09:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(260265, 17193, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow this looks psychedelic, but an interesting shot full of colors.</td>', 'Wow this looks psychedelic, but an interesting shot full of colors.', '2003-04-09 09:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(260266, 17307, 5728, '<td valign="top">What are peepers? You''ve got a nice rich purple coming through here. I personally would have used a different color background though, not one the same color as your main subject.</td>', 'What are peepers? You''ve got a nice rich purple coming through here. I personally would have used a different color background though, not one the same color as your main subject.', '2003-04-09 09:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(260267, 17037, 5728, '<td valign="top">The blurred focus works well here, interesting!</td>', 'The blurred focus works well here, interesting!', '2003-04-09 09:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(260268, 17272, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well we''ve all got a chance at getting the blue ribbon here, but I see you already have 4 of them :-) Nice pic, the border fits in well.</td>', 'Well we''ve all got a chance at getting the blue ribbon here, but I see you already have 4 of them :-) Nice pic, the border fits in well.', '2003-04-09 09:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(260269, 17376, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good compostition and crop here. Personally I would have increased the saturation a little to bring out the green and purple/blue more.</td>', 'Good compostition and crop here. Personally I would have increased the saturation a little to bring out the green and purple/blue more.', '2003-04-09 09:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(260272, 17277, 5728, '<td valign="top">Simple but colorful. Personally I would have tightened the crop a little, or maybe gotten it squarer.</td>', 'Simple but colorful. Personally I would have tightened the crop a little, or maybe gotten it squarer.', '2003-04-09 10:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(260273, 17567, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lots of color in that poster, the shadows are a little annoying though. If you had maybe moved the lighting differently you might have avoided that shadow covering the bottom half of the image. I like the illusion of the tears as if they are flowing onto the sheet itself.</td>', 'Lots of color in that poster, the shadows are a little annoying though. If you had maybe moved the lighting differently you might have avoided that shadow covering the bottom half of the image. I like the illusion of the tears as if they are flowing onto the sheet itself.', '2003-04-09 10:13:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(260274, 17552, 5728, '<td valign="top">I guess black and white are colors too. Aren''t they? But you really gotta clean your shoes :-)</td>', 'I guess black and white are colors too. Aren''t they? But you really gotta clean your shoes :-)', '2003-04-09 10:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(260276, 17224, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lots of different colors there for sure, I would have composed it, or cropped it a little differently though, or maybe have stood a little higher and taken your shot looking more downwards.</td>', 'Lots of different colors there for sure, I would have composed it, or cropped it a little differently though, or maybe have stood a little higher and taken your shot looking more downwards.', '2003-04-09 10:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(260282, 17122, 5728, '<td valign="top">A nice colorful image, maybe it might have had a lot more impact if you had increased the saturation levels a little, or adjusted the tonal curves.</td>', 'A nice colorful image, maybe it might have had a lot more impact if you had increased the saturation levels a little, or adjusted the tonal curves.', '2003-04-09 10:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(260283, 17315, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now that is a firey sky! I particularly like the contrast of the black silohuettes (houses?) at the bottom of the image.</td>', 'Now that is a firey sky! I particularly like the contrast of the black silohuettes (houses?) at the bottom of the image.', '2003-04-09 10:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(260284, 17469, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yep it is rather devoid of color! Although rust is a color too, and you have several tones of brown here.</td>', 'Yep it is rather devoid of color! Although rust is a color too, and you have several tones of brown here.', '2003-04-09 10:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(260285, 17338, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, lots of colors represented here. I like the pattern, the only thing that bothers me a little is the blue splotch up in the top left hand corner.</td>', 'Nice set up, lots of colors represented here. I like the pattern, the only thing that bothers me a little is the blue splotch up in the top left hand corner.', '2003-04-09 10:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(260286, 17205, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very colorful! I guess you have represented every color of the spectrum here :-) You can''t meet the challenge any better than that!</td>', 'Very colorful! I guess you have represented every color of the spectrum here :-) You can''t meet the challenge any better than that!', '2003-04-09 10:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(260288, 17350, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image. The colors that you have represented are shown vividly, good job. The only thing I would change is the crop, it isn''t square. A little more crop on the left side would have done a lot to this photo. Or else the photo in portrait format with the whole window frame contained.</td>', 'This is a very nice image. The colors that you have represented are shown vividly, good job. The only thing I would change is the crop, it isn''t square. A little more crop on the left side would have done a lot to this photo. Or else the photo in portrait format with the whole window frame contained.', '2003-04-09 10:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(260291, 17319, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny! What is that purple gooey stuff? Good idea, the black stick in the top left hand corner is a little distracting though.</td>', 'Funny! What is that purple gooey stuff? Good idea, the black stick in the top left hand corner is a little distracting though.', '2003-04-09 10:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(260292, 17402, 5728, '<td valign="top">Red on white is always a good bet, and you have done it well.</td>', 'Red on white is always a good bet, and you have done it well.', '2003-04-09 10:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(260293, 17206, 1202, '<td valign="top">Spring is wonderful.   IMO you have tried to capture a portion of it but your picture has some flaws.   Try to avoid making a picture with numerous lines going in all directions and be sure you have a main topic that is in crystal clear focus.</td>', 'Spring is wonderful.   IMO you have tried to capture a portion of it but your picture has some flaws.   Try to avoid making a picture with numerous lines going in all directions and be sure you have a main topic that is in crystal clear focus.', '2003-04-09 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(260294, 17574, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great photo, rich color, well done. The border fits in well and the shallow DOF lends this image a soft effect, good one.</td>', 'Great photo, rich color, well done. The border fits in well and the shallow DOF lends this image a soft effect, good one.', '2003-04-09 10:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(260295, 17277, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have a nice composition, but the clor does not pop.   I think you needed a little more light to brighten it up. 5</td>', 'You have a nice composition, but the clor does not pop.   I think you needed a little more light to brighten it up. 5', '2003-04-09 10:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(260296, 17472, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have color alright but it doesn''t pop.   The black background appears to soak up all of the light, maybe something different in the back would be good.   Light is everything.</td>', 'You have color alright but it doesn''t pop.   The black background appears to soak up all of the light, maybe something different in the back would be good.   Light is everything.', '2003-04-09 10:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(260298, 17294, 1202, '<td valign="top">nice composition and use of curves.   IMO the dark border distracts from the scene.</td>', 'nice composition and use of curves.   IMO the dark border distracts from the scene.', '2003-04-09 10:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(260299, 16943, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful! The DOF gives this photo such a soft pastel effect. I hope you do well with this, good luck - Gary.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful! The DOF gives this photo such a soft pastel effect. I hope you do well with this, good luck - Gary.', '2003-04-09 10:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
