(260302, 17133, 5728, '<td valign="top">Awesome macro, the shallow DOF does a lot for this image, especially considering the sharpness of the flower and the fly. Good job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-04-14 07:19:20.</i></td>', 'Awesome macro, the shallow DOF does a lot for this image, especially considering the sharpness of the flower and the fly. Good job!', '2003-04-09 10:51:50.000000', '2003-04-14 08:19:20.000000', 1),
