(260311, 17448, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah this is original! These guys always looks very colorful, you have a good idea here and you captured it well too. What is that yellow blur in the bottom left hand corner? It''s a little disturbing, but overall very good.</td>', 'Ah this is original! These guys always looks very colorful, you have a good idea here and you captured it well too. What is that yellow blur in the bottom left hand corner? It''s a little disturbing, but overall very good.', '2003-04-09 11:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(260312, 17502, 5728, '<td valign="top">Aww how sweet! I like it, the reds come out well on a white background, that''s always a safe bet for color contrasts. The flower just adds to the impact, good shot.</td>', 'Aww how sweet! I like it, the reds come out well on a white background, that''s always a safe bet for color contrasts. The flower just adds to the impact, good shot.', '2003-04-09 11:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
