(260412, 17564, 5728, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what this is but you do have many tones of purple represented here. Interesting light effects too - Gary.</td>', 'I am not sure what this is but you do have many tones of purple represented here. Interesting light effects too - Gary.', '2003-04-09 11:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(260413, 17588, 7800, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Too bad about the glare on the upper sign. I love the shape of the hills.</td>', 'Great shot! Too bad about the glare on the upper sign. I love the shape of the hills.', '2003-04-09 11:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(260415, 17037, 6328, '<td valign="top">do detail, just blurry color, no points</td>', 'do detail, just blurry color, no points', '2003-04-09 11:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(260416, 17524, 1202, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this just doesn''t do anything for me.   I would be interested to see a real clear shot of a perfect bannana in its natural state done with the same composition.   4</td>', 'I''m sorry but this just doesn''t do anything for me.   I would be interested to see a real clear shot of a perfect bannana in its natural state done with the same composition.   4', '2003-04-09 11:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(260417, 17168, 7800, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp and great choice of depth of field. Maybe could have cropped a little less tight at the top.</td>', 'Nice and sharp and great choice of depth of field. Maybe could have cropped a little less tight at the top.', '2003-04-09 11:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(260420, 17204, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  A tad bright for me but very well done!</td>', 'This is lovely.  A tad bright for me but very well done!', '2003-04-09 11:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(260422, 17359, 7504, '<td valign="top">Ah, memeries of Mom''s fozen peas.  Great idea!</td>', 'Ah, memeries of Mom''s fozen peas.  Great idea!', '2003-04-09 11:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(260424, 17553, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid orange there! If you had opened the aperture wide open then you would have gotten a shallow DOF thereby blurring the background out. At the moment the background is in focus and distracts the eye somewhat.</td>', 'Nice vivid orange there! If you had opened the aperture wide open then you would have gotten a shallow DOF thereby blurring the background out. At the moment the background is in focus and distracts the eye somewhat.', '2003-04-09 11:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(260427, 17291, 1202, '<td valign="top">For some reason I want to turn it 90 degrees to the right.   the closest helmet is a little out of focus but you almost got them all, good try.   what are the vertical lines in the background?   5</td>', 'For some reason I want to turn it 90 degrees to the right.   the closest helmet is a little out of focus but you almost got them all, good try.   what are the vertical lines in the background?   5', '2003-04-09 11:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(260429, 16784, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid colors here, the graininess also works well. Is that vignetting in the top corners?</td>', 'Nice vivid colors here, the graininess also works well. Is that vignetting in the top corners?', '2003-04-09 11:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(260433, 17329, 7800, '<td valign="top">I love this picture; great colors. I would have rated higher but I can''t find the spot that is clearly in focus.</td>', 'I love this picture; great colors. I would have rated higher but I can''t find the spot that is clearly in focus.', '2003-04-09 11:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(260434, 17223, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, nice composition, well done.</td>', 'Very colorful, nice composition, well done.', '2003-04-09 11:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(260439, 17196, 1202, '<td valign="top">Too bad the people in the background didn''t stay home for you.   I think you need a close main colorful subject to frame the background with.   The blue flowers don''t quite fit the bill.   6</td>', 'Too bad the people in the background didn''t stay home for you.   I think you need a close main colorful subject to frame the background with.   The blue flowers don''t quite fit the bill.   6', '2003-04-09 11:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(260443, 17350, 6328, '<td valign="top">You\''ve captured some character in this Character in the window.  The color are just fine but a little boring with the window cropped off like this.  You should have given us \"more \" window to see what was taking place in the background.</td>', 'You\''ve captured some character in this Character in the window.  The color are just fine but a little boring with the window cropped off like this.  You should have given us \"more \" window to see what was taking place in the background.', '2003-04-09 11:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(260449, 17054, 1202, '<td valign="top">Your flag is wonderful, but the two angles made by the roof top and the pole are fighting each othe making the picture hard to really enjoy.  6</td>', 'Your flag is wonderful, but the two angles made by the roof top and the pole are fighting each othe making the picture hard to really enjoy.  6', '2003-04-09 11:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(260451, 17362, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot of a daffodil. DOF is good and the blue sky in the background brings in the third major color successfully. I probably wouldn''t have cropped out the petal in the right but that is a matter of taste - Gary.</td>', 'Excellent shot of a daffodil. DOF is good and the blue sky in the background brings in the third major color successfully. I probably wouldn''t have cropped out the petal in the right but that is a matter of taste - Gary.', '2003-04-09 11:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(260461, 17434, 6328, '<td valign="top">He doesn\''t look very happy, does he?  Beautiful colors on his coat.  Good lighting makes time for a good focus.  Really strong visual impact - shows interest, emotion, as if this cat were trying to say something. . .<br/>What\''s he sitting on - snow?  Is he Cold!?  Look at his eyes - Is he crying??<br/>That\''s what I\''m reading from this Photograph-kinda sad looking<br/></td>', 'He doesn\''t look very happy, does he?  Beautiful colors on his coat.  Good lighting makes time for a good focus.  Really strong visual impact - shows interest, emotion, as if this cat were trying to say something. . .What\''s he sitting on - snow?  Is he Cold!?  Look at his eyes - Is he crying??That\''s what I\''m reading from this Photograph-kinda sad looking', '2003-04-09 11:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(260463, 17109, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good concept. As the still life photo., IMO, should be careful on the shot. Eg, the background on the right is distractinge</td>', 'Good concept. As the still life photo., IMO, should be careful on the shot. Eg, the background on the right is distractinge', '2003-04-09 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(260467, 17000, 5728, '<td valign="top">Colorful! The focus is good. I am not sure if the shadow on the left is distracting or not. I think it is, maybe it would have been better to either have it running parallel to the angle of "blind" or crop it out all together.</td>', 'Colorful! The focus is good. I am not sure if the shadow on the left is distracting or not. I think it is, maybe it would have been better to either have it running parallel to the angle of "blind" or crop it out all together.', '2003-04-09 11:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(260471, 17357, 2978, '<td valign="top">The two tone colour is great here. The background looks nice to the flower.</td>', 'The two tone colour is great here. The background looks nice to the flower.', '2003-04-09 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(260478, 17190, 5728, '<td valign="top">Mmm I love these, I could eat them all day. You have a nice colorful pile here, looks good. The lighting is a little harsh on the surfaces but not blown out at all so it isn''t that bad, I like it.</td>', 'Mmm I love these, I could eat them all day. You have a nice colorful pile here, looks good. The lighting is a little harsh on the surfaces but not blown out at all so it isn''t that bad, I like it.', '2003-04-09 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(260483, 16816, 5728, '<td valign="top">I love the texture and color of rust and this one looks good. You have a shallow DOF here but somehow the background is still a little distracting.</td>', 'I love the texture and color of rust and this one looks good. You have a shallow DOF here but somehow the background is still a little distracting.', '2003-04-09 11:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
