(260756, 17430, 5865, '<td valign="top">Something seems lopsided here.  I think it would be better if the line of the housetops was level to the top of the frame.  Also the focus does not seem sharp enough.  If you look at the clock on the church, for instance, that is out of focus.  Sharpness improves an image a lot if you can manage it.</td>', 'Something seems lopsided here.  I think it would be better if the line of the housetops was level to the top of the frame.  Also the focus does not seem sharp enough.  If you look at the clock on the church, for instance, that is out of focus.  Sharpness improves an image a lot if you can manage it.', '2003-04-09 14:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(260757, 17462, 7711, '<td valign="top">Rule of thirds, is it? Well DONE on that front, and nothing is more delicately beautiful than a calla lily. The blue background brings out the colour of the calla perfectly. -10-</td>', 'Rule of thirds, is it? Well DONE on that front, and nothing is more delicately beautiful than a calla lily. The blue background brings out the colour of the calla perfectly. -10-', '2003-04-09 14:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(260758, 17556, 6900, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - excellent technical details and interesting composition.  Flower looks a weeeee wilty?  :)  Anyways, great shot. 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot - excellent technical details and interesting composition.  Flower looks a weeeee wilty?  :)  Anyways, great shot. 8', '2003-04-09 14:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(260759, 17375, 5865, '<td valign="top">One of those photographs where I would love to know how you did it.  However it was done it makes for a lovely photograph.</td>', 'One of those photographs where I would love to know how you did it.  However it was done it makes for a lovely photograph.', '2003-04-09 14:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
