(260765, 17054, 5865, '<td valign="top">I think adding the green roof (if that''s what it is) at the bottom of your photograph has added a lot to the composition.  Also the texture of the roof adds interest.  Great shot.</td>', 'I think adding the green roof (if that''s what it is) at the bottom of your photograph has added a lot to the composition.  Also the texture of the roof adds interest.  Great shot.', '2003-04-09 15:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(260766, 17127, 5865, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting on this shot.</td>', 'Lovely lighting on this shot.', '2003-04-09 15:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(260767, 16995, 5865, '<td valign="top">Nearly a great shot.  Something is not quite right.  I think that the signs etc stuck up in the windows is distracting.  The photograph would look less busy if only a sign or a part of the sign had been used, but that is just my opinion.</td>', 'Nearly a great shot.  Something is not quite right.  I think that the signs etc stuck up in the windows is distracting.  The photograph would look less busy if only a sign or a part of the sign had been used, but that is just my opinion.', '2003-04-09 15:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(260768, 17581, 4411, '<td valign="top">What a cool idea. Original, and a great way of showing colour.<br/>I would have prefered a tighter framing, losing the bottom of the vases, to make it more abstract, but that''s probably just personal taste.<br/>Great shot, well done.</td>', 'What a cool idea. Original, and a great way of showing colour.I would have prefered a tighter framing, losing the bottom of the vases, to make it more abstract, but that''s probably just personal taste.Great shot, well done.', '2003-04-09 15:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(260769, 17000, 7711, '<td valign="top">what perfect social commentary in a picture. Looks like the ''light'' is finally dawning in the picture. :)</td>', 'what perfect social commentary in a picture. Looks like the ''light'' is finally dawning in the picture. :)', '2003-04-09 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(260770, 17202, 5865, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice composition, but the leaves are a little dull.  The use of a flash may have helped.</td>', 'It''s a nice composition, but the leaves are a little dull.  The use of a flash may have helped.', '2003-04-09 15:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(260771, 17561, 7350, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but very dark and not vibrant at all.</td>', 'Good idea, but very dark and not vibrant at all.', '2003-04-09 15:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(260772, 16789, 7711, '<td valign="top">is it the lack of colour in "life" that is the message? Interesting concept!</td>', 'is it the lack of colour in "life" that is the message? Interesting concept!', '2003-04-09 15:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(260773, 17538, 4411, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.<br/>A very different angle to shoot the bridge from, and good contrast with the pencils in the foreground. A shame the orange one isn''t straight, but there''s nothing else wrong with this shot.</td>', 'Neat idea.A very different angle to shoot the bridge from, and good contrast with the pencils in the foreground. A shame the orange one isn''t straight, but there''s nothing else wrong with this shot.', '2003-04-09 15:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(260774, 17578, 6900, '<td valign="top">I know some people wanted to ''stretch'' the challenge limits with black and white, but it just doesn''t work for me.  This shot wasn''t designed to please the average voter anyways, so - the spots are blurry, the guy is pretty easy to see so if it''s camouflaged ''color'' - he''s deadman walkin.</td>', 'I know some people wanted to ''stretch'' the challenge limits with black and white, but it just doesn''t work for me.  This shot wasn''t designed to please the average voter anyways, so - the spots are blurry, the guy is pretty easy to see so if it''s camouflaged ''color'' - he''s deadman walkin.', '2003-04-09 15:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(260775, 17005, 5865, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have looked better if the flower had filled the frame entirely.  Seeing beyond the flower (at the left hand side) spoils the whole image as far as I am concerned, but the colours captured are great.</td>', 'I think this shot would have looked better if the flower had filled the frame entirely.  Seeing beyond the flower (at the left hand side) spoils the whole image as far as I am concerned, but the colours captured are great.', '2003-04-09 15:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(260776, 17578, 7711, '<td valign="top">I get the idea behind this picture, but it just doesn''t pull it off for me.</td>', 'I get the idea behind this picture, but it just doesn''t pull it off for me.', '2003-04-09 15:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(260778, 17178, 5865, '<td valign="top">Very unusual pose for the model and I think it has worked well.  The lighting is terrific.</td>', 'Very unusual pose for the model and I think it has worked well.  The lighting is terrific.', '2003-04-09 15:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(260779, 16943, 5865, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro photograph.  I love the blue background too.</td>', 'Beautiful macro photograph.  I love the blue background too.', '2003-04-09 15:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(260780, 17259, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like the color to go with the picture, but it''s REALLY pixelly - was it a super small file blown up large?</td>', 'I like the color to go with the picture, but it''s REALLY pixelly - was it a super small file blown up large?', '2003-04-09 15:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(260781, 17481, 7711, '<td valign="top">sadly, this is very out of focus, and a bit too dark.</td>', 'sadly, this is very out of focus, and a bit too dark.', '2003-04-09 15:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(260783, 16816, 5865, '<td valign="top">I''ve never found rust very inspiring, but the way you have used the shallow depth of field has made the photograph insteresting.</td>', 'I''ve never found rust very inspiring, but the way you have used the shallow depth of field has made the photograph insteresting.', '2003-04-09 15:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(260784, 17307, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like the green egg as using color to compose the shot.  However, the closest peep is overexposed and the egg isn''t near the center of the shot - so it''s hard to figure out what is going on - why are there three?  What if you did the same thing with the two ducks (mother and father?) looking over one green egg, like "why is it GREEN?"  THAT is a colorful composition! :)</td>', 'I like the green egg as using color to compose the shot.  However, the closest peep is overexposed and the egg isn''t near the center of the shot - so it''s hard to figure out what is going on - why are there three?  What if you did the same thing with the two ducks (mother and father?) looking over one green egg, like "why is it GREEN?"  THAT is a colorful composition! :)', '2003-04-09 15:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(260785, 17400, 5865, '<td valign="top">I like the background and the pose of the model, but I think it''s a pity that the lighting is so harsh.  It has taken a lot of the natural colour out of the model''s face, but I still enjoyed looking at your photograph.</td>', 'I like the background and the pose of the model, but I think it''s a pity that the lighting is so harsh.  It has taken a lot of the natural colour out of the model''s face, but I still enjoyed looking at your photograph.', '2003-04-09 15:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(260786, 17576, 6900, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how color affects this shot.  It''s an interesting shot of the mess, but what does the blue bag have to do with anything?</td>', 'I''m not sure how color affects this shot.  It''s an interesting shot of the mess, but what does the blue bag have to do with anything?', '2003-04-09 15:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(260787, 17262, 5865, '<td valign="top">That''s a good idea.  I think it might have helped if there was more symmetry in the shot by placing the middle row of CD''s directly in the middle.</td>', 'That''s a good idea.  I think it might have helped if there was more symmetry in the shot by placing the middle row of CD''s directly in the middle.', '2003-04-09 15:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(260789, 16787, 5865, '<td valign="top">I love the way you have composed this photograph.  Great try.</td>', 'I love the way you have composed this photograph.  Great try.', '2003-04-09 15:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(260790, 17072, 7350, '<td valign="top">I love this effect.  While I am of the personal opinion that it should not be allowed on DPC, I certainly won''t vote you down for that now, because it is currently allowed. 8.</td>', 'I love this effect.  While I am of the personal opinion that it should not be allowed on DPC, I certainly won''t vote you down for that now, because it is currently allowed. 8.', '2003-04-09 15:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(260793, 17136, 5865, '<td valign="top">There are some beautiful colours in this shot.  I like the way that some of the cacti are out of focus.</td>', 'There are some beautiful colours in this shot.  I like the way that some of the cacti are out of focus.', '2003-04-09 15:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(260795, 17348, 7350, '<td valign="top">Did you treat these tomatoes with something, like RainX, to get the water to bead up?  I can never achieve this effect...</td>', 'Did you treat these tomatoes with something, like RainX, to get the water to bead up?  I can never achieve this effect...', '2003-04-09 15:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(260796, 17521, 5865, '<td valign="top">I really love the way in which you have composed this shot.  It just goes to show that something as simple as choice of viewpoint can make all the difference.</td>', 'I really love the way in which you have composed this shot.  It just goes to show that something as simple as choice of viewpoint can make all the difference.', '2003-04-09 15:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(260797, 17314, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and very colorful.  I like the different patterns and value that the subject creates for the image. Good job.</td>', 'Nice image and very colorful.  I like the different patterns and value that the subject creates for the image. Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(260798, 17359, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  You did an excellent job with lighting and using the frozen veggies to display some texture in the image.  Very colorful as well.</td>', 'Very nice image.  You did an excellent job with lighting and using the frozen veggies to display some texture in the image.  Very colorful as well.', '2003-04-09 15:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(260800, 17223, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I like the way that all the pens are organized into a line to help create this effect.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.  I like the way that all the pens are organized into a line to help create this effect.  Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(260801, 17298, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and creative idea.  I think that maybe there is too much light in the image or something, because some of the image doesn''t seems to have much value in it.</td>', 'Nice image and creative idea.  I think that maybe there is too much light in the image or something, because some of the image doesn''t seems to have much value in it.', '2003-04-09 15:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(260802, 17306, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot.', '2003-04-09 15:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(260803, 17204, 7350, '<td valign="top">Great idea, perfect background.</td>', 'Great idea, perfect background.', '2003-04-09 15:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(260805, 17432, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I like the effect that you used on the image to create its reflection.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image.  I like the effect that you used on the image to create its reflection.  Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(260806, 17452, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice clear image. The image could be more colorful though.  I don''t consider white to be very colorful.  But nice job.</td>', 'Nice clear image. The image could be more colorful though.  I don''t consider white to be very colorful.  But nice job.', '2003-04-09 15:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(260807, 17348, 7767, '<td valign="top">WOW. Good clarity. Like it!</td>', 'WOW. Good clarity. Like it!', '2003-04-09 15:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(260808, 17178, 7350, '<td valign="top">Mysterious...</td>', 'Mysterious...', '2003-04-09 15:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(260809, 17498, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Creative idea. You have a wide range of color in the image and it displays some patterns and texture as well. Good job.</td>', 'Nice image. Creative idea. You have a wide range of color in the image and it displays some patterns and texture as well. Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(260810, 17376, 7767, '<td valign="top">Nice. ;-)</td>', 'Nice. ;-)', '2003-04-09 15:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(260811, 16784, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice clear and focused image.  Good job with the colors.  I really like the layout you planned for the image as well.</td>', 'Nice clear and focused image.  Good job with the colors.  I really like the layout you planned for the image as well.', '2003-04-09 15:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(260812, 17189, 7767, '<td valign="top">Great!</td>', 'Great!', '2003-04-09 15:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(260813, 16948, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and good colors.  I like how you made the hydregent prodominant in the photo.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image and good colors.  I like how you made the hydregent prodominant in the photo.  Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(260814, 17462, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and good lighting.  I think that the flower would have been better off if it was centered in the middle of the photo more.  The negetive space on the left makes the eye take away from the main subject and it is distracting.</td>', 'Nice image and good lighting.  I think that the flower would have been better off if it was centered in the middle of the photo more.  The negetive space on the left makes the eye take away from the main subject and it is distracting.', '2003-04-09 15:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(260815, 17440, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. The wind blowing the flag adds a nice sense of texture to the image.  I also like the way the sky has some value and range of color in it as well.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image. The wind blowing the flag adds a nice sense of texture to the image.  I also like the way the sky has some value and range of color in it as well.  Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(260816, 17549, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image. It is very clear and focused well. How did you get the butterfly to stay??</td>', 'Nice image. It is very clear and focused well. How did you get the butterfly to stay??', '2003-04-09 15:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(260817, 17488, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image and use of depth and texture.  What is this a picture of ??</td>', 'Nice image and use of depth and texture.  What is this a picture of ??', '2003-04-09 15:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(260818, 17559, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Good colors and clarity in the image. Good job.</td>', 'Nice image. Good colors and clarity in the image. Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(260819, 17139, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Nice colors and good background.</td>', 'Very nice image. Nice colors and good background.', '2003-04-09 15:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(260821, 17269, 6451, '<td valign="top">Good image.  I like the idea and the layout for the image is nice.  There is also a lot of pattern and texture provided in the image to make it more attractive to the viewer.  Good job.</td>', 'Good image.  I like the idea and the layout for the image is nice.  There is also a lot of pattern and texture provided in the image to make it more attractive to the viewer.  Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(260822, 17293, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice display of colors and brightness. But what is this supposed to be??</td>', 'Nice display of colors and brightness. But what is this supposed to be??', '2003-04-09 15:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(260824, 17224, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I really like this image.  It is very clear and focused and displays a nice range of colors. Excellent!  I love you. . . haha j/k</td>', 'Nice job.  I really like this image.  It is very clear and focused and displays a nice range of colors. Excellent!  I love you. . . haha j/k', '2003-04-09 15:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(260826, 17043, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Good choice of lighting. Good display of colors as well. Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Good choice of lighting. Good display of colors as well. Nice job.', '2003-04-09 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(260827, 17230, 6451, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the range of colors you chose.  I alos like the background.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice image. I like the range of colors you chose.  I alos like the background.  Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:41:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(260828, 16923, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. This is very colorful and very clearly shot as well. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image. This is very colorful and very clearly shot as well. Good job.', '2003-04-09 15:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(260834, 17583, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nicely executed photo.. the depth of field nicely isolates your subject also.  I would have possible used a stronger color of paint to really make the theme of ''color'' punch a little harder... very nice shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a very nicely executed photo.. the depth of field nicely isolates your subject also.  I would have possible used a stronger color of paint to really make the theme of ''color'' punch a little harder... very nice shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-09 15:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(260836, 17438, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view. It really makes this image buzz!</td>', 'Nice point of view. It really makes this image buzz!', '2003-04-09 15:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(260838, 17167, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and the flames are nicely executed. I''d prefer to see more color (than just the yellow) to consider this as meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely composed, and the flames are nicely executed. I''d prefer to see more color (than just the yellow) to consider this as meeting the challenge.', '2003-04-09 15:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(260840, 17127, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like this image. The colors of the peppers are apparent, but your lighting highlights and stresses the shape of the peppers rather than their colors. Still, well composed and lovely mood.</td>', 'I like this image. The colors of the peppers are apparent, but your lighting highlights and stresses the shape of the peppers rather than their colors. Still, well composed and lovely mood.', '2003-04-09 16:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(260842, 17372, 6870, '<td valign="top">Point of view is engaging and unique here, and the clouds echo some of the textures and shapes found in the snapdragons. It does cause lighting problems, though, as the flowers are darker and are competing with that bright sky. Nice work, though.</td>', 'Point of view is engaging and unique here, and the clouds echo some of the textures and shapes found in the snapdragons. It does cause lighting problems, though, as the flowers are darker and are competing with that bright sky. Nice work, though.', '2003-04-09 16:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(260843, 17465, 6870, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a Mondrian painting. A tiny bit out of focus, bu the balance of the colors used is very well done.</td>', 'Reminds me of a Mondrian painting. A tiny bit out of focus, bu the balance of the colors used is very well done.', '2003-04-09 16:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(260844, 17269, 3419, '<td valign="top">This is nicely composed, and would have been a good candidate for the Symmetry challenge.  Colors and exposure are well done.</td>', 'This is nicely composed, and would have been a good candidate for the Symmetry challenge.  Colors and exposure are well done.', '2003-04-09 16:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(260845, 17034, 6870, '<td valign="top">Since the most interesting part of the sky is toward the horizon, I''m glad you gave us lots of water to look at. Good composition.</td>', 'Since the most interesting part of the sky is toward the horizon, I''m glad you gave us lots of water to look at. Good composition.', '2003-04-09 16:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(260846, 16910, 656, '<td valign="top">hot!   Great subject choice, but the focus seems quite soft ?  <br/> <br/>With all that blue ''sky'' and those peppers ''reaching'' up into it, I''d love to see this turned by 180 degrees...</td>', 'hot!   Great subject choice, but the focus seems quite soft ?   With all that blue ''sky'' and those peppers ''reaching'' up into it, I''d love to see this turned by 180 degrees...', '2003-04-09 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(260847, 17037, 656, '<td valign="top">really want that fourth diagonal red spot/ dot to be there ....</td>', 'really want that fourth diagonal red spot/ dot to be there ....', '2003-04-09 16:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(260848, 17546, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The red background is a good choice - it sets these beautiful colors off very nicely.</td>', 'Very pretty. The red background is a good choice - it sets these beautiful colors off very nicely.', '2003-04-09 16:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(260850, 17554, 656, '<td valign="top">good subject and composition, but seems like a poor choice of time of day.  The light is really harsh and very high - giving you a lot of harsh shadows.  Some reflected fill might have smoothed that out, or using your flash maybe ?</td>', 'good subject and composition, but seems like a poor choice of time of day.  The light is really harsh and very high - giving you a lot of harsh shadows.  Some reflected fill might have smoothed that out, or using your flash maybe ?', '2003-04-09 16:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(260851, 16951, 6870, '<td valign="top">My favorite image of the week. Just fun to look at. Through color, you show me Alice''s personality. In other words, you use color as a lens of sorts to communicate far more significant things. You show me both fantastic colors and you also show me their IMPORTANCE. Very nice work. 10</td>', 'My favorite image of the week. Just fun to look at. Through color, you show me Alice''s personality. In other words, you use color as a lens of sorts to communicate far more significant things. You show me both fantastic colors and you also show me their IMPORTANCE. Very nice work. 10', '2003-04-09 16:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(260852, 16956, 656, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like it was shot at night - where did all the colour go ?  Either that or you''ve got a tungsten colour balance set... very moody/ moon lit look</td>', 'Almost looks like it was shot at night - where did all the colour go ?  Either that or you''ve got a tungsten colour balance set... very moody/ moon lit look', '2003-04-09 16:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(260853, 17360, 3419, '<td valign="top">The colors on the beads are very nice. However, I don''t see the relevance to the objects in the background, and would have eliminated them.</td>', 'The colors on the beads are very nice. However, I don''t see the relevance to the objects in the background, and would have eliminated them.', '2003-04-09 16:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(260854, 17348, 6870, '<td valign="top">Doh! Tomato season is still months away! These are tantalizing, though. You show me that red is the right color for tomatoes; they are vibrant and zesty, yet peaceful and part of nature as well. Great shot!</td>', 'Doh! Tomato season is still months away! These are tantalizing, though. You show me that red is the right color for tomatoes; they are vibrant and zesty, yet peaceful and part of nature as well. Great shot!', '2003-04-09 16:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(260855, 17116, 656, '<td valign="top">very processed/ contrasty and saturated - looks good though.</td>', 'very processed/ contrasty and saturated - looks good though.', '2003-04-09 16:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(260856, 17311, 656, '<td valign="top">the centers of the flowers have ended up really muddy and unpleasant</td>', 'the centers of the flowers have ended up really muddy and unpleasant', '2003-04-09 16:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(260857, 17204, 6870, '<td valign="top">Brilliant composition with excellent lighting. The image looks slightly washed out to me, though. Still, one of my favorites this week. Great work. 9</td>', 'Brilliant composition with excellent lighting. The image looks slightly washed out to me, though. Still, one of my favorites this week. Great work. 9', '2003-04-09 16:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(260858, 17547, 3419, '<td valign="top">Ice? Very pretty scene - nicely captured. I like the "cold" colors. <br/> <br/>We have a water falls across from my house, and on extremely cold and crisp mornings, the trees are covered in frozen mist. I''ve been trying to capture them all winter.</td>', 'Ice? Very pretty scene - nicely captured. I like the "cold" colors.  We have a water falls across from my house, and on extremely cold and crisp mornings, the trees are covered in frozen mist. I''ve been trying to capture them all winter.', '2003-04-09 16:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(260859, 16948, 656, '<td valign="top">great - except for the appartment buildings in the background - wish you''d found an angle that didn''t show them.</td>', 'great - except for the appartment buildings in the background - wish you''d found an angle that didn''t show them.', '2003-04-09 16:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(260861, 17407, 656, '<td valign="top">The grey/brown background really lessens the effectiveness of this one.</td>', 'The grey/brown background really lessens the effectiveness of this one.', '2003-04-09 16:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(260862, 17311, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful ultra-saturation of color going on here. Makes me think that color is only a part of this story, which is what a good photo should do. 9</td>', 'Wonderful ultra-saturation of color going on here. Makes me think that color is only a part of this story, which is what a good photo should do. 9', '2003-04-09 16:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(260863, 16951, 656, '<td valign="top">wow!  fantastic.   The lead in from the path finishes this off perfectly.  Maybe a touch too much saturation though ? The stones and grass look as unnatural as everything else in this shot!</td>', 'wow!  fantastic.   The lead in from the path finishes this off perfectly.  Maybe a touch too much saturation though ? The stones and grass look as unnatural as everything else in this shot!', '2003-04-09 16:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(260864, 17547, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m with you: white IS a color, and  you communicate that well here through contrasts and excellent composition.</td>', 'I''m with you: white IS a color, and  you communicate that well here through contrasts and excellent composition.', '2003-04-09 16:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(260865, 17465, 656, '<td valign="top">great subject - composition seems a bit indecisive - is it lots of red, lots of yellow or ... you''ve left quite a lot of tension by giving equal areas to both that makes me a bit uncomfortable</td>', 'great subject - composition seems a bit indecisive - is it lots of red, lots of yellow or ... you''ve left quite a lot of tension by giving equal areas to both that makes me a bit uncomfortable', '2003-04-09 16:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(260866, 17506, 3419, '<td valign="top">Considering the bright sunshine, you''ve captured this very well. Focus and colors are very crisp. Your right border doesn''t match the left. That and the color you chose for the border detract overall.</td>', 'Considering the bright sunshine, you''ve captured this very well. Focus and colors are very crisp. Your right border doesn''t match the left. That and the color you chose for the border detract overall.', '2003-04-09 16:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(260867, 17484, 6870, '<td valign="top">Slightly washed and slightly out of focus, this image still manages to transport my thoughts beyond the photo and into realms of nostalgia and history and tradition: which the green tones bring out very well.</td>', 'Slightly washed and slightly out of focus, this image still manages to transport my thoughts beyond the photo and into realms of nostalgia and history and tradition: which the green tones bring out very well.', '2003-04-09 16:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(260868, 17045, 7291, '<td valign="top">I love this because it meets the challenge perfectly and also has tons of color where most people wouldn''t think of looking.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I love this because it meets the challenge perfectly and also has tons of color where most people wouldn''t think of looking.  Nice shot.', '2003-04-09 16:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(260869, 17196, 656, '<td valign="top">good subject, shame about the blown out sky and the people walking around.   You could maybe have gotten closer to those flowers on the left and used a lower angle to get rid of the sky completely ?</td>', 'good subject, shame about the blown out sky and the people walking around.   You could maybe have gotten closer to those flowers on the left and used a lower angle to get rid of the sky completely ?', '2003-04-09 16:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(260870, 17040, 7291, '<td valign="top">Clever.  I think the glass on the right refaracts the image behind it a bit too much and therefore becomes a bit distracting but it''s still one of the better shots in the challenge.  Good job.</td>', 'Clever.  I think the glass on the right refaracts the image behind it a bit too much and therefore becomes a bit distracting but it''s still one of the better shots in the challenge.  Good job.', '2003-04-09 16:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(260871, 17313, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a lot of clouds in this challenge, but these are CLOUDS--enhanced by their color to communicate things to me that transcend your image and dwell in meta-experiential realms. Whew!</td>', 'I''ve seen a lot of clouds in this challenge, but these are CLOUDS--enhanced by their color to communicate things to me that transcend your image and dwell in meta-experiential realms. Whew!', '2003-04-09 16:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
