(261109, 17226, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I feel green all over!  Very interesting catapillar.  The head seems just a tad fuzzy, but the body has more than enough detail.  10 Swash<br/>(good luck!  I hope you win!)</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I feel green all over!  Very interesting catapillar.  The head seems just a tad fuzzy, but the body has more than enough detail.  10 Swash(good luck!  I hope you win!)', '2003-04-09 20:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(261110, 17198, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Lots of great detail.  Strong yellow feel, the pollen on the wasp adds to the detailed wow!  If anyone complains about your DOF or the antenna out of focus, just blow them off (it''s just not possible!!)  GREAT PHOTO!  Easy 10!<br/>Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  Lots of great detail.  Strong yellow feel, the pollen on the wasp adds to the detailed wow!  If anyone complains about your DOF or the antenna out of focus, just blow them off (it''s just not possible!!)  GREAT PHOTO!  Easy 10!Rob the Swash', '2003-04-09 20:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
