(261113, 17083, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''m so sorry, but I don''t get this at all.  Is this supposed to represent the opposite of color?  In the wrong challenge?  Photo quality is O.K. and I am open to hearing your point of view, but otherwise the best I can go is a 4.  Swash</td>', 'I''m so sorry, but I don''t get this at all.  Is this supposed to represent the opposite of color?  In the wrong challenge?  Photo quality is O.K. and I am open to hearing your point of view, but otherwise the best I can go is a 4.  Swash', '2003-04-09 20:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(261115, 17434, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty!  It seems either over-exposed or over sharpened (I can''t seem to ever tell the difference).  Cropping off the hind end seems a tad mean.  The blanket background sort of works, but the wood siding doesn''t offer much contrast.<br/>5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cute kitty!  It seems either over-exposed or over sharpened (I can''t seem to ever tell the difference).  Cropping off the hind end seems a tad mean.  The blanket background sort of works, but the wood siding doesn''t offer much contrast.5 Rob the Swash', '2003-04-09 20:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
