(261329, 16942, 6771, '<td valign="top">ALREADY!!  Wish I could say the same.  Getting there.  Lots of pretty green.  More DOF to bring the (daylily''s?) into focus.  Can you have your neighbor take down their house next time?   (C:  Nice little touches of purple in there</td>', 'ALREADY!!  Wish I could say the same.  Getting there.  Lots of pretty green.  More DOF to bring the (daylily''s?) into focus.  Can you have your neighbor take down their house next time?   (C:  Nice little touches of purple in there', '2003-04-10 01:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(261331, 17111, 6771, '<td valign="top">Ya suckered me in here.  Love this subject.  Nice composition having the bottom third "black" countryside.  nice colors.  Would bringing up the midtones brightness get a little more blue into the upper half?</td>', 'Ya suckered me in here.  Love this subject.  Nice composition having the bottom third "black" countryside.  nice colors.  Would bringing up the midtones brightness get a little more blue into the upper half?', '2003-04-10 01:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(261332, 17300, 6771, '<td valign="top">Lots of smooth colors there.  Your horizon line is off.  the edges seems very blurry.  It appears in focus in some spots, and really blurry at others.  cranking down the aperture and slower shutter speed may have helped.</td>', 'Lots of smooth colors there.  Your horizon line is off.  the edges seems very blurry.  It appears in focus in some spots, and really blurry at others.  cranking down the aperture and slower shutter speed may have helped.', '2003-04-10 01:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(261334, 17034, 6771, '<td valign="top">Just a pretty sunset.  Great color reflections, nice use of the lighting.  I would half and half the positive and negative space...or used a bit more of the negative space if there were some more clouds above.</td>', 'Just a pretty sunset.  Great color reflections, nice use of the lighting.  I would half and half the positive and negative space...or used a bit more of the negative space if there were some more clouds above.', '2003-04-10 01:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(261339, 17455, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I like the focus being on the purple/magenta area of the reflection.  What about flipping it upside down or cropping down the top to the front of the glass lip and the bottom up some?  May not be able to really tell what it is, but great abstract.  Pretty shot</td>', 'Very interesting.  I like the focus being on the purple/magenta area of the reflection.  What about flipping it upside down or cropping down the top to the front of the glass lip and the bottom up some?  May not be able to really tell what it is, but great abstract.  Pretty shot', '2003-04-10 01:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(261341, 17579, 6771, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors.  the blown out sky with (a bird) is distracting, and it took off the left side of the parrots face.  Little faster shutter speed may have done it, since it looks like the feathers a are somewhat blurred from movement.</td>', 'Excellent colors.  the blown out sky with (a bird) is distracting, and it took off the left side of the parrots face.  Little faster shutter speed may have done it, since it looks like the feathers a are somewhat blurred from movement.', '2003-04-10 01:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(261355, 17506, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.  The border doesn''t seem to fit with the colors though</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.  The border doesn''t seem to fit with the colors though', '2003-04-10 02:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(261358, 17458, 509, '<td valign="top">Very striking image.  I think I''d prefer the background elements either in focus or cropped out - with an image as sharp as this (no pun intended), I think it would look best with more depth of field</td>', 'Very striking image.  I think I''d prefer the background elements either in focus or cropped out - with an image as sharp as this (no pun intended), I think it would look best with more depth of field', '2003-04-10 02:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(261359, 17168, 509, '<td valign="top">The combination of the purple and that green are great!  Excellent composition and dof. - 10 - Mav</td>', 'The combination of the purple and that green are great!  Excellent composition and dof. - 10 - Mav', '2003-04-10 02:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(261361, 17443, 509, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good subject, but the lighting doesn''t bring out the colors very well.</td>', 'I think this is a good subject, but the lighting doesn''t bring out the colors very well.', '2003-04-10 02:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(261362, 17513, 509, '<td valign="top">Lol, very creative, never thought of a pontiac that way.  Nice sharp image</td>', 'Lol, very creative, never thought of a pontiac that way.  Nice sharp image', '2003-04-10 02:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(261364, 17357, 509, '<td valign="top">I really like the blue and yellow color combination.  Very nice, if the sunflower was cropped more tightly (to eliminate the bloom on the right), I''d give this a 9 or 10, good work</td>', 'I really like the blue and yellow color combination.  Very nice, if the sunflower was cropped more tightly (to eliminate the bloom on the right), I''d give this a 9 or 10, good work', '2003-04-10 02:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(261366, 17401, 5925, '<td valign="top">I just like these little round purple berries, great color contrasts and textures in this picture.</td>', 'I just like these little round purple berries, great color contrasts and textures in this picture.', '2003-04-10 02:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(261367, 17363, 5925, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, where did you find this door?  I love the colors.</td>', 'Oh wow, where did you find this door?  I love the colors.', '2003-04-10 02:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(261368, 17550, 5925, '<td valign="top">I love the lines in this picture, along with the color, it is very interesting to look at.</td>', 'I love the lines in this picture, along with the color, it is very interesting to look at.', '2003-04-10 02:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(261369, 17488, 5925, '<td valign="top">Very nice close-up detail in this pic.</td>', 'Very nice close-up detail in this pic.', '2003-04-10 02:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(261370, 16839, 5925, '<td valign="top">Lots of pretty colors and shapes.  :)  I just like this picture.</td>', 'Lots of pretty colors and shapes.  :)  I just like this picture.', '2003-04-10 02:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(261374, 17311, 4007, '<td valign="top">Colorful indeed!  I like the abstract feel to this shot, and the colors are certainly strong.  Nice work.  The flower centers (I lack the correct term) does seem to lack aesthetic appeal though, their drab colors contrasting sharply with the impressive petals, and I think that hurts the image a little.  Good luck. 7</td>', 'Colorful indeed!  I like the abstract feel to this shot, and the colors are certainly strong.  Nice work.  The flower centers (I lack the correct term) does seem to lack aesthetic appeal though, their drab colors contrasting sharply with the impressive petals, and I think that hurts the image a little.  Good luck. 7', '2003-04-10 02:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(261378, 17062, 5622, '<td valign="top">Love the title but the colors are dull and there seems to be something distracting in the lower right corner</td>', 'Love the title but the colors are dull and there seems to be something distracting in the lower right corner', '2003-04-10 02:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(261379, 16914, 5925, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea with the picture, having the rest black and white except for the flowers.  Only problem is that the flowers are out of focus, which is a shame because this is a a good pic.</td>', 'I really like your idea with the picture, having the rest black and white except for the flowers.  Only problem is that the flowers are out of focus, which is a shame because this is a a good pic.', '2003-04-10 03:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(261380, 17126, 4007, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling this shot is over-cropped, unless some effect was applied to excess.  However it emerged, it seems that post-processing caused problems here.  The result seems washed out and lacks sharpness.  The subject choice seems good.  The composition seems a little cluttered and perhaps a little wider crop would be good to capture your subject more completely.  Keep working at it.  Good luck.</td>', 'I get the feeling this shot is over-cropped, unless some effect was applied to excess.  However it emerged, it seems that post-processing caused problems here.  The result seems washed out and lacks sharpness.  The subject choice seems good.  The composition seems a little cluttered and perhaps a little wider crop would be good to capture your subject more completely.  Keep working at it.  Good luck.', '2003-04-10 03:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(261381, 17588, 5622, '<td valign="top">Very nice other than than the blow out on the sign</td>', 'Very nice other than than the blow out on the sign', '2003-04-10 03:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(261382, 17570, 4007, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  It seems a little on the bright side to me and the blue one seems to have a rainbow fringe to it at the bottom left.  I''m not sure if that''s naturally occuring or as a result of excessive post-processing, but it does look somewhat unnatural.  I really like the rhythm and symetry that the strings create here, lining up in the same spot on each corner.  And the curve down the center works great as well.  Good work.  I think my only complaint here, ironicly, is maybe the colors.. the yellow and blue just don''t seem very powerful to me, they seem somewhat washed out.  Regardless of that I think this is a great shot. 7</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  It seems a little on the bright side to me and the blue one seems to have a rainbow fringe to it at the bottom left.  I''m not sure if that''s naturally occuring or as a result of excessive post-processing, but it does look somewhat unnatural.  I really like the rhythm and symetry that the strings create here, lining up in the same spot on each corner.  And the curve down the center works great as well.  Good work.  I think my only complaint here, ironicly, is maybe the colors.. the yellow and blue just don''t seem very powerful to me, they seem somewhat washed out.  Regardless of that I think this is a great shot. 7', '2003-04-10 03:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(261386, 17470, 4007, '<td valign="top">Looks oversaturated.  The color here doesn''t seem natural or impactful, it seems somewhat awkward.</td>', 'Looks oversaturated.  The color here doesn''t seem natural or impactful, it seems somewhat awkward.', '2003-04-10 03:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(261390, 17353, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the subject/background contrast here.  This is a nice shot all around.  It''d probably have been better if you would have maxed out size, but it looks nice as is. There also seems to be a bizarre red dot at the trunk of your tree, but I can''t say I know how to fix that.  Good work.  Good luck. 7</td>', 'I like the subject/background contrast here.  This is a nice shot all around.  It''d probably have been better if you would have maxed out size, but it looks nice as is. There also seems to be a bizarre red dot at the trunk of your tree, but I can''t say I know how to fix that.  Good work.  Good luck. 7', '2003-04-10 03:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(261391, 17522, 4007, '<td valign="top">This shot looks like it needs some better lighting.  In my opinion, it is essential that this background comes out as a crisp white, so taht the colors contrast effectively with the white.  Using a solid white background and a more powerful light would increase the impact of the colors in this shot by a lot.  Some post-processing to brighten and increase contrast could help as well, but the adjustments would be more effective if they were made in the process of shooting.</td>', 'This shot looks like it needs some better lighting.  In my opinion, it is essential that this background comes out as a crisp white, so taht the colors contrast effectively with the white.  Using a solid white background and a more powerful light would increase the impact of the colors in this shot by a lot.  Some post-processing to brighten and increase contrast could help as well, but the adjustments would be more effective if they were made in the process of shooting.', '2003-04-10 03:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(261394, 17452, 4007, '<td valign="top">The shadowing against the wall from using the flash detracts from the shot.</td>', 'The shadowing against the wall from using the flash detracts from the shot.', '2003-04-10 03:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(261398, 17546, 6938, '<td valign="top">The background seems to be interfering with the feathers in the top right....   nice intence colours though.</td>', 'The background seems to be interfering with the feathers in the top right....   nice intence colours though.', '2003-04-10 03:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(261401, 17215, 7528, '<td valign="top">Looks overly saturated and sharpened a bit too much? Maybe I''m wrong..</td>', 'Looks overly saturated and sharpened a bit too much? Maybe I''m wrong..', '2003-04-10 04:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
