(261446, 17359, 7067, '<td valign="top">Boy you don''t know how good that looks to a hungry me right now!  The thing is I can''t even get frozen assorted veggies here in Korea.  No frozen veggies at all actually.  There are peas in a can, but they are different... they''re hard... strange to get used to.</td>', 'Boy you don''t know how good that looks to a hungry me right now!  The thing is I can''t even get frozen assorted veggies here in Korea.  No frozen veggies at all actually.  There are peas in a can, but they are different... they''re hard... strange to get used to.', '2003-04-10 08:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
