(261448, 17448, 7067, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what that yellowish spot is on the bottom left.  To clean up the picture, you should crop the bottom of the photo, getting rid of the grass too.</td>', 'I''m not sure what that yellowish spot is on the bottom left.  To clean up the picture, you should crop the bottom of the photo, getting rid of the grass too.', '2003-04-10 08:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
