(261452, 17297, 7067, '<td valign="top">Moving the subject off center would improve composition and perhaps change the perspective so that the out-of-focus flower in the foreground is not obscurring your subject.</td>', 'Moving the subject off center would improve composition and perhaps change the perspective so that the out-of-focus flower in the foreground is not obscurring your subject.', '2003-04-10 08:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
