(261709, 17575, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love this shot for the colours, and the sun fighting to emerge from the clouds. I like the amount of space you left above to really give the impression that the sun was going to make it as soon as it got out of the thick near the bottom. My only criticism is the diagonal smear of black across the bottom. I''ll venture that that is a window sill or your car door or something obsuring the bottom of the shot. If we could have had clouds there, deep and dark, there would be nothing lacking in this shot!</td>', 'I love this shot for the colours, and the sun fighting to emerge from the clouds. I like the amount of space you left above to really give the impression that the sun was going to make it as soon as it got out of the thick near the bottom. My only criticism is the diagonal smear of black across the bottom. I''ll venture that that is a window sill or your car door or something obsuring the bottom of the shot. If we could have had clouds there, deep and dark, there would be nothing lacking in this shot!', '2003-04-10 15:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
