(261824, 17368, 7711, '<td valign="top">you have captured these frozen berries beautiful. I thought about whether I prefer a greater DOF, and decided you got it right! The focus is solely on the berries, and that is where it should be. That said, the background, though out of focus, is a bit distracting to the left. Not sure how you could have fixed that thought, besides cutting down some trees! Well done in any event! 9</td>', 'you have captured these frozen berries beautiful. I thought about whether I prefer a greater DOF, and decided you got it right! The focus is solely on the berries, and that is where it should be. That said, the background, though out of focus, is a bit distracting to the left. Not sure how you could have fixed that thought, besides cutting down some trees! Well done in any event! 9', '2003-04-10 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(261825, 17043, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great use of light and color.  I like it.</td>', 'Great use of light and color.  I like it.', '2003-04-10 17:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
