(261901, 17224, 7711, '<td valign="top">the colours are not really leaping out, and I''m not sure why. Composition seems to be lacking structure. Perhaps the first car should either be more in the shot or not at all?</td>', 'the colours are not really leaping out, and I''m not sure why. Composition seems to be lacking structure. Perhaps the first car should either be more in the shot or not at all?', '2003-04-10 19:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
