(261912, 17429, 7413, '<td valign="top">Not much color in here, maybe this is a good one for the weather challenge? gtz</td>', 'Not much color in here, maybe this is a good one for the weather challenge? gtz', '2003-04-10 20:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(261913, 17438, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is very nice, but the sky is "noisy"... you can fix it with neatimage, their demo is free.</td>', 'this is very nice, but the sky is "noisy"... you can fix it with neatimage, their demo is free.', '2003-04-10 20:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(261915, 17477, 7413, '<td valign="top">Very cool surrounding..... Cool!</td>', 'Very cool surrounding..... Cool!', '2003-04-10 20:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(261916, 17403, 7413, '<td valign="top">Do you have 15 balls?? I hope not.... ;-)</td>', 'Do you have 15 balls?? I hope not.... ;-)', '2003-04-10 20:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(261917, 17300, 7413, '<td valign="top">A little bit off-balance... nice colors</td>', 'A little bit off-balance... nice colors', '2003-04-10 20:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(261918, 17514, 7413, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I like abstract pics with cool colors alot! Nicely done....</td>', 'Very cool, I like abstract pics with cool colors alot! Nicely done....', '2003-04-10 20:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(261921, 17386, 7413, '<td valign="top">Why is this in the color challenge?</td>', 'Why is this in the color challenge?', '2003-04-10 20:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(261922, 17189, 7413, '<td valign="top">Cool! How did you do this?</td>', 'Cool! How did you do this?', '2003-04-10 20:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(261924, 16898, 7413, '<td valign="top">Like the border</td>', 'Like the border', '2003-04-10 20:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(261925, 17581, 7413, '<td valign="top">Very very cool.....</td>', 'Very very cool.....', '2003-04-10 20:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(261931, 17486, 7711, '<td valign="top">I had this idea, but I didn''t think I''d be able to pull it off, well done! the colours on the surface of the bubble are great. If you had been able to get your lighting so that one side is a little more lit, it might have looked like a rising sun on the bubble planet..but that''s just an idea!</td>', 'I had this idea, but I didn''t think I''d be able to pull it off, well done! the colours on the surface of the bubble are great. If you had been able to get your lighting so that one side is a little more lit, it might have looked like a rising sun on the bubble planet..but that''s just an idea!', '2003-04-10 20:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(261932, 17232, 7711, '<td valign="top">Maybe slightly oversharp, but great texture and colour.</td>', 'Maybe slightly oversharp, but great texture and colour.', '2003-04-10 20:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(261934, 17040, 7413, '<td valign="top">very nice idea and photography</td>', 'very nice idea and photography', '2003-04-10 20:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(261936, 17520, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love composition of this photograph. The background blends with the last blue glass and gives great depth to the photo. I also like the way the green colour bled through the yellow drink, gives it a wild mixed look. 9</td>', 'I love composition of this photograph. The background blends with the last blue glass and gives great depth to the photo. I also like the way the green colour bled through the yellow drink, gives it a wild mixed look. 9', '2003-04-10 20:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(261939, 17190, 7844, '<td valign="top">These jelly beans look good enough to eat...love the brilliant colors!</td>', 'These jelly beans look good enough to eat...love the brilliant colors!', '2003-04-10 20:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(261940, 16951, 7711, '<td valign="top">you know that song by smokey? Don''t recall the title, but the chorus goes "I''ll never get used to not living next door to alice..." I''ll spare you the audience refrain on that one, but needless to say, many drunk college students would happily tell you. All this by way of useless comments, but I do like the colours of Alice''s door. I wish the garbage can was not tipping over, its distracting. But I like the composition, gives me the feeling that i''m walking right up to the door.</td>', 'you know that song by smokey? Don''t recall the title, but the chorus goes "I''ll never get used to not living next door to alice..." I''ll spare you the audience refrain on that one, but needless to say, many drunk college students would happily tell you. All this by way of useless comments, but I do like the colours of Alice''s door. I wish the garbage can was not tipping over, its distracting. But I like the composition, gives me the feeling that i''m walking right up to the door.', '2003-04-10 20:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(261943, 17083, 7711, '<td valign="top">I''m unsure what the focus was intented to be on, but the DOF is too shallow, or the focal point is somewhere I can''t discern. Its terribly out of focus, and doesn''t meet the challenge. I''m sorry to say I scored it quite low. I do, however, enjoy your composition (just needs to be a little higher to get the bottom of the drum) and the lighting isn''t bad at all either. :) keep trying!</td>', 'I''m unsure what the focus was intented to be on, but the DOF is too shallow, or the focal point is somewhere I can''t discern. Its terribly out of focus, and doesn''t meet the challenge. I''m sorry to say I scored it quite low. I do, however, enjoy your composition (just needs to be a little higher to get the bottom of the drum) and the lighting isn''t bad at all either. :) keep trying!', '2003-04-10 20:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(261945, 17567, 7711, '<td valign="top">that''s a wicked shadow being cast along the bottom of the photo, it completely ruins the effect I think you are trying to achieve. As well, the entire shot is out of focus, and composition would be improved if the shot were straighter and shot from more toward the right. Keep trying though!</td>', 'that''s a wicked shadow being cast along the bottom of the photo, it completely ruins the effect I think you are trying to achieve. As well, the entire shot is out of focus, and composition would be improved if the shot were straighter and shot from more toward the right. Keep trying though!', '2003-04-10 20:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(261946, 16949, 7711, '<td valign="top">the lamp to the left is extremely distracting, and the entire picture seems too dark to really appreciate the colours found in this window, I do like the idea of the shot though! Perhaps a different angle (maybe higher?) would have aided the composition.</td>', 'the lamp to the left is extremely distracting, and the entire picture seems too dark to really appreciate the colours found in this window, I do like the idea of the shot though! Perhaps a different angle (maybe higher?) would have aided the composition.', '2003-04-10 20:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(261953, 17136, 7711, '<td valign="top">sunsets can be pretty cliche, but you did a good job of capturing the colours and leaving the landscape as a silhouette. The tree looks like its reaching to touch the sky!</td>', 'sunsets can be pretty cliche, but you did a good job of capturing the colours and leaving the landscape as a silhouette. The tree looks like its reaching to touch the sky!', '2003-04-10 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(261955, 17423, 7711, '<td valign="top">brilliant lighting on this. its natural and not too bright, bringing out the glorious texture of the flower. Perhaps a slightly larger DOF to capture some of the detail on the back petals.</td>', 'brilliant lighting on this. its natural and not too bright, bringing out the glorious texture of the flower. Perhaps a slightly larger DOF to capture some of the detail on the back petals.', '2003-04-10 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(261956, 17363, 7711, '<td valign="top">slightly oversharp or maybe overexposed? (there is a strange glare off some of the sides of the thicker strokes of paint) but good colour.</td>', 'slightly oversharp or maybe overexposed? (there is a strange glare off some of the sides of the thicker strokes of paint) but good colour.', '2003-04-10 21:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(261957, 17237, 7711, '<td valign="top">good perspective on this. At first I thought I wanted the shadow on the right gone, but decided upon looking again that it adds dimension to the boat. Makes it seem a whole lot bigger than the viewer! On composition, I would have liked to catch the bottom of the star, but that''s a minor point. (no pun intended!)</td>', 'good perspective on this. At first I thought I wanted the shadow on the right gone, but decided upon looking again that it adds dimension to the boat. Makes it seem a whole lot bigger than the viewer! On composition, I would have liked to catch the bottom of the star, but that''s a minor point. (no pun intended!)', '2003-04-10 21:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(261958, 17550, 2978, '<td valign="top">Great work. I''m sure this will be in the high place. Blue ribbon is not too much.</td>', 'Great work. I''m sure this will be in the high place. Blue ribbon is not too much.', '2003-04-10 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(261963, 17363, 1717, '<td valign="top">oh, i love this!  great saturation of colors and nice cropping.  what a cool door!  nice work!</td>', 'oh, i love this!  great saturation of colors and nice cropping.  what a cool door!  nice work!', '2003-04-10 21:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(261964, 16816, 1717, '<td valign="top">good color and great DOF.  the background is a little too busy and distracting, though.</td>', 'good color and great DOF.  the background is a little too busy and distracting, though.', '2003-04-10 21:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(261966, 17481, 1717, '<td valign="top">great colors!  the focus is a bit too soft and the dark shadow on the left is distracting.  if you''re a member, you should try it again for this week''s challenge!</td>', 'great colors!  the focus is a bit too soft and the dark shadow on the left is distracting.  if you''re a member, you should try it again for this week''s challenge!', '2003-04-10 21:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(261968, 17209, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful color and great DOF.  the background is also very colorful without being distracting...well done!</td>', 'beautiful color and great DOF.  the background is also very colorful without being distracting...well done!', '2003-04-10 21:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(261969, 17042, 1717, '<td valign="top">very pretty colors.  looks a little bit out of focus and the bit of dead grass on the left is sort of distracting.</td>', 'very pretty colors.  looks a little bit out of focus and the bit of dead grass on the left is sort of distracting.', '2003-04-10 21:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(261977, 17567, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love the art!  is this something you did?  i think you had a good idea for this photo and it is very colorful.  another light source to take care of the shadows on the front of the art would be a good idea and might help with the focusing.   i do like the shadow at the back of the art, although i would crop out the bottom part of the photo and use more negative space at the top.</td>', 'i love the art!  is this something you did?  i think you had a good idea for this photo and it is very colorful.  another light source to take care of the shadows on the front of the art would be a good idea and might help with the focusing.   i do like the shadow at the back of the art, although i would crop out the bottom part of the photo and use more negative space at the top.', '2003-04-10 21:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(261982, 17268, 1717, '<td valign="top">love the orange background...it''s very complimentary to all the colors shown.</td>', 'love the orange background...it''s very complimentary to all the colors shown.', '2003-04-10 22:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(261996, 17448, 6325, '<td valign="top">This subject has great potential. I would have moved to the right, bent down, and zoomed in more. This would have concentrated on the colorful subjects and excluded the extra people. Would also have been cool to be on the "sunny" side rather than the "shadow" side - but that cannot always be controlled.</td>', 'This subject has great potential. I would have moved to the right, bent down, and zoomed in more. This would have concentrated on the colorful subjects and excluded the extra people. Would also have been cool to be on the "sunny" side rather than the "shadow" side - but that cannot always be controlled.', '2003-04-10 22:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(261997, 17471, 3320, '<td valign="top">Very very nice &lt;&lt;.. I like the ''pastel'' colors a lot.8</td>', 'Very very nice <<.. I like the ''pastel'' colors a lot.8', '2003-04-10 22:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(261998, 17297, 3320, '<td valign="top">Maybe the front blurry one is a little bit too much hiding the main one .Maybe a fdifferent ''framing'' as left. left side is too empty. Nice picture</td>', 'Maybe the front blurry one is a little bit too much hiding the main one .Maybe a fdifferent ''framing'' as left. left side is too empty. Nice picture', '2003-04-10 22:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
