(262456, 17122, 7639, '<td valign="top">A difficult subject.</td>', 'A difficult subject.', '2003-04-11 11:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(262457, 16864, 3946, '<td valign="top">I would have liked the photographer to get closer to the subject...what I feel is the colorful orange flowers.  They are out of focus in this shot.</td>', 'I would have liked the photographer to get closer to the subject...what I feel is the colorful orange flowers.  They are out of focus in this shot.', '2003-04-11 11:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(262459, 17425, 7639, '<td valign="top">Could benefit from more reflection.  I understand that the pros coat their "wet" vegies with cooking oil.</td>', 'Could benefit from more reflection.  I understand that the pros coat their "wet" vegies with cooking oil.', '2003-04-11 11:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(262460, 17219, 3946, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract photo...nicely focused...I like the texture that you were able to pick up from the door and the long shadows.  It''s just not very colorful, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice abstract photo...nicely focused...I like the texture that you were able to pick up from the door and the long shadows.  It''s just not very colorful, in my opinion.', '2003-04-11 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(262461, 17124, 7639, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonals</td>', 'Nice diagonals', '2003-04-11 11:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(262462, 17111, 7639, '<td valign="top">A forbidding sky with a touch of magic.</td>', 'A forbidding sky with a touch of magic.', '2003-04-11 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(262463, 16951, 3946, '<td valign="top">My, that door really stands out in constrast to what the rest of the building must look like.  Very interesting.</td>', 'My, that door really stands out in constrast to what the rest of the building must look like.  Very interesting.', '2003-04-11 11:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(262466, 17366, 3946, '<td valign="top">Picture seems kind of flat.  Doesn''t really do the colors justice.  Perhaps adjusting the contrast and saturation would help the colors stand out and look more vivid.  Plus, I would have like to see the black background extend down to include the surface.  The stark transition to white takes away from the horses.  Otherwise, the artwork on the horses is fantastic and colorful.</td>', 'Picture seems kind of flat.  Doesn''t really do the colors justice.  Perhaps adjusting the contrast and saturation would help the colors stand out and look more vivid.  Plus, I would have like to see the black background extend down to include the surface.  The stark transition to white takes away from the horses.  Otherwise, the artwork on the horses is fantastic and colorful.', '2003-04-11 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(262467, 17117, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very pretty reflective sunset shot.  I don''t see the golden aspects that the title portrays should be there.  Unfortunately, In another challenge other than color, this picture would probably score a lot higher because it is nicely done.</td>', 'Very pretty reflective sunset shot.  I don''t see the golden aspects that the title portrays should be there.  Unfortunately, In another challenge other than color, this picture would probably score a lot higher because it is nicely done.', '2003-04-11 11:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(262468, 17319, 3946, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh on the left.  Working with brightness/contrast and possibly adjusting saturation would bring out the colors better.  Otherwise, it''s too dark and lost the colors.  Very unique subject and funny.</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh on the left.  Working with brightness/contrast and possibly adjusting saturation would bring out the colors better.  Otherwise, it''s too dark and lost the colors.  Very unique subject and funny.', '2003-04-11 12:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(262471, 17493, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge.  Good photo for a hair product ad.  I was noticing the sister models and how their gazes affects the photo.  The gal with the curly hair is looking up at the camera where the other two are gazing to another sister.  Possibly the curly haired gal should be looking to toward her sister to the right of her, maybe turning her head a little more to the right.  Obviously, a white background would wash out their faces, but maybe having a black background would bright out the colors of their hair better than the current teal constrasting color.  Get my point?  Just being picky...LOL.  Actually, it''s a well done photo</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge.  Good photo for a hair product ad.  I was noticing the sister models and how their gazes affects the photo.  The gal with the curly hair is looking up at the camera where the other two are gazing to another sister.  Possibly the curly haired gal should be looking to toward her sister to the right of her, maybe turning her head a little more to the right.  Obviously, a white background would wash out their faces, but maybe having a black background would bright out the colors of their hair better than the current teal constrasting color.  Get my point?  Just being picky...LOL.  Actually, it''s a well done photo', '2003-04-11 12:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(262475, 16910, 3946, '<td valign="top">The chili''s are out of focus.  Possibly focusing on the chili''s, then carefully dropping the camera down to take the rest of this picture would have helped.  The ridges of the plate they are sitting on seems to be in focus.  Should be the other way around.  Composition could have been a little better by arranging the chilis so they take up the entire top portion of the plate and hang down in a more uniform pattern.  I love the idea of the photo.  I love the contrast in color.</td>', 'The chili''s are out of focus.  Possibly focusing on the chili''s, then carefully dropping the camera down to take the rest of this picture would have helped.  The ridges of the plate they are sitting on seems to be in focus.  Should be the other way around.  Composition could have been a little better by arranging the chilis so they take up the entire top portion of the plate and hang down in a more uniform pattern.  I love the idea of the photo.  I love the contrast in color.', '2003-04-11 12:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(262476, 17544, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very pretty flowers and pretty colors.  Picture is just a bit dark, especially on the bottom and right.  Colors could stand out more.  Also seems a touch out of focus.</td>', 'Very pretty flowers and pretty colors.  Picture is just a bit dark, especially on the bottom and right.  Colors could stand out more.  Also seems a touch out of focus.', '2003-04-11 12:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(262477, 17553, 3946, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus and a bit flat.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus and a bit flat.', '2003-04-11 12:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(262479, 17381, 3946, '<td valign="top">My favorite colors are portrayed here...a country feel.  Very pretty and well done, in my opionion.  Something about the lighting, however, bothers me a little.  The color in the flower gets lost somehow and could stand out more.  I''m not sure exactly what it is or what could be done differently to be honest.</td>', 'My favorite colors are portrayed here...a country feel.  Very pretty and well done, in my opionion.  Something about the lighting, however, bothers me a little.  The color in the flower gets lost somehow and could stand out more.  I''m not sure exactly what it is or what could be done differently to be honest.', '2003-04-11 12:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(262480, 17209, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very, VERY pretty.  This is a job well done.  Nice spring photo.  The only thing I don''t like is the black border.  Perhaps, if there had to be a border, making it the color of the dark pink center of the blossoms would make it appealing...or having a very thin dark pink on the inside and a wider light pink on the outside.  Just a suggestion.</td>', 'Very, VERY pretty.  This is a job well done.  Nice spring photo.  The only thing I don''t like is the black border.  Perhaps, if there had to be a border, making it the color of the dark pink center of the blossoms would make it appealing...or having a very thin dark pink on the inside and a wider light pink on the outside.  Just a suggestion.', '2003-04-11 12:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(262482, 17502, 3946, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Perfect composition and well focused.  The border adds a nice touch.  Reminds me of a Hallmark ad.  I like the placement of the pink rose to break up the red.  The one stem sticking up out of the bear kind of confuses me and doesn''t seem to belong there.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Perfect composition and well focused.  The border adds a nice touch.  Reminds me of a Hallmark ad.  I like the placement of the pink rose to break up the red.  The one stem sticking up out of the bear kind of confuses me and doesn''t seem to belong there.', '2003-04-11 12:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(262484, 16992, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very good arrangement!  Well focused.  The colors just don''t seem to pop out as they should.  Appears dark and a bit bland.</td>', 'Very good arrangement!  Well focused.  The colors just don''t seem to pop out as they should.  Appears dark and a bit bland.', '2003-04-11 12:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(262486, 17487, 3946, '<td valign="top">This picture looks like it came directly out of the camera with no post work.  I would have cropped out the rest of the neighborhood as much as I could to have the colorful house fill the whole picture.  Then worked on brightness/contrast and sauration to bring out the colors better.  The top of the house appears slightly washed out.  Also, would be best to turn off the date print on your camera.  Very interesting and colorful house.  Good subject matter for the challenge.</td>', 'This picture looks like it came directly out of the camera with no post work.  I would have cropped out the rest of the neighborhood as much as I could to have the colorful house fill the whole picture.  Then worked on brightness/contrast and sauration to bring out the colors better.  The top of the house appears slightly washed out.  Also, would be best to turn off the date print on your camera.  Very interesting and colorful house.  Good subject matter for the challenge.', '2003-04-11 12:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(262488, 17556, 3946, '<td valign="top">Portrays matured and weathered love.  Nice picture</td>', 'Portrays matured and weathered love.  Nice picture', '2003-04-11 12:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(262490, 17367, 3946, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  Good idea</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  Good idea', '2003-04-11 12:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(262491, 17496, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very pretty place...I bet is smells good in there.</td>', 'Very pretty place...I bet is smells good in there.', '2003-04-11 12:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(262493, 17315, 3946, '<td valign="top">The color is beautiful.  I bet it was a magnificant sight to see.  However, this picture is badly out of focus and does not give this sun rise justice.  Plus, the magenta inner border badly distracts.  It doesn''t match any of the color in the photo.  Leaving the entire border black would have been better.</td>', 'The color is beautiful.  I bet it was a magnificant sight to see.  However, this picture is badly out of focus and does not give this sun rise justice.  Plus, the magenta inner border badly distracts.  It doesn''t match any of the color in the photo.  Leaving the entire border black would have been better.', '2003-04-11 12:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(262495, 17383, 3946, '<td valign="top">The colors of the peacock feathers gets lost in the green, busy background.  Or maybe the lack of focus is why it doesn''t stand out.</td>', 'The colors of the peacock feathers gets lost in the green, busy background.  Or maybe the lack of focus is why it doesn''t stand out.', '2003-04-11 12:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(262496, 17574, 5999, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh on the small white flowers to the left and perhaps a reflector to throw some light onto the center of the rose. Overall, a striking image.<br/>Mark</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh on the small white flowers to the left and perhaps a reflector to throw some light onto the center of the rose. Overall, a striking image.Mark', '2003-04-11 12:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(262498, 17485, 6900, '<td valign="top">I love the apparent ''door'' on the temple and even the walkway.  As nice as the color is, I think the yellow on the right is distracting and takes my eyes away from the center.  I like the focus but just for kicks - what if they were reversed and the ''path'' was clear, while the temple was blurry because it''s farther away?</td>', 'I love the apparent ''door'' on the temple and even the walkway.  As nice as the color is, I think the yellow on the right is distracting and takes my eyes away from the center.  I like the focus but just for kicks - what if they were reversed and the ''path'' was clear, while the temple was blurry because it''s farther away?', '2003-04-11 13:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(262499, 17586, 5999, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, focus and DOF. Beautiful.<br/>Mark</td>', 'Great lighting, focus and DOF. Beautiful.Mark', '2003-04-11 13:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(262500, 17549, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  The soft focus on the edges of the child''s face and butterfly is strange, though.  Hmmm</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  The soft focus on the edges of the child''s face and butterfly is strange, though.  Hmmm', '2003-04-11 13:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(262501, 17335, 3946, '<td valign="top">Just a bit dark.  The colors do not stand out well.  Perhaps if the entire background was white...like the portion to the left, it would have helped.</td>', 'Just a bit dark.  The colors do not stand out well.  Perhaps if the entire background was white...like the portion to the left, it would have helped.', '2003-04-11 13:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(262502, 17237, 6900, '<td valign="top">Perfect angle!  Why did you cut the tip off?  There are two noticeable crop points I don''t like - one is the tip of the boat, the other is the bottom tip of the star.  The colors are superb - I like how the boat and the sky are both beautiful shades of blue.</td>', 'Perfect angle!  Why did you cut the tip off?  There are two noticeable crop points I don''t like - one is the tip of the boat, the other is the bottom tip of the star.  The colors are superb - I like how the boat and the sky are both beautiful shades of blue.', '2003-04-11 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(262503, 17550, 3946, '<td valign="top">This is entirely COOL.  Well done.  I love the colors.  Well focused and vivid.  Most excellent colorful abstract photo.  I hope you win or at least in the top three.</td>', 'This is entirely COOL.  Well done.  I love the colors.  Well focused and vivid.  Most excellent colorful abstract photo.  I hope you win or at least in the top three.', '2003-04-11 13:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(262505, 17300, 5999, '<td valign="top">Great colors and focus. Seems a bit tilted though. Perhaps rotate a degree or two clockwise and cropping along the lower white line?<br/>Mark</td>', 'Great colors and focus. Seems a bit tilted though. Perhaps rotate a degree or two clockwise and cropping along the lower white line?Mark', '2003-04-11 13:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(262506, 17525, 7350, '<td valign="top">Could have been brighter, but I love the composition.</td>', 'Could have been brighter, but I love the composition.', '2003-04-11 13:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(262507, 17524, 3946, '<td valign="top">A blue banana just doesn''t do it for me.  Adjusting controls to extreme levels, in my opinion, has a purpose in art, but not in this case.  Not only is it unnatural, but also made it grainy and unpleasing to the eye.</td>', 'A blue banana just doesn''t do it for me.  Adjusting controls to extreme levels, in my opinion, has a purpose in art, but not in this case.  Not only is it unnatural, but also made it grainy and unpleasing to the eye.', '2003-04-11 13:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(262508, 16794, 6900, '<td valign="top">Two or three noticeable light distractions in the background.<br/>I am not a big fan of the flash-look here, but I LOVE the colors top and bottom.  The center doesn''t really have any great interest, but the fountain is pretty unusual.  <br/>I would have tried to move a foot higher or closer to cut out the bottom bushes, but not much to do about it now.</td>', 'Two or three noticeable light distractions in the background.I am not a big fan of the flash-look here, but I LOVE the colors top and bottom.  The center doesn''t really have any great interest, but the fountain is pretty unusual.  I would have tried to move a foot higher or closer to cut out the bottom bushes, but not much to do about it now.', '2003-04-11 13:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(262511, 17303, 3946, '<td valign="top">Nice oringional subject in this challenge.  The colors are vivid and subject is nicely focused.</td>', 'Nice oringional subject in this challenge.  The colors are vivid and subject is nicely focused.', '2003-04-11 13:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(262512, 17133, 6900, '<td valign="top">Thought I left a comment already on this one, but I guess not.<br/> <br/>The details are amazing - looking at the hair under the fly and on its legs.  The center of the flower is in focus as well - all of which is superb.  Nice job throwing the background out of focus - I love this shot. 8</td>', 'Thought I left a comment already on this one, but I guess not. The details are amazing - looking at the hair under the fly and on its legs.  The center of the flower is in focus as well - all of which is superb.  Nice job throwing the background out of focus - I love this shot. 8', '2003-04-11 13:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(262513, 17405, 3946, '<td valign="top">The white spotty areas are distracting in this photo.  Otherwise, a nice photo.</td>', 'The white spotty areas are distracting in this photo.  Otherwise, a nice photo.', '2003-04-11 13:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(262514, 17209, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of color.  I like the focus and the detail is clear.  One of the better flower pics this week.  (Different color from typical choices too - good).  I want to move in on these just a hair - see what''s going on even more... but great job. 8</td>', 'Excellent choice of color.  I like the focus and the detail is clear.  One of the better flower pics this week.  (Different color from typical choices too - good).  I want to move in on these just a hair - see what''s going on even more... but great job. 8', '2003-04-11 13:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(262515, 16927, 1826, '<td valign="top">I think this would be great shot vertically, it would put more emphasis on your subject.</td>', 'I think this would be great shot vertically, it would put more emphasis on your subject.', '2003-04-11 13:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(262516, 17262, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2003-04-11 13:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(262518, 17486, 3946, '<td valign="top">Very interesting origional photo for this challenge.  Good job!</td>', 'Very interesting origional photo for this challenge.  Good job!', '2003-04-11 13:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(262521, 17198, 1826, '<td valign="top">Wow! Now this is macro! Great job.</td>', 'Wow! Now this is macro! Great job.', '2003-04-11 13:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(262522, 16864, 6900, '<td valign="top">Ok, with the goal that you should control absolutely everything you can, I''ll ask my question - why did you leave the fence in?  If you moved maybe 10 feet to your right, and closer by 2 feet...what about the composition that inclues almost nothing but orange flowers blooming?  I think it would be better - though I love this shot just for the colors and warm feel. 8</td>', 'Ok, with the goal that you should control absolutely everything you can, I''ll ask my question - why did you leave the fence in?  If you moved maybe 10 feet to your right, and closer by 2 feet...what about the composition that inclues almost nothing but orange flowers blooming?  I think it would be better - though I love this shot just for the colors and warm feel. 8', '2003-04-11 13:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(262524, 16951, 1024, '<td valign="top">Not only is this a great shot of color, its humorous as well.  Well done!</td>', 'Not only is this a great shot of color, its humorous as well.  Well done!', '2003-04-11 13:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(262525, 17430, 1024, '<td valign="top">Good protrayal of color.  I would love to see some close ups of these houses too.</td>', 'Good protrayal of color.  I would love to see some close ups of these houses too.', '2003-04-11 13:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(262526, 17293, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful abstract.  These normally do not do as well on DPC, but I will keep my fingers crossed for you.</td>', 'This is a wonderful abstract.  These normally do not do as well on DPC, but I will keep my fingers crossed for you.', '2003-04-11 13:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(262527, 17586, 6900, '<td valign="top">The direct lighting on top of the flower makes it look bright and pretty.  It makes me wish the direct light was somewhere in front of the whole picture, though, so that it brightened the whole bud.  I like that there''s two buds, but the background color lets the green show too much and the plants behind are distracting.</td>', 'The direct lighting on top of the flower makes it look bright and pretty.  It makes me wish the direct light was somewhere in front of the whole picture, though, so that it brightened the whole bud.  I like that there''s two buds, but the background color lets the green show too much and the plants behind are distracting.', '2003-04-11 13:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(262528, 17190, 3946, '<td valign="top">Picture appears dark and doesn''t bring the colors out very well.  Otherwise, this would have been a great shot.</td>', 'Picture appears dark and doesn''t bring the colors out very well.  Otherwise, this would have been a great shot.', '2003-04-11 13:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(262530, 17511, 6900, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the windshield keeps this from being absolutely classic. I wish the roof was in here, even if the frong and back ends are not.  8</td>', 'The reflection on the windshield keeps this from being absolutely classic. I wish the roof was in here, even if the frong and back ends are not.  8', '2003-04-11 13:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(262531, 17363, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great texture!</td>', 'Great texture!', '2003-04-11 13:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(262532, 16943, 6900, '<td valign="top">Damn Damn Damn!  I''m not sure how much control you had over this shot, but that flower is PERFECT.  I wish the bg was one solid color - a studio shot of some kind - for a flower this beautiful.  The colors are amazing and this would truly be one of my faves of the week if the bg wasn''t so discombobulated.</td>', 'Damn Damn Damn!  I''m not sure how much control you had over this shot, but that flower is PERFECT.  I wish the bg was one solid color - a studio shot of some kind - for a flower this beautiful.  The colors are amazing and this would truly be one of my faves of the week if the bg wasn''t so discombobulated.', '2003-04-11 13:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(262533, 17498, 3946, '<td valign="top">This picture is too dark.  By simply adjusting brightness/contrast would bring out the colors and make them more vivid.  This would have been a great entry into this challenge otherwise.</td>', 'This picture is too dark.  By simply adjusting brightness/contrast would bring out the colors and make them more vivid.  This would have been a great entry into this challenge otherwise.', '2003-04-11 13:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(262535, 17307, 7350, '<td valign="top">These marshmallow things are pretty much tasteless, but somehow addicting.  Is that one on the left laying an egg or something?</td>', 'These marshmallow things are pretty much tasteless, but somehow addicting.  Is that one on the left laying an egg or something?', '2003-04-11 13:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(262536, 17335, 7350, '<td valign="top">Great angle/composition.  Could have been brighter. 7.</td>', 'Great angle/composition.  Could have been brighter. 7.', '2003-04-11 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(262538, 17468, 6597, '<td valign="top">good contrast</td>', 'good contrast', '2003-04-11 13:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(262540, 17580, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and pattern.  I think overall the colors are a bit darker than I''d like, especially along the edges.  The holder is also necessary BUT distracting.</td>', 'Interesting idea and pattern.  I think overall the colors are a bit darker than I''d like, especially along the edges.  The holder is also necessary BUT distracting.', '2003-04-11 13:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(262541, 17120, 772, '<td valign="top">The color here is very nice and the gradient background works well also.. nice shot :) - setzler</td>', 'The color here is very nice and the gradient background works well also.. nice shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-11 13:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(262542, 17485, 3697, '<td valign="top">Very nice crop, and great color.</td>', 'Very nice crop, and great color.', '2003-04-11 13:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(262544, 17430, 6900, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of distracting elements in this photo - the reflection in the near water, the crappy land in the middle, the trees before the color...Is color really a central and tying idea to this pic or is it just a pic with good colors in it?  Just my 2c.  :)  Keep shooting!</td>', 'There are a lot of distracting elements in this photo - the reflection in the near water, the crappy land in the middle, the trees before the color...Is color really a central and tying idea to this pic or is it just a pic with good colors in it?  Just my 2c.  :)  Keep shooting!', '2003-04-11 13:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(262547, 16864, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this photograph.  There is much texture here, almost like a living tapestry.  Very well done!</td>', 'I love the feel of this photograph.  There is much texture here, almost like a living tapestry.  Very well done!', '2003-04-11 13:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(262549, 16942, 6900, '<td valign="top">HI!  When I think "make color the most important element" of the picture - I''m not sure this is what I had in mind.  I like that colors, but what about a different composition?  Something closer to the first orange bud?  Just an idea, but it''s your garden - you can always go back and try it. :)</td>', 'HI!  When I think "make color the most important element" of the picture - I''m not sure this is what I had in mind.  I like that colors, but what about a different composition?  Something closer to the first orange bud?  Just an idea, but it''s your garden - you can always go back and try it. :)', '2003-04-11 13:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(262551, 17345, 1024, '<td valign="top">The colors here are fantistic.  If there was one little thing I would change, it would be the composition.  Normally a centrally located subject is not as powerful as one that is located toward the edges.  Very well done, never the less.</td>', 'The colors here are fantistic.  If there was one little thing I would change, it would be the composition.  Normally a centrally located subject is not as powerful as one that is located toward the edges.  Very well done, never the less.', '2003-04-11 13:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(262553, 16787, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice close up.  I wish the photograph was a little larger, its hard to see all of the detail at this size.</td>', 'This is a very nice close up.  I wish the photograph was a little larger, its hard to see all of the detail at this size.', '2003-04-11 13:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(262554, 17583, 3697, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of DOF and very unique take on this week''s assignment. Well done. :)</td>', 'Wonderful use of DOF and very unique take on this week''s assignment. Well done. :)', '2003-04-11 13:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(262555, 17286, 1024, '<td valign="top">Magnificent macro.  Your focus is dead on and the colors are magnificent!</td>', 'Magnificent macro.  Your focus is dead on and the colors are magnificent!', '2003-04-11 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(262558, 17430, 3697, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it seems to be dipping a bit from left to right. Great colors though.</td>', 'Nice photo, but it seems to be dipping a bit from left to right. Great colors though.', '2003-04-11 13:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(262559, 17190, 6900, '<td valign="top">My original vote on this shot was high.  My second round of looks dropped it way down.  Now it''s back somewhere in the middle ... I just can''t decide if I like this composition, etc... The reflections are a bit distracting - why not bounce the light instead of direct?  Did you want that effect?</td>', 'My original vote on this shot was high.  My second round of looks dropped it way down.  Now it''s back somewhere in the middle ... I just can''t decide if I like this composition, etc... The reflections are a bit distracting - why not bounce the light instead of direct?  Did you want that effect?', '2003-04-11 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
