(262727, 17360, 6900, '<td valign="top">the picture frame and other background items are distracting.  I know it''s meant to be a "life" shot - like someone ''lives'' here, but everything is cut off and it''s visually distracting from the shot.  Technically - I think there''s not enough light, and the left side is much more blurry than it should be.</td>', 'the picture frame and other background items are distracting.  I know it''s meant to be a "life" shot - like someone ''lives'' here, but everything is cut off and it''s visually distracting from the shot.  Technically - I think there''s not enough light, and the left side is much more blurry than it should be.', '2003-04-11 16:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
