(262778, 17305, 6900, '<td valign="top">LOVE the bird in this shot.  Don''t like the muted colors as much as I''d like, but probably neither did you when you were taking it.  Love the water in this shot as well - and the details on the rock...oh hell, I''m changing my mark.  9.</td>', 'LOVE the bird in this shot.  Don''t like the muted colors as much as I''d like, but probably neither did you when you were taking it.  Love the water in this shot as well - and the details on the rock...oh hell, I''m changing my mark.  9.', '2003-04-11 17:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(262779, 17269, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of colors in the center of the image.  I like that light blue better, but choices choices.. Ilike all of the colors in this except the ones along both sides (and i like the dark blue on bottom right)  Nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting choice of colors in the center of the image.  I like that light blue better, but choices choices.. Ilike all of the colors in this except the ones along both sides (and i like the dark blue on bottom right)  Nice shot.', '2003-04-11 17:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(262781, 17509, 6900, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the green mark on the white chalk.  Great array of colors - what would this look like if you mixed them up a bit more, or if the blue were in the place of the orange? :)</td>', 'Too bad about the green mark on the white chalk.  Great array of colors - what would this look like if you mixed them up a bit more, or if the blue were in the place of the orange? :)', '2003-04-11 17:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(262782, 17455, 7711, '<td valign="top">A tad tiled, and the focus seems to be centered at the top, but a slightly greater DOF would have allowed the whole subject (vase?) be in focus and bearing its detail! lovely shot, nonetheless!</td>', 'A tad tiled, and the focus seems to be centered at the top, but a slightly greater DOF would have allowed the whole subject (vase?) be in focus and bearing its detail! lovely shot, nonetheless!', '2003-04-11 17:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
