(262789, 17472, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like the layout, composition and colors.  I''m not too fond of the uneven lighting and fuzzy edges.  If things are fuzzy, I like to be able to tell the reason - and here I can''t.</td>', 'I like the layout, composition and colors.  I''m not too fond of the uneven lighting and fuzzy edges.  If things are fuzzy, I like to be able to tell the reason - and here I can''t.', '2003-04-11 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
