(262794, 17570, 6900, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I was thinking first time I saw this one.  Anyways, I like it now, didn''t then... maybe it''s just one of "those" kind of shots.  Better vote while I like it.  8.</td>', 'Not sure what I was thinking first time I saw this one.  Anyways, I like it now, didn''t then... maybe it''s just one of "those" kind of shots.  Better vote while I like it.  8.', '2003-04-11 17:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
