(262806, 17363, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and color.  Seems like a bright sunny day - would probably work better with lower sun so you could get less ''light'' on these beautiful colors.</td>', 'Excellent detail and color.  Seems like a bright sunny day - would probably work better with lower sun so you could get less ''light'' on these beautiful colors.', '2003-04-11 17:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
