(262808, 17536, 6900, '<td valign="top">Not sure I can tell what this is, but  nice abstract.  Moving my mark to 7.</td>', 'Not sure I can tell what this is, but  nice abstract.  Moving my mark to 7.', '2003-04-11 17:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(262809, 17466, 7711, '<td valign="top">absolutely brilliant colours! The border is a tad thick -- it distracts some from your subject. I like that the focus is on the centre of the flower, and that you decided not to have the flower directly in the centre of the shot. A slightly more even crop (maybe taking the same off each side that is being cut off or a little less off the top?) might have emphasized the range of colours and improved the composition, but what do I know? I''m just throwing out some ideas for improvement.</td>', 'absolutely brilliant colours! The border is a tad thick -- it distracts some from your subject. I like that the focus is on the centre of the flower, and that you decided not to have the flower directly in the centre of the shot. A slightly more even crop (maybe taking the same off each side that is being cut off or a little less off the top?) might have emphasized the range of colours and improved the composition, but what do I know? I''m just throwing out some ideas for improvement.', '2003-04-11 17:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(262810, 17455, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent abstract.. i love the depth of the blue.. great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent abstract.. i love the depth of the blue.. great shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-11 17:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(262812, 17552, 7711, '<td valign="top">compositionally, it has some interesting characteristics, but the picture doesn''t leap out at me. I also wish that there was a cogent emphasis on colour, just to meet the challenge requirements. Focus and lighting are great though!</td>', 'compositionally, it has some interesting characteristics, but the picture doesn''t leap out at me. I also wish that there was a cogent emphasis on colour, just to meet the challenge requirements. Focus and lighting are great though!', '2003-04-11 17:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(262814, 17469, 7711, '<td valign="top">Lacking a story or context, this shot is struggling, for me anyway, to hold interest. There are lines to lead our eyes, but nothing at the end of them. Its also a bit dark, and might have benefitted from a wider angle or different perspective on the subject? Just a thought!</td>', 'Lacking a story or context, this shot is struggling, for me anyway, to hold interest. There are lines to lead our eyes, but nothing at the end of them. Its also a bit dark, and might have benefitted from a wider angle or different perspective on the subject? Just a thought!', '2003-04-11 17:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(262815, 17485, 70, '<td valign="top">Really nice texture on the leaves, especially the top two. I think I would have preferred a tad bit more contrast but that might just be my monitor. Good job.</td>', 'Really nice texture on the leaves, especially the top two. I think I would have preferred a tad bit more contrast but that might just be my monitor. Good job.', '2003-04-11 17:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(262816, 17237, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice, bright colors and good contrast. NIce shot.</td>', 'Nice, bright colors and good contrast. NIce shot.', '2003-04-11 18:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(262817, 17357, 7711, '<td valign="top">great choice of contrasting colours, and I love the focus. Its a bit soft near the tips of the bottom petals, but it works! I also like that you included that purple flower/bud to the right,it gives the picture lots of character. I wonder if it would have been too distracting to have the whole bud in the shot?</td>', 'great choice of contrasting colours, and I love the focus. Its a bit soft near the tips of the bottom petals, but it works! I also like that you included that purple flower/bud to the right,it gives the picture lots of character. I wonder if it would have been too distracting to have the whole bud in the shot?', '2003-04-11 18:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(262818, 17313, 70, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot. I think that the bright orange border distracts from the photo though...I want to be looking at those clouds, not the border.</td>', 'Really cool shot. I think that the bright orange border distracts from the photo though...I want to be looking at those clouds, not the border.', '2003-04-11 18:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
