(262957, 16995, 6900, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t produce what I see as a good quality image.  There are colors - but no different than pointing at a random object and snapping.  I like the blues here - what if the shot was a straight on of the grapes?  just a thought.</td>', 'This doesn''t produce what I see as a good quality image.  There are colors - but no different than pointing at a random object and snapping.  I like the blues here - what if the shot was a straight on of the grapes?  just a thought.', '2003-04-11 21:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
