(262965, 17262, 7706, '<td valign="top">I have noticed two very different ways of approaching this challenge. One is by focusing on a sinle color, and the other is by taking a photo with as many coloes as possible. In a way I think you have done both. You have a very strong purple thing going, which looks cool, and yet you have the reflection on to the CD thing going too. I also think its great when people go out of their way to find a good pic, and I think you have. You havn''t really gone the obvious, but done something that still looks cool :)</td>', 'I have noticed two very different ways of approaching this challenge. One is by focusing on a sinle color, and the other is by taking a photo with as many coloes as possible. In a way I think you have done both. You have a very strong purple thing going, which looks cool, and yet you have the reflection on to the CD thing going too. I also think its great when people go out of their way to find a good pic, and I think you have. You havn''t really gone the obvious, but done something that still looks cool :)', '2003-04-11 21:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(262966, 17384, 6900, '<td valign="top">Hrm...I''ve wanted to figure this shot out all week.  First of all, I have no clue what that is.  Second of all, I went from LOVING this pic to HATING this pic to LOVING this pic...so I''m gonna throw it somewhere in between.  Great composition and lighting - not sure color is the first thing that comes to mind.</td>', 'Hrm...I''ve wanted to figure this shot out all week.  First of all, I have no clue what that is.  Second of all, I went from LOVING this pic to HATING this pic to LOVING this pic...so I''m gonna throw it somewhere in between.  Great composition and lighting - not sure color is the first thing that comes to mind.', '2003-04-11 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
