(263023, 17579, 6172, '<td valign="top">The only bad thing about this photo is in the top of the photo I can''t tell what is supposed to be there.  It just seems like bright whiteness,  too bright.  Otherwise a very nice photo.</td>', 'The only bad thing about this photo is in the top of the photo I can''t tell what is supposed to be there.  It just seems like bright whiteness,  too bright.  Otherwise a very nice photo.', '2003-04-12 00:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
