(263096, 17393, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette.  The only thing I can see that I don''t like is that the color looks like it was oversaturated and the sky is a little grainy from it.  Awesome colors though.  Great capture.</td>', 'Nice silhouette.  The only thing I can see that I don''t like is that the color looks like it was oversaturated and the sky is a little grainy from it.  Awesome colors though.  Great capture.', '2003-04-12 06:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
