(263098, 17338, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like you used flash.  If you did, it would''ve been better to go with available lighting.  If you did use other means of lighting, you need to diffuse it more.</td>', 'Looks like you used flash.  If you did, it would''ve been better to go with available lighting.  If you did use other means of lighting, you need to diffuse it more.', '2003-04-12 06:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(263099, 17131, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is the tightest crop on a flower pic I''ve ever seen.  I feel pretty lucky to guess it was a flower.  I might be wrong there too.  Nice color and not a bad pic</td>', 'This is the tightest crop on a flower pic I''ve ever seen.  I feel pretty lucky to guess it was a flower.  I might be wrong there too.  Nice color and not a bad pic', '2003-04-12 06:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
