(263121, 17272, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  Very interesting perspective shots.  I like it.</td>', 'lol.  Very interesting perspective shots.  I like it.', '2003-04-12 08:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(263123, 17423, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love the center of the flower.  You''re right ... it belongs in the middle of the photo.   The petals are a bit messy.  I love the shallow depth of field.  The leaves, upper left and lower right, are a bit distracting.  Good luck.  Jacko.  6</td>', 'I love the center of the flower.  You''re right ... it belongs in the middle of the photo.   The petals are a bit messy.  I love the shallow depth of field.  The leaves, upper left and lower right, are a bit distracting.  Good luck.  Jacko.  6', '2003-04-12 08:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(263124, 17400, 2716, '<td valign="top">Hey mag ...  cute wife.  Wanna share?   lol..  Just teasin''  ... if this is Mag''s wife''s picture ... my appologies.  lol.  Beautifull matching of lips and backgrounds.  Intense eyes.  Maybe less harsh light on the face?  I like it.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Hey mag ...  cute wife.  Wanna share?   lol..  Just teasin''  ... if this is Mag''s wife''s picture ... my appologies.  lol.  Beautifull matching of lips and backgrounds.  Intense eyes.  Maybe less harsh light on the face?  I like it.  Jacko.  8', '2003-04-12 08:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(263125, 17000, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like this concept.  Color Blind?  I like the shadows on the letters but I''d get rid of the shadow on the upper left.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this concept.  Color Blind?  I like the shadows on the letters but I''d get rid of the shadow on the upper left.  Good luck.', '2003-04-12 08:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(263126, 17379, 2716, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like this "desaturate all but one colour" shot, but this work for me.  I like the inclusion of the brush and paint on the newspaper.  Good luck.   Jcko.  8</td>', 'I usually don''t like this "desaturate all but one colour" shot, but this work for me.  I like the inclusion of the brush and paint on the newspaper.  Good luck.   Jcko.  8', '2003-04-12 08:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(263127, 17462, 2716, '<td valign="top">beautiful mixture of colour .... blue and yellow work great for me.  The flower seems to be missing sharpness.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'beautiful mixture of colour .... blue and yellow work great for me.  The flower seems to be missing sharpness.  Good luck.  Jacko.  7', '2003-04-12 08:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(263128, 16948, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  Would be more effective if we wouldn''t see the buildings in the background, though this almost impossible in a city setting.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  Would be more effective if we wouldn''t see the buildings in the background, though this almost impossible in a city setting.  Good luck.', '2003-04-12 08:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(263129, 17408, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The lined up pepsi trucks and the rainbow work for me.  A bit messy, ie. Fence, telephone poles, street lights, however I like the colors.  Good job.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Great capture.  The lined up pepsi trucks and the rainbow work for me.  A bit messy, ie. Fence, telephone poles, street lights, however I like the colors.  Good job.  Jacko.  8', '2003-04-12 08:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(263130, 17137, 2716, '<td valign="top">Alright.  I love the blown out colours and bright background.  Works for me.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Alright.  I love the blown out colours and bright background.  Works for me.  Jacko.  9', '2003-04-12 08:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(263131, 17045, 2716, '<td valign="top">cool.  I love the bright colours of the boys''s hair, however seems to me you added another element of "black and white" which makes the color interpretation very interesting.  Good eye.  Jacko.  9  Lacks a little sharpness.</td>', 'cool.  I love the bright colours of the boys''s hair, however seems to me you added another element of "black and white" which makes the color interpretation very interesting.  Good eye.  Jacko.  9  Lacks a little sharpness.', '2003-04-12 08:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
