(263139, 17329, 806, '<td valign="top">I think I will visualize this photograph any time I am in a "bad spot" in my life. It is so inviting, peaceful, and gives a comforting feeling. I am eager to know where this was taken. It is a beautiful spot, and you are fortunate to have it in your world!</td>', 'I think I will visualize this photograph any time I am in a "bad spot" in my life. It is so inviting, peaceful, and gives a comforting feeling. I am eager to know where this was taken. It is a beautiful spot, and you are fortunate to have it in your world!', '2003-04-12 09:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
