(263484, 17506, 6523, '<td valign="top">I like your picture a lot -- but for me, the color of the frame detracts from it a little bit.  Actually, I''m not sure if it''s the color of the frame or the frame itself, but I think the contrast of the yellow flower and bright blue sky would be much stronger without the frame.</td>', 'I like your picture a lot -- but for me, the color of the frame detracts from it a little bit.  Actually, I''m not sure if it''s the color of the frame or the frame itself, but I think the contrast of the yellow flower and bright blue sky would be much stronger without the frame.', '2003-04-12 15:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
