(263489, 17201, 6523, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve used repetition of elements here -- especially with the red bike where it is.  I think the photo is a little bit oversharpened, and I would like to see the colors adjusted so that they''re just a touch brighter -- although it looks like it was a very overcast day so the colors are probably true to your subject.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve used repetition of elements here -- especially with the red bike where it is.  I think the photo is a little bit oversharpened, and I would like to see the colors adjusted so that they''re just a touch brighter -- although it looks like it was a very overcast day so the colors are probably true to your subject.', '2003-04-12 15:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(263491, 17178, 6523, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here, but to be honest, I have to strain my eyes to see the picture because the photo is so dark the blue and black blend into each other a lot.</td>', 'I like your idea here, but to be honest, I have to strain my eyes to see the picture because the photo is so dark the blue and black blend into each other a lot.', '2003-04-12 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
