(263495, 17132, 6523, '<td valign="top">I like your minimal use of subject and color here -- good job!</td>', 'I like your minimal use of subject and color here -- good job!', '2003-04-12 15:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(263497, 17084, 7523, '<td valign="top">Ahh....This sure does bring back good memories. Or does it? Now that I think about it, apples weren''t a huge part of my schooling. I think I liked to eat apple wedges, but the bigger memory is of deviled eggs. All my friends used to give theirs to me. I hated milk, but Mrs. Arda-choke Chapel would force me to drink it, so I''d gulp it while plugging my nose so as not to taste it and gag. Anyway, I really like this picture. It''s got a lot of deep inuendos.</td>', 'Ahh....This sure does bring back good memories. Or does it? Now that I think about it, apples weren''t a huge part of my schooling. I think I liked to eat apple wedges, but the bigger memory is of deviled eggs. All my friends used to give theirs to me. I hated milk, but Mrs. Arda-choke Chapel would force me to drink it, so I''d gulp it while plugging my nose so as not to taste it and gag. Anyway, I really like this picture. It''s got a lot of deep inuendos.', '2003-04-12 15:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(263500, 17588, 5100, '<td valign="top">that highlight on the sign is a little too much, otherwise the scenary is perfect!</td>', 'that highlight on the sign is a little too much, otherwise the scenary is perfect!', '2003-04-12 15:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(263502, 17054, 6523, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I would have like to have  seen you correct the angle of the photo so the flagpole was perpendicular, though -- it doesn''t look very solid at this angle (as though someone put it in sand and it started to fall).</td>', 'Nice idea.  I would have like to have  seen you correct the angle of the photo so the flagpole was perpendicular, though -- it doesn''t look very solid at this angle (as though someone put it in sand and it started to fall).', '2003-04-12 15:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(263503, 16852, 7523, '<td valign="top">What a darling little girl! And so colorful! I think you chose the perfect harmony of natural colors in this one sweet thing. If I had a daughter this cute, I would name her "Lotte." By the way, is she a professional model?</td>', 'What a darling little girl! And so colorful! I think you chose the perfect harmony of natural colors in this one sweet thing. If I had a daughter this cute, I would name her "Lotte." By the way, is she a professional model?', '2003-04-12 15:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
