(263895, 16969, 5622, '<td valign="top">Nice idea<br/>The left side of the face is over exposed and the right side is under exposed. You did a nice job with Photoshop on this shot. There is something a bit distracting in the shot but I cant quite put my tweezes on it.</td>', 'Nice ideaThe left side of the face is over exposed and the right side is under exposed. You did a nice job with Photoshop on this shot. There is something a bit distracting in the shot but I cant quite put my tweezes on it.', '2003-04-13 02:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(263897, 17305, 5622, '<td valign="top">I would buy this as a print</td>', 'I would buy this as a print', '2003-04-13 02:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(263903, 17168, 2923, '<td valign="top">how much was this sharpened in PS?  It looks to be way overtly processed image, you can see the noises in the blurred area of the photograph. 3</td>', 'how much was this sharpened in PS?  It looks to be way overtly processed image, you can see the noises in the blurred area of the photograph. 3', '2003-04-13 03:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(263906, 17218, 5158, '<td valign="top">This is my weeks-favorit: great concept, wonderfull color and together with the title it says something about a colorfull continent. good luck to you</td>', 'This is my weeks-favorit: great concept, wonderfull color and together with the title it says something about a colorfull continent. good luck to you', '2003-04-13 03:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(263907, 17438, 5158, '<td valign="top">You are lucky to have found such a colorfull lamp and also that you captured it at a day with awesome sky. Both fit very well together, making this image one of my favorits this week. Good luck</td>', 'You are lucky to have found such a colorfull lamp and also that you captured it at a day with awesome sky. Both fit very well together, making this image one of my favorits this week. Good luck', '2003-04-13 03:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(263908, 17508, 5158, '<td valign="top">Awesome place full of colors. Technically it could be les soft, but still, due to the choice of the topic it''s one of my few favorits this week.</td>', 'Awesome place full of colors. Technically it could be les soft, but still, due to the choice of the topic it''s one of my few favorits this week.', '2003-04-13 03:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(263909, 17493, 5158, '<td valign="top">Capturing people is the hardest thing in photography to me. You seem to have no problem with it: great work, wonderfull compostition and technically perfect to me. Color isn''t the first thing coming to my mind though: the three sisters capture my attention, ther looks and smiles.</td>', 'Capturing people is the hardest thing in photography to me. You seem to have no problem with it: great work, wonderfull compostition and technically perfect to me. Color isn''t the first thing coming to my mind though: the three sisters capture my attention, ther looks and smiles.', '2003-04-13 04:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(263911, 16784, 6938, '<td valign="top">A little too bright, and the Top/Bottom ballance is out.....  Cool concept. Good use of colours.</td>', 'A little too bright, and the Top/Bottom ballance is out.....  Cool concept. Good use of colours.', '2003-04-13 04:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(263912, 17137, 6938, '<td valign="top">I think the white background is a bit bright.  I think I would have liked to see a greater range of colours.</td>', 'I think the white background is a bit bright.  I think I would have liked to see a greater range of colours.', '2003-04-13 04:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(263913, 17467, 6938, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the branch (perhaps a little to close on the left). Very good focusing to have the bunch so clear.</td>', 'I like the use of the branch (perhaps a little to close on the left). Very good focusing to have the bunch so clear.', '2003-04-13 04:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(263914, 17267, 6938, '<td valign="top">Perhaps stronger &amp; diffused light would have intensified the colours some more - as is, it looks a bit ''dead'' to me.</td>', 'Perhaps stronger & diffused light would have intensified the colours some more - as is, it looks a bit ''dead'' to me.', '2003-04-13 04:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(263915, 17122, 6938, '<td valign="top">The title "Warning" might have been more appropriate.  You almost have a good texture thing happening, wich is being lost a bit in the brightness.</td>', 'The title "Warning" might have been more appropriate.  You almost have a good texture thing happening, wich is being lost a bit in the brightness.', '2003-04-13 04:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(263916, 17369, 6938, '<td valign="top">Just being able to see the stem is almost distracting.</td>', 'Just being able to see the stem is almost distracting.', '2003-04-13 04:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(263917, 17298, 6938, '<td valign="top">Good subject for a ''statement'', but it''s not very comfortable to look at. The red is a bit too harsh, and a  border could have helped.</td>', 'Good subject for a ''statement'', but it''s not very comfortable to look at. The red is a bit too harsh, and a  border could have helped.', '2003-04-13 04:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(263919, 17391, 6938, '<td valign="top">Good intensity of the colour of study. The water drop in the middle is a bit out of place perhaps, and mabe a bit more ambiant light on the stem would make it less of a distraction an more a part of the picture.</td>', 'Good intensity of the colour of study. The water drop in the middle is a bit out of place perhaps, and mabe a bit more ambiant light on the stem would make it less of a distraction an more a part of the picture.', '2003-04-13 05:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(263920, 17508, 6938, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.', '2003-04-13 05:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(263921, 17364, 6938, '<td valign="top">Good selection of subject.  The focus and lighting is working well to intensify the colours and give a great sence of texture.</td>', 'Good selection of subject.  The focus and lighting is working well to intensify the colours and give a great sence of texture.', '2003-04-13 05:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(263936, 17470, 7369, '<td valign="top">This is the right photo for the cover of a cd, only the title is missing :). The model has an appealing look in her eyes. Good job!</td>', 'This is the right photo for the cover of a cd, only the title is missing :). The model has an appealing look in her eyes. Good job!', '2003-04-13 08:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(263938, 17335, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very nice to add the reflection.  Good job.  Jacko</td>', 'Very nice to add the reflection.  Good job.  Jacko', '2003-04-13 08:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(263939, 17122, 7560, '<td valign="top">This could be a potentially interesting shot. You have an interesting color contrast between the orange mesh, green grass, and white post. The critical problem is in the lighting. Because the light is so harsh, it is washing out the colors. I would suggest either using a polorizing filter or shooting with different light.</td>', 'This could be a potentially interesting shot. You have an interesting color contrast between the orange mesh, green grass, and white post. The critical problem is in the lighting. Because the light is so harsh, it is washing out the colors. I would suggest either using a polorizing filter or shooting with different light.', '2003-04-13 08:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(263942, 17040, 4411, '<td valign="top">This is great.<br/>I love what''s happened to the smileys in the glasses. Would maybe have worked even better if shot exactly straight on.</td>', 'This is great.I love what''s happened to the smileys in the glasses. Would maybe have worked even better if shot exactly straight on.', '2003-04-13 09:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(263947, 17137, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp colors! The greens and purples complement each other well.</td>', 'Nice crisp colors! The greens and purples complement each other well.', '2003-04-13 09:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(263948, 17410, 5728, '<td valign="top">You were lucky to get this! Not only is the color there but the composition of the photo is also excellent with the road leading into the image.</td>', 'You were lucky to get this! Not only is the color there but the composition of the photo is also excellent with the road leading into the image.', '2003-04-13 09:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(263949, 17384, 6505, '<td valign="top">Very, very cool.  One of my favorites!</td>', 'Very, very cool.  One of my favorites!', '2003-04-13 10:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(263950, 17037, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like rubiks revenge.  There are just too many things with this photo that are really going to hold it down.  The lack of focus being the main one, whether its on purpose or not.</td>', 'Looks like rubiks revenge.  There are just too many things with this photo that are really going to hold it down.  The lack of focus being the main one, whether its on purpose or not.', '2003-04-13 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(263951, 17520, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very good use of color and I like the perspective on this shot.  Nice work</td>', 'Very good use of color and I like the perspective on this shot.  Nice work', '2003-04-13 10:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(263952, 17084, 3540, '<td valign="top">THe apple almost looks fake.  Something about the color doesn''t seem right to me.  Good idea for this challenge.</td>', 'THe apple almost looks fake.  Something about the color doesn''t seem right to me.  Good idea for this challenge.', '2003-04-13 10:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(263953, 17467, 3540, '<td valign="top">Strange processing on this photo.  Interesting pic though especially regarding the perspective of the photo.  The flowers are kinda neat even.</td>', 'Strange processing on this photo.  Interesting pic though especially regarding the perspective of the photo.  The flowers are kinda neat even.', '2003-04-13 10:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(263955, 17228, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been better if the building was not there at all.  Or if the building was actually true to the horizon and the whole thing was included and not just a piece of it.</td>', 'This would''ve been better if the building was not there at all.  Or if the building was actually true to the horizon and the whole thing was included and not just a piece of it.', '2003-04-13 10:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(263956, 17342, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture needs to be squared up to the horizon.  I like the idea that you have a person in there, but I think a little more interesting subject would''ve been better.  Maybe a lady walking her dog or something.  Anyway, the colors of the sky are great and the building is pretty interesting.</td>', 'This picture needs to be squared up to the horizon.  I like the idea that you have a person in there, but I think a little more interesting subject would''ve been better.  Maybe a lady walking her dog or something.  Anyway, the colors of the sky are great and the building is pretty interesting.', '2003-04-13 10:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(263957, 17380, 3540, '<td valign="top">Wow!!  That is really cool.  I wish the clouds were justa  little higher than they are so they wouldn''t be crowding the ship so bad.  The color of the sunlight there behind that wall of clouds is great.  Awesome capture and great job finding this!</td>', 'Wow!!  That is really cool.  I wish the clouds were justa  little higher than they are so they wouldn''t be crowding the ship so bad.  The color of the sunlight there behind that wall of clouds is great.  Awesome capture and great job finding this!', '2003-04-13 10:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(263958, 17123, 3540, '<td valign="top">THe lighting is too flat in this picture.  The flowers don''t look all that healthy either.  The quality of the photo tells me the camera is pretty low resolution or the crop is tighter than it should be due to size restraints.  Good subject, just the execution wasn''t there</td>', 'THe lighting is too flat in this picture.  The flowers don''t look all that healthy either.  The quality of the photo tells me the camera is pretty low resolution or the crop is tighter than it should be due to size restraints.  Good subject, just the execution wasn''t there', '2003-04-13 10:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(263959, 17395, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I like the silhouettiing of the landscape especially on the right where it''s pretty close to the camera.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Great colors.  I like the silhouettiing of the landscape especially on the right where it''s pretty close to the camera.  Nice capture.', '2003-04-13 10:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(263961, 17136, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great silhouettes.  Awesome sky color.  Like the framing of this shot too. well done</td>', 'Great silhouettes.  Awesome sky color.  Like the framing of this shot too. well done', '2003-04-13 10:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(263962, 17314, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice job capturing this scene. You have made this into an art treasure. If the original "tagers" could see if now they would be impressed.</td>', 'Very, very nice job capturing this scene. You have made this into an art treasure. If the original "tagers" could see if now they would be impressed.', '2003-04-13 10:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(263963, 17362, 5792, '<td valign="top">Flowers always seem to abound and are appropriate for this challenge. This is one of the best of the lot. It is very dificult to get contrast right on a daffodil (sp?)</td>', 'Flowers always seem to abound and are appropriate for this challenge. This is one of the best of the lot. It is very dificult to get contrast right on a daffodil (sp?)', '2003-04-13 10:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(263964, 17363, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great colors and the patterns are very abstract, almost surreal.  Great capture.</td>', 'Great colors and the patterns are very abstract, almost surreal.  Great capture.', '2003-04-13 10:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(263965, 17466, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very good color.  Great macro.  I like the framing and the exposure is just right.  Very well focused and sharp.  Nice job</td>', 'Very good color.  Great macro.  I like the framing and the exposure is just right.  Very well focused and sharp.  Nice job', '2003-04-13 10:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(263974, 17293, 6975, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing melding of colors</td>', 'Very pleasing melding of colors', '2003-04-13 11:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(263975, 17509, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very effective picture; clear and crisp.  Couple of suggestions for whatever they are worth: would have liked to see the colors lined up diagnolly instead of as they randomly appear.  Smudges are distracting. The brown (blue dust on green) was also distracting.  I think it is because the picture is so clear that these imperfections become magnified. As I said, nice shot!</td>', 'Very effective picture; clear and crisp.  Couple of suggestions for whatever they are worth: would have liked to see the colors lined up diagnolly instead of as they randomly appear.  Smudges are distracting. The brown (blue dust on green) was also distracting.  I think it is because the picture is so clear that these imperfections become magnified. As I said, nice shot!', '2003-04-13 11:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(263976, 16784, 6975, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2003-04-13 11:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(263977, 17546, 6975, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the red background</td>', 'Don''t care for the red background', '2003-04-13 11:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(263983, 17040, 6667, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I wish it were photgraphed on another base (no mirror).  The upper part is attractive then the lower part becomes busy witht he reflection.  Also would have eliminated, or at least minimized (I believe) the distortion .</td>', 'I like this.  I wish it were photgraphed on another base (no mirror).  The upper part is attractive then the lower part becomes busy witht he reflection.  Also would have eliminated, or at least minimized (I believe) the distortion .', '2003-04-13 11:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(263985, 17000, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting political tones, well done technically and creative - 7 - Mav</td>', 'Interesting political tones, well done technically and creative - 7 - Mav', '2003-04-13 11:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(263987, 17339, 6667, '<td valign="top">I like the randomness of this shot. I would have prefered a differnt background. The soft, out of focus reflections are distracting.  Black might have made the colors pop out.</td>', 'I like the randomness of this shot. I would have prefered a differnt background. The soft, out of focus reflections are distracting.  Black might have made the colors pop out.', '2003-04-13 11:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(263988, 17198, 509, '<td valign="top">I think this one will definitely get a ribbon...Great job on the focus and depth of field.  Yellow is well represented with this photo.</td>', 'I think this one will definitely get a ribbon...Great job on the focus and depth of field.  Yellow is well represented with this photo.', '2003-04-13 11:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(263990, 17202, 6975, '<td valign="top">Very Pleasing to the eye</td>', 'Very Pleasing to the eye', '2003-04-13 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(263991, 17267, 5176, '<td valign="top">They seem a bit washed out for a color challenge<br/></td>', 'They seem a bit washed out for a color challenge', '2003-04-13 11:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(263992, 17467, 509, '<td valign="top">Well done, one of my favorites this week, I really can''t think of anything i''d change to improve it</td>', 'Well done, one of my favorites this week, I really can''t think of anything i''d change to improve it', '2003-04-13 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(263995, 17461, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot.  For what it worth - I would have prefered a more horizontal cropping giving the goose a place to swim from and to since the feet and bubbles are suggesting motion through the water.  Color and contrast of black and grey tones of water make this a very sharp.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very pretty shot.  For what it worth - I would have prefered a more horizontal cropping giving the goose a place to swim from and to since the feet and bubbles are suggesting motion through the water.  Color and contrast of black and grey tones of water make this a very sharp.  Nicely done.', '2003-04-13 11:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(263998, 17438, 5176, '<td valign="top">Very good meets the challenge perfectly a bit noisey though 9</td>', 'Very good meets the challenge perfectly a bit noisey though 9', '2003-04-13 12:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(264001, 17513, 772, '<td valign="top">This is excellent... the color is definitely dominant in the image.. makes a good ''product'' shot also.. nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'This is excellent... the color is definitely dominant in the image.. makes a good ''product'' shot also.. nice work :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(264003, 17404, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent abstract... the shapes are as strong as the colors... i like the composition as well... excellent shot :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent abstract... the shapes are as strong as the colors... i like the composition as well... excellent shot :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(264004, 17375, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent abstract... the color is strong.. - setzler</td>', 'excellent abstract... the color is strong.. - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(264005, 17297, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent use of ''blue'' in this shot.. the shallow depth of field creates a nice surrealistic and dreamy feel to this shot.. - setzler</td>', 'excellent use of ''blue'' in this shot.. the shallow depth of field creates a nice surrealistic and dreamy feel to this shot.. - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(264006, 17204, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition... The image feels like it is a little over exposed.. - setzler</td>', 'beautiful composition... The image feels like it is a little over exposed.. - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(264008, 17520, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful use of color... the shallow depth of field works beautifully in this shot.. = 10 - setzler</td>', 'beautiful use of color... the shallow depth of field works beautifully in this shot.. = 10 - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(264016, 17423, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot... i love the symbolism in the dogwood blossoms :) nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful shot... i love the symbolism in the dogwood blossoms :) nice work :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(264018, 17554, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.. the sky makes a great background for this photo.. - setzler</td>', 'excellent composition.. the sky makes a great background for this photo.. - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(264019, 17471, 772, '<td valign="top">i love the pastel colors in this shot... it looks like a painting.. nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'i love the pastel colors in this shot... it looks like a painting.. nice work :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(264020, 17425, 772, '<td valign="top">very strong color... makes me hungry :) - setzler</td>', 'very strong color... makes me hungry :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(264021, 16812, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... the green on green here is very strong... :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot... the green on green here is very strong... :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(264022, 17054, 772, '<td valign="top">i love the composition on this shot... the tilts seem to add a nice element to the photo... the image is just a tad ''noisy'' though... other than that, great work :) - setzler</td>', 'i love the composition on this shot... the tilts seem to add a nice element to the photo... the image is just a tad ''noisy'' though... other than that, great work :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(264030, 17219, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the detail on the texture here.  Combined with the shadows you have made a commonplace subject interesting and vivid.  Suggestion for improvement:  maybe a polarizer filter to cut the glare on the doorknob<br/>Nice job</td>', 'I like the detail on the texture here.  Combined with the shadows you have made a commonplace subject interesting and vivid.  Suggestion for improvement:  maybe a polarizer filter to cut the glare on the doorknobNice job', '2003-04-13 12:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(264031, 17361, 509, '<td valign="top">Very creative, I think this would be very hard to do, but I think it would look even better if the lighters were all lit = )</td>', 'Very creative, I think this would be very hard to do, but I think it would look even better if the lighters were all lit = )', '2003-04-13 12:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(264042, 17350, 2350, '<td valign="top">Very creative, sharp and colorful.</td>', 'Very creative, sharp and colorful.', '2003-04-13 12:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(264044, 17389, 2350, '<td valign="top">WHAT!!  After going back and checking my votes I think I understand the red, white and blue,  Very clear and  great shot. Changing vote to an eight.  Good luck!</td>', 'WHAT!!  After going back and checking my votes I think I understand the red, white and blue,  Very clear and  great shot. Changing vote to an eight.  Good luck!', '2003-04-13 12:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(264064, 17224, 7887, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation of the challenge</td>', 'Interesting interpretation of the challenge', '2003-04-13 13:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(264067, 17364, 7887, '<td valign="top">very creative, nice composition</td>', 'very creative, nice composition', '2003-04-13 13:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(264079, 17226, 4805, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, clear shot. Great DOF. The composition might have benefitted from croppin gthe leaf on the far right, but a matter of preference more than anything. Great, and good luck.</td>', 'Very sharp, clear shot. Great DOF. The composition might have benefitted from croppin gthe leaf on the far right, but a matter of preference more than anything. Great, and good luck.', '2003-04-13 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(264080, 17204, 4805, '<td valign="top">Great hi-key shot. The slight overexposure is more than compensated for by the simplicity it brings. Very nice...</td>', 'Great hi-key shot. The slight overexposure is more than compensated for by the simplicity it brings. Very nice...', '2003-04-13 13:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(264082, 17364, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice primary shot. The texture in the towels brings out a nice range of tones. Great example, too, of how a good border can help. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice primary shot. The texture in the towels brings out a nice range of tones. Great example, too, of how a good border can help. Nicely done.', '2003-04-13 13:55:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(264083, 17113, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice...good take on a contemporary cliché. The soft focus works very well.</td>', 'Nice...good take on a contemporary cliché. The soft focus works very well.', '2003-04-13 13:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(264084, 17043, 7778, '<td valign="top">Perfect, delicious, crisp, balanced! Even the finger nails are manicured!</td>', 'Perfect, delicious, crisp, balanced! Even the finger nails are manicured!', '2003-04-13 13:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(264085, 17412, 6523, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but I''m really curious as to how you got the picture photo without spot editing.</td>', 'I like the photo, but I''m really curious as to how you got the picture photo without spot editing.', '2003-04-13 14:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(264088, 17581, 7778, '<td valign="top">Nice play between the static vases and the light oval. Subject(s) could have a bit more room and or assymetrically offset, if I can trust my ''sense''. Also, a lil oversharpened?</td>', 'Nice play between the static vases and the light oval. Subject(s) could have a bit more room and or assymetrically offset, if I can trust my ''sense''. Also, a lil oversharpened?', '2003-04-13 14:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(264089, 16923, 7778, '<td valign="top">Hm, still waiting for the tail to pull into the picture. Yummy colours.</td>', 'Hm, still waiting for the tail to pull into the picture. Yummy colours.', '2003-04-13 14:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(264093, 16794, 7778, '<td valign="top">On topic, nice idea, still.. the colours are too ''pushed'' for my liking.</td>', 'On topic, nice idea, still.. the colours are too ''pushed'' for my liking.', '2003-04-13 14:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(264094, 17348, 6597, '<td valign="top">good texture</td>', 'good texture', '2003-04-13 14:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(264095, 17471, 7778, '<td valign="top">Neither colours, nor material texture appeal to my taste. Considering what was intended, I would think this a successful shot, however. The composition is good as well.</td>', 'Neither colours, nor material texture appeal to my taste. Considering what was intended, I would think this a successful shot, however. The composition is good as well.', '2003-04-13 14:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(264096, 17589, 7778, '<td valign="top">Ah, if only the tulip showed a comparable minimal presence... The vase is soo sweet!</td>', 'Ah, if only the tulip showed a comparable minimal presence... The vase is soo sweet!', '2003-04-13 14:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(264099, 17407, 7778, '<td valign="top">This is a lil too symmetrical given the captured parts. At least the background is way too light and (therefore) distracting from the blossom.</td>', 'This is a lil too symmetrical given the captured parts. At least the background is way too light and (therefore) distracting from the blossom.', '2003-04-13 14:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(264100, 17586, 7778, '<td valign="top">Lovely. The colours certainly aren''t lurid, but what a charme! This picture even captures scent!</td>', 'Lovely. The colours certainly aren''t lurid, but what a charme! This picture even captures scent!', '2003-04-13 14:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
