(264220, 17277, 4007, '<td valign="top">Needs a sharper focus and a different crop.  Especially the "ura qt" being somewhat blurry creates problems for the shot.  Also the empty space at the top, bottom, and right side don''t seem to serve a function, so a tighter crop would probably be prefered if you wanted to leave your subject centered.  I like the "path" idea that you used, but this needs a little cleaner execution.</td>', 'Needs a sharper focus and a different crop.  Especially the "ura qt" being somewhat blurry creates problems for the shot.  Also the empty space at the top, bottom, and right side don''t seem to serve a function, so a tighter crop would probably be prefered if you wanted to leave your subject centered.  I like the "path" idea that you used, but this needs a little cleaner execution.', '2003-04-13 17:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(264221, 17567, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about all the shadowing.</td>', 'I''m not sure about all the shadowing.', '2003-04-13 17:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
