(264246, 17482, 6172, '<td valign="top">Gives me chills just looking at it.  Nice job on the photo, I hope your weather is better by now!</td>', 'Gives me chills just looking at it.  Nice job on the photo, I hope your weather is better by now!', '2003-04-13 18:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
