(264249, 17265, 7778, '<td valign="top">The colours are wonderful. I also like the simplicity. The window set so far into the top left, however, makes for a somewhat forced composition. I''m also left hungry for either a stronger reflected tree (off the glass) or no reflection in lieu of curtain texture (folds, creases, detail).</td>', 'The colours are wonderful. I also like the simplicity. The window set so far into the top left, however, makes for a somewhat forced composition. I''m also left hungry for either a stronger reflected tree (off the glass) or no reflection in lieu of curtain texture (folds, creases, detail).', '2003-04-13 18:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(264250, 17272, 7778, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Not sure about choice of subject (lacking in impact because of it, IMO).</td>', 'Good photo. Not sure about choice of subject (lacking in impact because of it, IMO).', '2003-04-13 18:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(264251, 17040, 6172, '<td valign="top">The only very tiny thing I found wrong with this photo at all (and you probably think I''m nitpicking, which maybe I am), was the slightly crookedness of the lines in the lower right.  I gotta love this photo, I think it will place.</td>', 'The only very tiny thing I found wrong with this photo at all (and you probably think I''m nitpicking, which maybe I am), was the slightly crookedness of the lines in the lower right.  I gotta love this photo, I think it will place.', '2003-04-13 18:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
