(264364, 17178, 6667, '<td valign="top">. . . well not me!  The patches of green broke the mood.  How about a crop of just a bust shot.  Might have made it even more mysterious.  Like the softnes of the shot.</td>', '. . . well not me!  The patches of green broke the mood.  How about a crop of just a bust shot.  Might have made it even more mysterious.  Like the softnes of the shot.', '2003-04-13 22:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
