(264374, 16943, 6667, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  How about a vertical crop with more of the stem. Bud is blured so crop it out.  If possible the blue  should have been the entire background.   Christmas cactus?</td>', 'Very pretty.  How about a vertical crop with more of the stem. Bud is blured so crop it out.  If possible the blue  should have been the entire background.   Christmas cactus?', '2003-04-13 22:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
