(264386, 17345, 6667, '<td valign="top">Rule of thirds.  Never (ok almost never) in the center.  The sharp colors of the lighthouse might have been even more dramatic with more blue contrast and less rock .</td>', 'Rule of thirds.  Never (ok almost never) in the center.  The sharp colors of the lighthouse might have been even more dramatic with more blue contrast and less rock .', '2003-04-13 23:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(264388, 17380, 3102, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Just got off a ship on Friday -- which one is this?  We were also on a Royal Caribbean ship!  Awesome sky and composition -- super job!  - 10</td>', 'Beautiful!  Just got off a ship on Friday -- which one is this?  We were also on a Royal Caribbean ship!  Awesome sky and composition -- super job!  - 10', '2003-04-13 23:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(264390, 17305, 7067, '<td valign="top">I like the soft colours of this photograph and appreciate the subtle highlights in the rocks and water.  The exposure is spot on for me.</td>', 'I like the soft colours of this photograph and appreciate the subtle highlights in the rocks and water.  The exposure is spot on for me.', '2003-04-13 23:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(264391, 17393, 7067, '<td valign="top">This is like a dream or a painting I''ve seen a thousand times in my head.  Good capture of the setting sun and colours of the sky.</td>', 'This is like a dream or a painting I''ve seen a thousand times in my head.  Good capture of the setting sun and colours of the sky.', '2003-04-13 23:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(264392, 17470, 7067, '<td valign="top">The most striking thing about this Color challenge submission is the almost total absence of color except for the tinge of red in her lips and hair.  In my eyes, this works well.  As does positioning your model on the extreme right of the frame.  I also like the subtle shades of cream in the background.  Only question is, what''s with the title?</td>', 'The most striking thing about this Color challenge submission is the almost total absence of color except for the tinge of red in her lips and hair.  In my eyes, this works well.  As does positioning your model on the extreme right of the frame.  I also like the subtle shades of cream in the background.  Only question is, what''s with the title?', '2003-04-13 23:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(264393, 17369, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like how the yellow stands out agains the darkness here... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'I really like how the yellow stands out agains the darkness here... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 23:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(264394, 17357, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot and great use of shallow depth of field... this may be juuuuusst a tad oversharpened, but the color is excellent :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot and great use of shallow depth of field... this may be juuuuusst a tad oversharpened, but the color is excellent :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 23:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(264395, 17131, 772, '<td valign="top">very strong color... nice macro also :) - setzler</td>', 'very strong color... nice macro also :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 23:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(264397, 17432, 7067, '<td valign="top">I really like the uneven lighting across the flower, where the petals on the left are brighter than the ones on the bottom.  I''m not sure I like the positioning of the flower in the center of the image.  Maybe leaving more black on the top left corner would work better for me.</td>', 'I really like the uneven lighting across the flower, where the petals on the left are brighter than the ones on the bottom.  I''m not sure I like the positioning of the flower in the center of the image.  Maybe leaving more black on the top left corner would work better for me.', '2003-04-13 23:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(264398, 17294, 772, '<td valign="top">the curves in this shot are excellent... the contrast between the brown and green also makes nice color impact.. - setzler</td>', 'the curves in this shot are excellent... the contrast between the brown and green also makes nice color impact.. - setzler', '2003-04-13 23:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(264399, 17552, 5418, '<td valign="top">Down with the King! (Run-DMC reference)</td>', 'Down with the King! (Run-DMC reference)', '2003-04-13 23:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(264400, 17227, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent color... are these cherry blossoms?  the dark background sets them off very nicely :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent color... are these cherry blossoms?  the dark background sets them off very nicely :) - setzler', '2003-04-13 23:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(264401, 17054, 1031, '<td valign="top">According to the "rules" i''ve been reading, this should be flopped so the stars arre in the upper-left as you look at it. Good color &amp; stop-action...</td>', 'According to the "rules" i''ve been reading, this should be flopped so the stars arre in the upper-left as you look at it. Good color & stop-action...', '2003-04-13 23:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(264403, 17477, 7067, '<td valign="top">Good use of the flowers to frame your subject here.  The unusual purple shades work for me.</td>', 'Good use of the flowers to frame your subject here.  The unusual purple shades work for me.', '2003-04-13 23:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(264404, 17348, 7067, '<td valign="top">These cherry tomatoes look so fresh and real that I just want to reach into this photo and pluck them out!  I like the play of light and shadow on the tomatoes and the water drops.  Composition is also pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'These cherry tomatoes look so fresh and real that I just want to reach into this photo and pluck them out!  I like the play of light and shadow on the tomatoes and the water drops.  Composition is also pleasing to the eye.', '2003-04-13 23:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(264405, 17198, 4877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  Incredible detail.  A little more in focus detail in the flower would have been great (depth of field), but I love that the background is completely out of focus.  With a moving subject like this, you''ve done a great job!  Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  Incredible detail.  A little more in focus detail in the flower would have been great (depth of field), but I love that the background is completely out of focus.  With a moving subject like this, you''ve done a great job!  Well done!', '2003-04-13 23:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(264406, 17579, 7067, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours on this bird.  The mssing beak looks odd to me though.  At first I thought there were two birds but now I''m not so sure if there''s just one bird looking into a mirror.</td>', 'Wonderful colours on this bird.  The mssing beak looks odd to me though.  At first I thought there were two birds but now I''m not so sure if there''s just one bird looking into a mirror.', '2003-04-13 23:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(264408, 17313, 4877, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo!  Great detail in the clouds.  Not your everyday view!  Beautiful tones.  Border works very well with this shot!  I''m guessing this was taken mid-air?  Would be interested to know how you got such a clear view!</td>', 'Incredible photo!  Great detail in the clouds.  Not your everyday view!  Beautiful tones.  Border works very well with this shot!  I''m guessing this was taken mid-air?  Would be interested to know how you got such a clear view!', '2003-04-13 23:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(264411, 17383, 7067, '<td valign="top">The bluish grass just doesn''t look right to me.  I''m guessing that the colour settings were adjusted to bring out the blue in the peacock, but I think there''s too much of a blue cast on the entire image, rendering the grass an unrealistic colour.</td>', 'The bluish grass just doesn''t look right to me.  I''m guessing that the colour settings were adjusted to bring out the blue in the peacock, but I think there''s too much of a blue cast on the entire image, rendering the grass an unrealistic colour.', '2003-04-13 23:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(264412, 17462, 4877, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at its best!  Great shot and really well lit!  Maybe slightly on the soft side which adds to the overall effect (if thats what you were aiming for, it is nice).  I''d have liked it a tiny bit sharper, but thats just me!  Well done!</td>', 'Simplicity at its best!  Great shot and really well lit!  Maybe slightly on the soft side which adds to the overall effect (if thats what you were aiming for, it is nice).  I''d have liked it a tiny bit sharper, but thats just me!  Well done!', '2003-04-13 23:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(264413, 17550, 4877, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Seen this glass (whatever it is) before.  Amazing colours and really well composed.  Keep up the great work :-)</td>', 'Wow!  Seen this glass (whatever it is) before.  Amazing colours and really well composed.  Keep up the great work :-)', '2003-04-13 23:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(264414, 17168, 4877, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  Really like the detail you have captured.  Nice use of Depth of Field.  Great colours - all natural.  I like the border, only suggestion would be to make the pink/purple border slightly thinner so as not to distract from the subject of your photo!  One of my top 7 for the week!  Keep up the great work!</td>', 'This is a great shot!  Really like the detail you have captured.  Nice use of Depth of Field.  Great colours - all natural.  I like the border, only suggestion would be to make the pink/purple border slightly thinner so as not to distract from the subject of your photo!  One of my top 7 for the week!  Keep up the great work!', '2003-04-13 23:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(264415, 17133, 4877, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is great!  Well captured, nice detail and well composed!  I''m biassed towards the natural colours!  One of my top 7 for the week!  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow!  This is great!  Well captured, nice detail and well composed!  I''m biassed towards the natural colours!  One of my top 7 for the week!  Good luck!', '2003-04-13 23:49:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(264416, 17204, 4877, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo!  Amazingly vivid colours.  Well composed.  Border works extremely well.  I like the fact this is slightly over-exposed.  It boosts the colours well!  One of my top 7 for the week!  Good luck!</td>', 'Very cool photo!  Amazingly vivid colours.  Well composed.  Border works extremely well.  I like the fact this is slightly over-exposed.  It boosts the colours well!  One of my top 7 for the week!  Good luck!', '2003-04-13 23:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(264417, 17135, 1031, '<td valign="top">I used to handle some of this...nice pieces!</td>', 'I used to handle some of this...nice pieces!', '2003-04-13 23:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(264421, 17258, 5070, '<td valign="top">What a cute puppy. The focus is too soft -- so that it looks not well focussed on the pup''s face.  Also, it would look better with a single colored fabric in the background rather than furniture.</td>', 'What a cute puppy. The focus is too soft -- so that it looks not well focussed on the pup''s face.  Also, it would look better with a single colored fabric in the background rather than furniture.', '2003-04-13 23:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(264422, 17379, 3280, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the week, the color of the blue is awesome. The set up is great as is the lighting.  Great job!</td>', 'My favorite of the week, the color of the blue is awesome. The set up is great as is the lighting.  Great job!', '2003-04-13 23:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(264423, 17345, 3280, '<td valign="top">One of my top five this week.  I love the blue and the lighthouse roof is excellent. I wonder how this would have looked with the lighthouse off to the right?</td>', 'One of my top five this week.  I love the blue and the lighthouse roof is excellent. I wonder how this would have looked with the lighthouse off to the right?', '2003-04-13 23:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(264426, 17581, 3280, '<td valign="top">Not generally my kind of photo but this one is really done well.  Top five for me. The shape of the colored lights is what really makes it IMHO.  Great job!</td>', 'Not generally my kind of photo but this one is really done well.  Top five for me. The shape of the colored lights is what really makes it IMHO.  Great job!', '2003-04-14 00:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(264429, 16817, 5070, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I like the way you include the fence in the photo.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I like the way you include the fence in the photo.', '2003-04-14 00:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(264430, 17237, 3280, '<td valign="top">So simple and yet so excellent.  One of my top five this week!  Great colors and eye.  Too bad they didn''t paint it one shade of blue darker, I think it would have disappeared into that sky!!</td>', 'So simple and yet so excellent.  One of my top five this week!  Great colors and eye.  Too bad they didn''t paint it one shade of blue darker, I think it would have disappeared into that sky!!', '2003-04-14 00:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(264433, 17477, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, one of my top five this week.  The mood is incredible as is the framing and color.  Great, great job.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, one of my top five this week.  The mood is incredible as is the framing and color.  Great, great job.', '2003-04-14 00:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(264434, 17384, 5070, '<td valign="top">Interesting ... different...I like it.  It would be even more attractive if you could have the upper left (blue source) sharply focussed.</td>', 'Interesting ... different...I like it.  It would be even more attractive if you could have the upper left (blue source) sharply focussed.', '2003-04-14 00:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(264441, 16995, 5070, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...different idea...I like it.</td>', 'Nicely done...different idea...I like it.', '2003-04-14 00:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(264445, 17357, 5070, '<td valign="top">Terrific - bluish background is perfect. Wish you had included more of the blue/purple flower on the right and had the big yellow flower a bit more to the left rather than centered.</td>', 'Terrific - bluish background is perfect. Wish you had included more of the blue/purple flower on the right and had the big yellow flower a bit more to the left rather than centered.', '2003-04-14 00:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(264448, 17232, 5070, '<td valign="top">Terrific detail. Find the blue of the background just a bit too bright and distracting, however. I''d prefer more of it covered by ribbons.</td>', 'Terrific detail. Find the blue of the background just a bit too bright and distracting, however. I''d prefer more of it covered by ribbons.', '2003-04-14 00:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(264450, 17307, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love purple, so anything purple will win me pretty fast. I like though the simple touch of the green egg to add some contrast.</td>', 'I love purple, so anything purple will win me pretty fast. I like though the simple touch of the green egg to add some contrast.', '2003-04-14 00:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(264451, 17550, 7706, '<td valign="top">Great background, and I love the way the glass looks, and ow it picks up the bg colors. Is that a glass or a vase, its cool I want one? lol</td>', 'Great background, and I love the way the glass looks, and ow it picks up the bg colors. Is that a glass or a vase, its cool I want one? lol', '2003-04-14 00:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(264453, 17309, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like the use of colors, and the simplicity of the photo. The light looks a tiny bit off center, but its really a problem.  Must have been hard making sure the balls did not roll off lol</td>', 'I like the use of colors, and the simplicity of the photo. The light looks a tiny bit off center, but its really a problem.  Must have been hard making sure the balls did not roll off lol', '2003-04-14 00:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(264455, 16795, 7706, '<td valign="top">He is a true cutie. Love the fact that his eyes match the surrounding areas. He looks a tiny but out of focus, but I still really like the photo</td>', 'He is a true cutie. Love the fact that his eyes match the surrounding areas. He looks a tiny but out of focus, but I still really like the photo', '2003-04-14 00:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(264456, 16784, 7706, '<td valign="top">simple but effective</td>', 'simple but effective', '2003-04-14 00:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(264459, 17072, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love it wheb single colors stand out in the gray surroundings. Was this done by desaturation, or did you use gray crayons with your own labeling. It looks cool :)</td>', 'I love it wheb single colors stand out in the gray surroundings. Was this done by desaturation, or did you use gray crayons with your own labeling. It looks cool :)', '2003-04-14 00:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(264460, 17496, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is so very peaceful!</td>', 'This is so very peaceful!', '2003-04-14 00:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(264461, 17558, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting</td>', 'I love the lighting', '2003-04-14 00:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(264462, 17337, 7706, '<td valign="top">great use of color. Nice macro shot too :) Well done :)</td>', 'great use of color. Nice macro shot too :) Well done :)', '2003-04-14 00:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(264464, 17502, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love how you focused on one color for the challenge, and that you really I guess went further, by giving it a love theme :)</td>', 'I love how you focused on one color for the challenge, and that you really I guess went further, by giving it a love theme :)', '2003-04-14 00:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(264465, 17303, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like this shot :) Really simple, great macro, wonderful colors. I love the white backdround choice.</td>', 'I like this shot :) Really simple, great macro, wonderful colors. I love the white backdround choice.', '2003-04-14 00:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(264466, 17556, 7706, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo :)</td>', 'Really nice photo :)', '2003-04-14 00:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(264467, 17401, 7706, '<td valign="top">The purple looks fantastic against the green leaves. Good choice. What sort of lighting did you use?</td>', 'The purple looks fantastic against the green leaves. Good choice. What sort of lighting did you use?', '2003-04-14 00:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(264468, 17368, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. It would have been a fantastic photo for the current weather challenge too. :)</td>', 'I love this photo. It would have been a fantastic photo for the current weather challenge too. :)', '2003-04-14 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(264470, 17586, 7706, '<td valign="top">Where I work, I see a lot of different images of roses. Generally they are actually drawings, but the colors and the actual flowers never look this nice :)</td>', 'Where I work, I see a lot of different images of roses. Generally they are actually drawings, but the colors and the actual flowers never look this nice :)', '2003-04-14 00:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(264471, 17583, 7706, '<td valign="top">Something about this photo I really like. I love the fact that the foucs is on the paint and how the rest is blurry. Keep it up :)</td>', 'Something about this photo I really like. I love the fact that the foucs is on the paint and how the rest is blurry. Keep it up :)', '2003-04-14 00:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(264472, 17417, 7706, '<td valign="top">Night shots are one of the hardest to take. I know from experience. I like the blured look you have going.</td>', 'Night shots are one of the hardest to take. I know from experience. I like the blured look you have going.', '2003-04-14 00:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(264475, 17205, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like the black in the back. Would like to have seen it on the table too, to just make the colors stand out more, and make them brighter. I do like your lighting :)</td>', 'I like the black in the back. Would like to have seen it on the table too, to just make the colors stand out more, and make them brighter. I do like your lighting :)', '2003-04-14 00:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(264478, 17335, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection on the table. It looks good :) The only thing about the reflection that I don''t like, which is probably hard to get rid of, is the reflecting light. Great job though :)</td>', 'I love the reflection on the table. It looks good :) The only thing about the reflection that I don''t like, which is probably hard to get rid of, is the reflecting light. Great job though :)', '2003-04-14 00:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(264479, 17123, 7706, '<td valign="top">I love the colors :) bright, yet pastelly</td>', 'I love the colors :) bright, yet pastelly', '2003-04-14 00:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(264480, 17116, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have edited the colors here :)</td>', 'I like the way you have edited the colors here :)', '2003-04-14 00:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(264481, 17375, 6870, '<td valign="top">COlor, pure and simple. An engaging, interesting shot.</td>', 'COlor, pure and simple. An engaging, interesting shot.', '2003-04-14 00:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(264483, 17218, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. i love how you''ve equated color with culture here, except the glasses themselves don''t really seem "African". But the designs do. I like it!</td>', 'Interesting effect. i love how you''ve equated color with culture here, except the glasses themselves don''t really seem "African". But the designs do. I like it!', '2003-04-14 00:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(264487, 17404, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey, I always appreciate a macro musical shot! You''ve done a good job at capturing "Brass!"</td>', 'Hey, I always appreciate a macro musical shot! You''ve done a good job at capturing "Brass!"', '2003-04-14 00:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(264488, 17329, 6870, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and point of view. DOF is great, too. Lovely shot. I wish the sky were as lovely as the flowers.</td>', 'Great perspective and point of view. DOF is great, too. Lovely shot. I wish the sky were as lovely as the flowers.', '2003-04-14 00:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(264490, 17209, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pink is right! The color is what brings life and personality to these blossoms.</td>', 'Pink is right! The color is what brings life and personality to these blossoms.', '2003-04-14 00:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(264491, 17590, 3459, '<td valign="top">I love this image, it is too bad that most people will expect something highly saturated this challenge. An 8!<br/></td>', 'I love this image, it is too bad that most people will expect something highly saturated this challenge. An 8!', '2003-04-14 00:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(264492, 17190, 6550, '<td valign="top">hehehe good title</td>', 'hehehe good title', '2003-04-14 00:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(264494, 17550, 4207, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Now i know what subject to use to win;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-04-14 00:02:14.</i></td>', 'Congrats! Now i know what subject to use to win;)', '2003-04-14 01:01:44.000000', '2003-04-14 01:02:14.000000', 0),
(264495, 17550, 4877, '<td valign="top">Congratulations McMurma!<br/> <br/>Fantastic result!  Deserved the win :-)</td>', 'Congratulations McMurma! Fantastic result!  Deserved the win :-)', '2003-04-14 01:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(264496, 17198, 4877, '<td valign="top">Congrats Mirac!<br/> <br/>Well done.  Was a fantastic photo :-)</td>', 'Congrats Mirac! Well done.  Was a fantastic photo :-)', '2003-04-14 01:02:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(264497, 17305, 4877, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for all the great comments!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for all the great comments!', '2003-04-14 01:03:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(264503, 17460, 7291, '<td valign="top">You were robbed!  Why isn''t this in the top 10!?!?!  My favorite.</td>', 'You were robbed!  Why isn''t this in the top 10!?!?!  My favorite.', '2003-04-14 01:05:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(264506, 17550, 3280, '<td valign="top">Congrats Mc!  Well deserved win!</td>', 'Congrats Mc!  Well deserved win!', '2003-04-14 01:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(264511, 17466, 1280, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to comment on this before but I love it.  Great work!  I like the neg space usage, the crop, the whole kit and kaboodle.</td>', 'I didn''t get to comment on this before but I love it.  Great work!  I like the neg space usage, the crop, the whole kit and kaboodle.', '2003-04-14 01:12:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(264513, 17305, 6900, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the week!  I''m so glad it did well.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the week!  I''m so glad it did well.', '2003-04-14 01:12:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(264514, 17072, 1344, '<td valign="top">You were so robbed...  I think this should have finished much higher!</td>', 'You were so robbed...  I think this should have finished much higher!', '2003-04-14 01:13:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(264517, 17550, 7067, '<td valign="top">Oh do tell what you used for the background to get such vivid colours!</td>', 'Oh do tell what you used for the background to get such vivid colours!', '2003-04-14 01:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(264523, 17550, 1717, '<td valign="top">congratulations Mc!!!  gorgeous photo...well deserved 1st place!</td>', 'congratulations Mc!!!  gorgeous photo...well deserved 1st place!', '2003-04-14 01:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(264524, 17484, 6900, '<td valign="top">Congrats!</td>', 'Congrats!', '2003-04-14 01:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(264527, 17558, 1344, '<td valign="top">I guess a lot of people didn''t get this photo..  I was going for the dramatic lighting.  Think my problem was blowing out the windshield and bumper a bit..  Thanks for the helpful &amp; friendly comments to those that left em.</td>', 'I guess a lot of people didn''t get this photo..  I was going for the dramatic lighting.  Think my problem was blowing out the windshield and bumper a bit..  Thanks for the helpful & friendly comments to those that left em.', '2003-04-14 01:16:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(264530, 17305, 1717, '<td valign="top">congrats on 2nd place!  beautiful photo!</td>', 'congrats on 2nd place!  beautiful photo!', '2003-04-14 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(264534, 17198, 1717, '<td valign="top">congratulations, Mirac!  beautiful!!</td>', 'congratulations, Mirac!  beautiful!!', '2003-04-14 01:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(264536, 17579, 1280, '<td valign="top">This was taken under a very bright, white tent.  The unidentified object in the upper right is some metal hardware that helped keep the tent up.  I couldn''t avoid it.  <br/>The demonstrative bird has a white face, thus it blended, or rather disappeared into the white bg.  If I had waited for the bird to move his face I wouldn''t have gotten this shot of his wings extended. I grabbed it!!!</td>', 'This was taken under a very bright, white tent.  The unidentified object in the upper right is some metal hardware that helped keep the tent up.  I couldn''t avoid it.  The demonstrative bird has a white face, thus it blended, or rather disappeared into the white bg.  If I had waited for the bird to move his face I wouldn''t have gotten this shot of his wings extended. I grabbed it!!!', '2003-04-14 01:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(264540, 17550, 4494, '<td valign="top">Please send me this glass so I can win one. :)  Great job, and well deserved win!</td>', 'Please send me this glass so I can win one. :)  Great job, and well deserved win!', '2003-04-14 01:20:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(264541, 17198, 4267, '<td valign="top">awesome macro... you can even see the pollen all over his body... wow! this should have won</td>', 'awesome macro... you can even see the pollen all over his body... wow! this should have won', '2003-04-14 01:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(264546, 17204, 1280, '<td valign="top">Didn''t have a chance to comment during voting.  Sorry! Very nice.</td>', 'Didn''t have a chance to comment during voting.  Sorry! Very nice.', '2003-04-14 01:22:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(264576, 17329, 1280, '<td valign="top">Gordon,<br/>Didn''t have a chance to comment during voting.  Sorry! But this is beautiful.  Good job!<br/>Grayce</td>', 'Gordon,Didn''t have a chance to comment during voting.  Sorry! But this is beautiful.  Good job!Grayce', '2003-04-14 01:29:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(264608, 16852, 7504, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your kind comments!  Yes it is Lottie, but I''m not dsidwell!  Sorry for confusing some of you by using the same model as my husband''s photo from "From Above".  I thought she wouldn''t be recognized, but guess I was wrong.  I think she''ll be retiring now.</td>', 'Thanks for all your kind comments!  Yes it is Lottie, but I''m not dsidwell!  Sorry for confusing some of you by using the same model as my husband''s photo from "From Above".  I thought she wouldn''t be recognized, but guess I was wrong.  I think she''ll be retiring now.', '2003-04-14 01:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(264623, 17550, 806, '<td valign="top">It''s okay. go ahead and use this glass again! I love it! Bravo and Congrats!</td>', 'It''s okay. go ahead and use this glass again! I love it! Bravo and Congrats!', '2003-04-14 01:43:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(264643, 17341, 3900, '<td valign="top">For those wondering about saturation and natural colors, there was no saturation or change of colors made.<br/> <br/>This is all natural as seen through a near-infrared filter.</td>', 'For those wondering about saturation and natural colors, there was no saturation or change of colors made. This is all natural as seen through a near-infrared filter.', '2003-04-14 01:48:28.000000', NULL, 0),
