(270983, 17389, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club :)<br/> <br/>Hi Tin...<br/> <br/>I really like the composition on this photo... the three glasses with the reflections underneath work very well overall...  The first issue that I see that is not working very well is the background.  The imperfections in it are somewhat awkward in the composition.  The lighting is also working against your ''red white blue'' theme by casting a yellow tint to everything in the image.  It may be possible to correct some of this with white balance adjustments in your camera.  Another compositional adjustment that could possibly work well here would be to move the glasses lower in the frame and leave your empty space at the top.<br/> <br/>John Setzler<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club :) Hi Tin... I really like the composition on this photo... the three glasses with the reflections underneath work very well overall...  The first issue that I see that is not working very well is the background.  The imperfections in it are somewhat awkward in the composition.  The lighting is also working against your ''red white blue'' theme by casting a yellow tint to everything in the image.  It may be possible to correct some of this with white balance adjustments in your camera.  Another compositional adjustment that could possibly work well here would be to move the glasses lower in the frame and leave your empty space at the top. John Setzler', '2003-04-19 15:17:40.000000', NULL, 0),
