(279163, 17000, 1031, '<td valign="top">I really like the multiple levels of meaning in this photo. Unfortunately, one of your''s was somewhat obscured by my own color-blindness (ophthamological), and so I didn''t make as strong a connection with the speech. Yet another time I would have liked to read your notes before voting...great job.</td>', 'I really like the multiple levels of meaning in this photo. Unfortunately, one of your''s was somewhat obscured by my own color-blindness (ophthamological), and so I didn''t make as strong a connection with the speech. Yet another time I would have liked to read your notes before voting...great job.', '2003-04-26 11:33:34.000000', NULL, 0),
