(476114, 17363, 11769, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Abstract Expressionists of the 50s and 60s.  Great feeling to the paint and composition. Way back in the 70s I used to paint an abstract painting and then paint a realist one of it and sometimes the room it was in or the street I placed it in. It gives me the feeling of those paintings.</td>', 'Reminds me of the Abstract Expressionists of the 50s and 60s.  Great feeling to the paint and composition. Way back in the 70s I used to paint an abstract painting and then paint a realist one of it and sometimes the room it was in or the street I placed it in. It gives me the feeling of those paintings.', '2003-11-06 22:50:12.000000', NULL, 0),
